#: src/introduction.md:1
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "はじめに"

#: src/introduction.md:3
msgid ""
"This manual describes exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1. With ExchangeAlgebra, you "
"record transactions in Haskell as sums of exchange algebra terms, keep "
"journals, carry out bookkeeping procedures, and prepare financial "
"statements. It covers four layers of the library: Algebra, Journal, "
"Accounting, and IO. Start with [From journal entries to exchange algebra]"
"(overview.md) to see how a journal table corresponds to the algebraic "
"notation. For module documentation and the full API, see the [Haddock "
"reference on Hackage](https://hackage.haskell.org/package/exchangealgebra)."
msgstr ""
"このマニュアルは exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1 を対象とします. ExchangeAlgebra を使"
"うと, Haskell で取引を交換代数の項の和として記録し, 仕訳帳を作り, 簿記の手続"
"きを進めて財務諸表を作成できます. このマニュアルでは, ライブラリの Algebra, "
"Journal, Accounting, IO の 4 層を扱います. まず[仕訳から交換代数へ]"
"(overview.md)を読み, 仕訳帳の表と代数の記法がどう対応するかを確認してくださ"
"い. モジュールの説明と API の詳細は, [Hackage の Haddock リファレンス]"
"(https://hackage.haskell.org/package/exchangealgebra)を参照してください."

#: src/introduction.md:5
msgid "How this manual is organized"
msgstr "マニュアルの構成"

#: src/introduction.md:7
msgid ""
"The running example starts with a bank withdrawal on January 10 and follows "
"the shop’s January transactions through closing and financial statements. On "
"February 1, the shop forms a subsidiary and prepares an opening consolidated "
"balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"一連の例題では, 1 月 10 日の預金の引き出しから始め, 店の 1 月の取引を締めて財"
"務諸表を作成します. 2 月 1 日には, 店が子会社を設立し, 設立時点の連結貸借対照"
"表を作成します."

#: src/introduction.md:11
msgid ""
"Consult [Definitions and axioms](algebra/definitions.md) for the formal "
"rules for matching elements, adding terms, and separating debits from "
"credits, or go straight to [Installation and modules](usage/installation.md) "
"to start using the library."
msgstr ""
"要素の照合, 項の加算, 借方と貸方の分解を数式で確認するには[定義と公理]"
"(algebra/definitions.md)を参照し, ライブラリの利用から始める場合は[導入とモ"
"ジュール](usage/installation.md)に進んでください."

#: src/introduction.md:15
msgid ""
"In [Installation and modules](usage/installation.md), add the package to a "
"Stack project and select imports by layer."
msgstr ""
"[インストールとモジュール](usage/installation.md)では, Stack プロジェクトに"
"パッケージを追加し, 層ごとにインポートを選びます."

#: src/introduction.md:16
msgid ""
"In [Record a withdrawal](usage/withdrawal.md), write a journal entry in "
"exchange algebra and check that the debit and credit totals agree."
msgstr ""
"[引き出しを記録する](usage/withdrawal.md)では, 交換代数で仕訳を記録し, 借方と"
"貸方の合計が一致することを確かめます."

#: src/introduction.md:20
msgid ""
"In [Elements](algebra/elements.md), add a bank element and query bases by "
"bank."
msgstr ""
"[要素](algebra/elements.md)では, 銀行の要素を追加し, 銀行を指定して基底を問い"
"合わせます."

#: src/introduction.md:21
msgid ""
"In [Bases](algebra/bases.md), build a three-element base and update account "
"access."
msgstr ""
"[基底](algebra/bases.md)では, 3 要素の基底を作り, 勘定科目の読み取りと置き換"
"えの定義を更新します."

#: src/introduction.md:22
msgid ""
"In [Redundant and exchange algebras](algebra/redundant.md), choose an amount "
"type, work with the month's terms, and read debit and credit differences."
msgstr ""
"[冗長代数と交換代数](algebra/redundant.md)では, 金額の型を選び, 月内の項を演"
"算し, 借方と貸方の差額を求めます."

#: src/introduction.md:26
msgid ""
"In [Transfers](exchange/transfer.md), move part of the rent payment to "
"prepaid expenses and check the resulting balances."
msgstr ""
"[振替](exchange/transfer.md)では, 支払家賃の一部を前払費用に振り替え, 振替後"
"の残高を確認します."

#: src/introduction.md:27
msgid ""
"In [Journals](journal/journal.md), attach dates and descriptions to "
"transactions and select terms for January."
msgstr ""
"[仕訳帳](journal/journal.md)では, 取引に日付と説明を付け, 1 月の項を選び出し"
"ます."

#: src/introduction.md:28
msgid ""
"In [Multiple accounting entities](journal/agents.md), record the withdrawal "
"for both the shop and the bank and check each entity’s terms."
msgstr ""
"[複数の会計主体](journal/agents.md)では, 引き出しを店と銀行の双方について記録"
"し, 主体ごとに項を確認します."

#: src/introduction.md:32
msgid ""
"In [Account titles and their attributes](accounts/attributes.md), look up "
"how the library classifies an account title."
msgstr ""
"[勘定科目とその属性](accounts/attributes.md)では, ライブラリが勘定科目をどう"
"分類するか調べます."

#: src/introduction.md:33
msgid ""
"In [Built-in account titles](accounts/builtin.md), find an account title to "
"use in an entry."
msgstr ""
"[組み込みの勘定科目](accounts/builtin.md)では, 仕訳に使う勘定科目を探します."

#: src/introduction.md:37
msgid ""
"In [Checking a journal](bookkeeping/admission.md), express dollar cash in "
"yen and validate the January records for bookkeeping."
msgstr ""
"[仕訳帳の検査](bookkeeping/admission.md)では, ドル建ての現金を円で表し, 1 月"
"の記録を摘要ごとに検査します."

#: src/introduction.md:38
msgid ""
"In [Trial balance and checks](bookkeeping/trial-balance.md), compute debit "
"and credit totals and balances by account, then use `Audit.abnormalBalances` "
"to find balances on the side opposite an account's normal balance."
msgstr ""
"[試算表と点検](bookkeeping/trial-balance.md)では, 勘定ごとの借方合計, 貸方合"
"計, 残高を計算します. 次に, `Audit.abnormalBalances` で通常と反対側にある残高"
"を調べます."

#: src/introduction.md:39
msgid ""
"In [Adjusting entries](bookkeeping/adjustment.md), defer the rent for the "
"next period and record the inventory count."
msgstr ""
"[決算整理仕訳](bookkeeping/adjustment.md)では, 翌期分の家賃を繰り延べ, 棚卸結"
"果を記録します."

#: src/introduction.md:40
msgid ""
"In [Closing entries](bookkeeping/closing.md), close the revenue and expense "
"accounts and inspect the post-closing trial balance."
msgstr ""
"[決算振替](bookkeeping/closing.md)では, 収益と費用の決算振替を行い, 繰越試算"
"表を確認します."

#: src/introduction.md:41
msgid ""
"In [Financial statements](bookkeeping/statements.md), prepare January’s "
"income statement and balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"[財務諸表](bookkeeping/statements.md)では, 1 月の損益計算書と貸借対照表を作成"
"します."

#: src/introduction.md:42
msgid ""
"In [Consolidation](bookkeeping/consolidation.md), eliminate the shop’s "
"investment against the subsidiary’s capital to prepare the February 1 "
"consolidated balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"[連結](bookkeeping/consolidation.md)では, 店の投資と子会社の資本を相殺消去"
"し, 2 月 1 日時点の連結貸借対照表を作成します."

#: src/introduction.md:46
msgid ""
"In [Reading journals from CSV](io/input.md), import term rows and diagnose "
"an unknown account title and an unbalanced entry."
msgstr ""
"[CSV からの仕訳帳の読み込み](io/input.md)では, 項を行単位で取り込み, 未知の勘"
"定科目や貸借が一致しない仕訳を見つけます."

#: src/introduction.md:47
msgid ""
"In [Writing books and statements](io/output.md), produce CSV rows for the "
"journal, general ledger, trial balances, worksheet, and financial statements."
msgstr ""
"[帳簿と財務諸表の書き出し](io/output.md)では, 仕訳帳, 総勘定元帳, 試算表, 精"
"算表, 財務諸表を CSV の行に変換します."

#: src/overview.md:1
msgid "From journal entries to exchange algebra"
msgstr "仕訳から交換代数へ"

#: src/overview.md:3
msgid ""
"This page maps a journal written as a debit and credit table onto exchange "
"algebra notation, using four transactions of a small shop. It assumes "
"familiarity with double-entry bookkeeping and no knowledge of the algebra. "
"[Definitions and axioms](algebra/definitions.md) gives the formal "
"definitions."
msgstr ""
"小さな店舗の 4 件の取引を使い, 借方と貸方の表で書いた仕訳帳を交換代数の記法に"
"対応づけます. 複式簿記の知識を前提としますが, 交換代数の知識は必要ありませ"
"ん. 形式的な定義は[定義と公理](algebra/definitions.md)を参照してください."

#: src/overview.md:5
msgid "A journal as a table"
msgstr "表で表す仕訳帳"

#: src/overview.md:7
msgid ""
"Table 1 records the four transactions in a conventional journal. Each row "
"has one debit account and one credit account with the same amount."
msgstr ""
"表 1 は, 4 件の取引を通常の仕訳帳に記録したものです. 各行は, 同額の借方科目 "
"1 つと貸方科目 1 つからなります."

