msgstr "500"

#: src/overview.md:16
msgid ""
"_Table 1. Four journal entries of a small shop. The debit total and the "
"credit total are both 3,000._"
msgstr ""
"_表 1. 小さな店舗の 4 件の仕訳. 借方合計と貸方合計はともに 3,000 です._"

#: src/overview.md:18
msgid "The same journal in exchange algebra"
msgstr "同じ仕訳帳を交換代数で表す"

#: src/overview.md:20
msgid ""
"Exchange algebra writes an entry as a sum of terms $a : e$, where $a$ is a "
"nonnegative amount and $e$ is a base. Here a base is an account title in "
"angle brackets. A base with `Not`, such as $\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle$, "
"records an increase. A base with `Hat`, such as $\\widehat{\\langle "
"\\text{Cash} \\rangle}$, records a decrease. The four rows of Table 1 become:"
msgstr ""
"交換代数では, 仕訳を項 $a : e$ の和で表します. $a$ は非負の金額, $e$ は基底で"
"す. ここでは, 山括弧で囲んだ勘定科目が基底に当たります. $\\langle "
"\\text{Cash} \\rangle$ のように `Not` の付いた基底は増加を表します. $"
"\\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle}$ のように `Hat` の付いた基底は減少"
"を表します. 表 1 の 4 行は次のようになります:"

#: src/overview.md:22
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} x_1 &= 1000 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle + 1000 : "
"\\langle \\text{Capital stock} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_2 &= 600 : \\langle "
"\\text{Purchases} \\rangle + 600 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle} "
"\\\\\\\\ x_3 &= 900 : \\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle + 900 : "
"\\langle \\text{Sales} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_4 &= 500 : \\langle \\text{Cash} "
"\\rangle + 500 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle} \\"
"\\end{aligned} $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} x_1 &= 1000 : \\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle + 1000 : "
"\\langle \\text{Capital stock} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_2 &= 600 : \\langle "
"\\text{Purchases} \\rangle + 600 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle} "
"\\\\\\\\ x_3 &= 900 : \\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle + 900 : "
"\\langle \\text{Sales} \\rangle \\\\\\\\ x_4 &= 500 : \\langle \\text{Cash} "
"\\rangle + 500 : \\widehat{\\langle \\text{Accounts receivable} \\rangle} \\"
"\\end{aligned} $$"

#: src/overview.md:31
msgid ""
"The terms carry neither debit and credit labels nor minus signs. Each term "
"states which account changed and in which direction. The journal side "
"follows from the account's division: an increase in an asset or expense is a "
"debit, and an increase in a liability, equity, or revenue account is a "
"credit. A decrease takes the opposite side. For example, the increase in "
"capital stock in $x_1$ is a credit, and the decrease in cash in $x_2$ is "
"also a credit. [Account classes and sides](algebra/definitions.md#account-"
"classes-and-sides) gives the full rule, including contra accounts."
msgstr ""
"項には借方や貸方のラベルも負号も付けません. 各項は, どの勘定がどちらの方向に"
"変化したかを表します. 借方と貸方の別は勘定の区分から決まります. 資産と費用の"
"増加は借方, 負債, 純資産, 収益の増加は貸方です. 減少の場合は反対側になりま"
"す. 例えば, $x_1$ の資本金の増加も, $x_2$ の現金の減少も貸方です. 評価勘定を"
"含む規則の全体は[勘定の区分と貸借](algebra/definitions.md#account-classes-"
"and-sides)を参照してください."

#: src/overview.md:33
msgid ""
"The combined record is the sum $x = x_1 + x_2 + x_3 + x_4$ of eight terms. "
"The sum keeps every term: cash has $1000$ and $500$ on the base with `Not` "
"and $600$ on the base with `Hat`. Bar, written $\\bar{x}$, totals the two "
"directions at each base and keeps the excess. For cash it leaves $900 : "
"\\langle \\text{Cash} \\rangle$, the cash balance."
msgstr ""
"記録全体を合わせると, 8 個の項の和 $x = x_1 + x_2 + x_3 + x_4$ です. 和はすべ"
"ての項を保持します. 現金については, `Not` の付いた基底に $1000$ と $500$, "
"`Hat` の付いた基底に $600$ が記録されます. $\\bar{x}$ と書く bar は, 各基底の"
"両方向をそれぞれ合計し, 差額を残します. 現金では $900 : \\langle "
"\\text{Cash} \\rangle$ が残り, 現金残高を表します."

#: src/overview.md:35
msgid "Recover the debit and credit columns"
msgstr "借方列と貸方列を取り出す"

#: src/overview.md:37
msgid ""
"The projection `decL` selects the debit terms of $x$ and `decR` selects the "
"credit terms. `decL` returns cash 1,000, purchases 600, accounts receivable "
"900, and cash 500, which is the debit column of Table 1. `decR` returns the "
"credit column. Both totals are 3,000, so `balance` returns `True`."
msgstr ""
"射影 `decL` は $x$ の借方の項を, `decR` は貸方の項を選びます. `decL` が返すの"
"は現金 1,000, 仕入 600, 売掛金 900, 現金 500 で, 表 1 の借方列に一致します. "
"`decR` は貸方列を返します. 両方の合計が 3,000 なので, `balance` は `True` を"
"返します."

#: src/overview.md:39
msgid ""
"A program that builds the journal of Table 1 and checks these results needs "
"only the `ExchangeAlgebra` module:"
msgstr ""
"表 1 の仕訳帳を構築してこれらの結果を確かめるプログラムは, `ExchangeAlgebra` "
"モジュールだけで書けます:"

#: src/overview.md:57
msgid "It prints:"
msgstr "出力は次のとおりです:"

#: src/overview.md:65
msgid ""
"`.@` attaches an amount to a hat base. `.+` keeps the terms of both "
"operands, including terms on the same base. `norm` totals the amounts. `bar` "
"offsets the increases and decreases of the cash terms selected by "
"`projByAccountTitle` and leaves the net increase of 900."
msgstr ""
"`.@` は金額を Hat 基底に付けます. `.+` は, 同じ基底の項も含めて両方の被演算子"
"の項を保持します. `norm` は金額を合計します. `bar` は, `projByAccountTitle` "
"で選んだ現金の項の増加と減少を相殺し, 正味の増加 900 を残します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:3
msgid ""
"**Note:** The mathematical definitions are optional background for using the "
"library. If you prefer to skip the mathematics, go to [Installation and "
"modules](../usage/installation.md)."
msgstr ""
"**補足:** 数学的な定義は, ライブラリを使ううえで必須の知識ではありません. 数"
"学の説明を読み飛ばす場合は, [導入とモジュール](../usage/installation.md)へ進"
"んでください."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:5
msgid "Element structure"
msgstr "要素構造"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:7
msgid ""
"**Definition 1 (Element structure).** Each element set $E$ has a "
"distinguished wildcard element $\\\\# \\in E$ and a total order $\\leq$. For "
"a query element $p$ and a stored element $e$ in $E$, one-way matching is "
"defined by"
msgstr ""
"**定義 1 (要素構造).** 各要素集合 $E$ には, 特別なワイルドカード要素 $\\\\# "
"\\in E$ と全順序 $\\leq$ があります. $E$ に属する問い合わせの要素 $p$ と記録"
"された要素 $e$ の片方向の照合を, 次の式で定義します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:9
msgid ""
"$$ p \\trianglerighteq e \\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad (p=\\\\#)"
"\\lor(p=e). $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ p \\trianglerighteq e \\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad (p=\\\\#)"
"\\lor(p=e). $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:13
msgid ""
"A stored $\\\\#$ indicates that the corresponding element set does not "
"apply. A query for a specific firm therefore skips a term whose firm element "
"is $\\\\#$. The wildcard is an ordinary member of the total order; matching "
"does not define that order."
msgstr ""
"記録された $\\\\#$ は, 対応する要素集合が該当しないことを表します. したがっ"
"て, 特定の企業を指定する問い合わせは, 企業の要素が $\\\\#$ である項 を選びま"
"せん. ワイルドカードは全順序集合の通常の元であり, 照合によってその順序が定ま"
"るわけではありません."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:15
msgid ""
"Definition 1 of the preprint gives a symmetric comparison. The query "
"relation used here treats only a query-side $\\\\#$ as a pattern."
msgstr ""
"プレプリントの定義 1 は対称な比較を与えています. ここで使う問い合わせの関係で"
"は, 問い合わせ側の $\\\\#$ だけをパターンとして扱います."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:17
msgid "Usage: [Elements](elements.md)."
msgstr "使い方: [要素](elements.md)."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:21
msgid ""
"**Definition 2.** A base is a tuple of elements, one from each element set. "
"For element sets $E_1,\\ldots,E_n$, the base space is "
"$E_1\\times\\cdots\\times E_n$. An account and a firm, for example, form a "
"base with two elements. A query tuple matches a stored base exactly when "
"each query element matches the corresponding stored element."
msgstr ""
"**定義 2.** 基底は, 各要素集合から 1 つずつ要素を取ったタプルです. 要素集合 "
"$E_1,\\ldots,E_n$ に対して, 基底空間は $E_1\\times\\cdots\\times E_n$ です. "
"例えば, 勘定と企業は 2 つの要素を持つ基底を構成します. 問い合わせの各要素が対"
"応する記録済みの要素に一致するとき, かつそのときに限り, 問い合わせのタプルは"
"記録された基底に一致します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:23
msgid ""
"Here, “element” refers to a member of an element set that supplies a "
"component of a base, while a “member of the redundant algebra” is a sum of "
"terms."
msgstr ""
"ここでの「要素」は基底の成分を与える要素集合の元を指し, 「冗長代数の元」は項"
"の和を指します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:25
msgid "Usage: [Bases](bases.md)."
msgstr "使い方: [基底](bases.md)."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:27
msgid "Hat bases and terms"
msgstr "Hat 基底と項"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:29
msgid ""
"**Definition 3.** A hat base pairs a base with one of two directions: `Not` "
"(increase) or `Hat` (decrease). A query can select both directions with "
"`HatNot`. Each term has a direction of `Not` or `Hat`."
msgstr ""
"**定義 3.** Hat 基底は, 基底と 2 つの方向のいずれかを組にしたものです. 方向"
"は `Not` (増加) または `Hat` (減少) です. 問い合わせでは `HatNot` で両方向を"
"選択できます. 各項の方向は `Not` または `Hat` です."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:31
msgid ""
"A term pairs a hat base with a nonnegative real amount from the value domain "
"$V\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\_{\\geq 0}$. We write $a:e$ for an increase and $a:"
"\\widehat{e}$ for a decrease at the base $e$. The redundant algebra is "
"generated by its terms. In Haskell, `Posting` is the type that represents a "
"term."
msgstr ""
"項は, Hat 基底と値域 $V\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}\\_{\\geq 0}$ の非負実数の金額を"
"組にしたものです. 基底 $e$ での増加を $a:e$, 減少を $a:\\widehat{e}$ と書きま"
"す. 項は冗長代数の生成元です. Haskell では `Posting` が項を表す型です."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:33
msgid ""
"**Example 1 (Hat bases).** A base can consist of an account title alone, "
"such as `Cash`, or pair an account title with a date or a name. For the base "
"$e=\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\text{2024-01-01}\\rangle$, the hat bases are $e$ "
"for `Not` and $\\widehat{e}$ for `Hat`."
msgstr ""
"**例 1 (Hat 基底).** 基底は `Cash` のような勘定科目だけでも, 勘定科目と日付や"
"名前の組でも構成できます. 基底 $e=\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},"
"\\text{2024-01-01}\\rangle$ に対する Hat 基底は, `Not` なら $e$, `Hat` なら $"
"\\widehat{e}$ です."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:35
msgid "Usage: [Bases](bases.md) and [Amount types](redundant.md#amount-types)."
msgstr ""
"使い方は[基底](bases.md)と[金額の型](redundant.md#amount-types)を参照してくだ"
"さい."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:37
msgid "Redundant algebra and linear combinations"
msgstr "冗長代数と線形結合"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:39
msgid ""
"**Definition 4.** A redundant algebra consists of finite collections of "
"terms, with addition, scalar multiplication by nonnegative values, hat, bar, "
"and a norm into the value domain."
msgstr ""
"**定義 4.** 冗長代数は項の有限な集まりからなり, 加法, 非負の値によるスカラー"
"倍, hat, bar, 値域への norm を備えます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:41
msgid ""
"Write $R$ for the redundant algebra and $V$ for its value domain. The five "
"operations and the library's additional operation `compress` have the "
"following types."
msgstr ""
"冗長代数を $R$, その値域を $V$ とします. 5 つの演算と, ライブラリが追加した演"
"算 `compress` の型を次の表に示します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:43 src/algebra/definitions.md:68
#: src/algebra/redundant.md:591 src/exchange/transfer.md:141
msgid "Operation"
msgstr "演算"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:43 src/algebra/elements.md:229
