"_Table 1. The meaning of `Not` and `Hat` and the resulting side, by account "
"division._"
msgstr "_表 1. 勘定科目の区分ごとの `Not` と `Hat` の意味と貸借区分._"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:163
msgid ""
"This table also appears as Table 2 in [Record a withdrawal](../usage/"
"withdrawal.md#base-and-hat-base)."
msgstr ""
"この表は, [引き出しを記録する](../usage/withdrawal.md#base-and-hat-base)の表 "
"2 と同じです."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:165
msgid ""
"For an exchange base $b$, `whatDiv` takes values in $"
"\\lbrace\\mathrm{Assets},\\mathrm{Equity},\\mathrm{Liability},\\mathrm{Cost},"
"\\mathrm{Revenue}\\rbrace$. For ordinary accounts, `whatPIMO` is $"
"\\mathrm{PS}$ for $\\mathrm{Assets}$, $\\mathrm{MS}$ for $\\mathrm{Equity}$ "
"and $\\mathrm{Liability}$, $\\mathrm{IN}$ for $\\mathrm{Revenue}$, and $"
"\\mathrm{OUT}$ for $\\mathrm{Cost}$. When `isContra` holds, `whatPIMO` swaps "
"$\\mathrm{PS}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MS}$ and $\\mathrm{IN}"
"\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{OUT}$."
msgstr ""
"交換基底 $b$ に対し, `whatDiv` は $\\lbrace\\mathrm{Assets},\\mathrm{Equity},"
"\\mathrm{Liability},\\mathrm{Cost},\\mathrm{Revenue}\\rbrace$ のいずれかを返"
"します. 通常の勘定科目の `whatPIMO` は, $\\mathrm{Assets}$ なら $\\mathrm{PS}"
"$, $\\mathrm{Equity}$ と $\\mathrm{Liability}$ なら $\\mathrm{MS}$, $"
"\\mathrm{Revenue}$ なら $\\mathrm{IN}$, $\\mathrm{Cost}$ なら $\\mathrm{OUT}"
"$ です. `isContra` が成り立つ評価勘定では, `whatPIMO` は $\\mathrm{PS}"
"\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{MS}$ と $\\mathrm{IN}\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{OUT}$ "
"をそれぞれ入れ替えます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:167
msgid ""
"Let $\\operatorname{opposite}$ exchange $\\mathrm{Debit}$ and $"
"\\mathrm{Credit}$, and let $s=\\operatorname{defaultSide}"
"(\\operatorname{whatDiv}(b))$. The division's default side is debit for "
"`Assets` and `Cost` and credit for `Equity`, `Liability`, and `Revenue`. The "
"home side and the side of a stored hat base are"
msgstr ""
"$\\operatorname{opposite}$ は $\\mathrm{Debit}$ と $\\mathrm{Credit}$ を入れ"
"替える関数とし, $s=\\operatorname{defaultSide}(\\operatorname{whatDiv}(b))$ "
"とします. 区分の既定の側は, `Assets` と `Cost` では借方, `Equity`, "
"`Liability`, `Revenue` では貸方です. 勘定科目が本来持つ貸借の側と, 記録され"
"た Hat 基底の貸借の側を次の式で表します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:169
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{homeSide}(b)= \\\\begin{cases} \\\\operatorname{opposite}"
"(s) & \\text{if } \\operatorname{isContra}(b), \\\\\\\\ s & "
"\\text{otherwise}. \\\\end{cases} $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{homeSide}(b)= \\\\begin{cases} \\\\operatorname{opposite}"
"(s) & \\text{if } \\operatorname{isContra}(b), \\\\\\\\ s & "
"\\text{otherwise}. \\\\end{cases} $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:177
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} \\\\operatorname{whichSide}"
"(\\mathrm{Not},b)&=\\operatorname{homeSide}(b),\\\\\\\\ \\"
"\\operatorname{whichSide}(\\mathrm{Hat},b)&=\\operatorname{opposite}"
"(\\operatorname{homeSide}(b)). \\\\end{aligned} $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} \\\\operatorname{whichSide}"
"(\\mathrm{Not},b)&=\\operatorname{homeSide}(b),\\\\\\\\ \\"
"\\operatorname{whichSide}(\\mathrm{Hat},b)&=\\operatorname{opposite}"
"(\\operatorname{homeSide}(b)). \\\\end{aligned} $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:184
msgid ""
"Usage: [Base and hat base](../usage/withdrawal.md#base-and-hat-base) and "
"[Classify an account and check its side](redundant.md#classify-an-account-"
"and-check-its-side)."
msgstr ""
"使い方は[基底と Hat 基底](../usage/withdrawal.md#base-and-hat-base)と[勘定科"
"目を分類し貸借区分を調べる](redundant.md#classify-an-account-and-check-its-"
"side)を参照してください."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:186
msgid "Debit and credit decomposition"
msgstr "借方と貸方への分解"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:188
msgid ""
"**Definition 8.** An exchange algebra extends the redundant algebra with "
"four decompositions. Each decomposition projects $x$ onto the terms whose "
"hat bases $h$ satisfy its condition."
msgstr ""
"**定義 8.** 交換代数は, 冗長代数に 4 つの分解の演算を加えたものです. 各演算"
"は, $x$ から条件を満たす Hat 基底 $h$ の項を射影します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:190
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{dec}\\_{\\bullet}(x):=x\\big\\vert\\_{\\lbrace h\\mid "
"C\\_{\\bullet}(h)\\rbrace}. $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{dec}\\_{\\bullet}(x):=x\\big\\vert\\_{\\lbrace h\\mid "
"C\\_{\\bullet}(h)\\rbrace}. $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:194
msgid "Decomposition"
msgstr "分解"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:194
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "条件"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:196
msgid "`decL`"
msgstr "`decL`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:196
msgid "$C_L(h)\\iff\\operatorname{whichSide}(h)=\\mathrm{Debit}$"
msgstr "$C_L(h)\\iff\\operatorname{whichSide}(h)=\\mathrm{Debit}$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:197
msgid "`decR`"
msgstr "`decR`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:197
msgid "$C_R(h)\\iff\\operatorname{whichSide}(h)=\\mathrm{Credit}$"
msgstr "$C_R(h)\\iff\\operatorname{whichSide}(h)=\\mathrm{Credit}$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:198
msgid "`decP`"
msgstr "`decP`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:198
msgid "$C_P(h)\\iff\\operatorname{hat}(h)=\\mathrm{Hat}$"
msgstr "$C_P(h)\\iff\\operatorname{hat}(h)=\\mathrm{Hat}$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:199
msgid "`decM`"
msgstr "`decM`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:199
msgid "$C_M(h)\\iff\\operatorname{hat}(h)=\\mathrm{Not}$"
msgstr "$C_M(h)\\iff\\operatorname{hat}(h)=\\mathrm{Not}$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:201
msgid ""
"Deguchi and Nakano (1986, Definition 2.16) use left for debit (`decL`) and "
"right for credit (`decR`). For example, a decrease in cash is a credit, and "
"an increase in an ordinary expense is a debit. A sum of terms is balanced "
"when its exact debit and credit totals agree."
msgstr ""
"Deguchi and Nakano (1986, 定義 2.16) の慣習に従い, 左側 (`decL`) を借方, 右"
"側 (`decR`) を貸方とします. 例えば, 現金の減少は貸方であり, 通常の費用の増加"
"は借方です. 項の和の借方合計と貸方合計が厳密に等しいとき, 貸借が一致します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:203
msgid ""
"Usage: [Split an entry into debits and credits](../usage/"
"withdrawal.md#exchange-algebra) and [Read the debit and credit difference]"
"(redundant.md#decompose-and-check-the-record)."
msgstr ""
"使い方は[仕訳を借方と貸方に分ける](../usage/withdrawal.md#exchange-algebra)と"
"[借方と貸方の差額を求める](redundant.md#decompose-and-check-the-record)を参照"
"してください."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:207
msgid ""
"**Definition 9.** An accounting transfer table is an ordered list of rows "
"written `from .-> to |% share`. The source and destination are bases without "
"a direction. `Relabel` moves the entire exact balance at each matched "
"source. `Portion n d` moves the fraction $n/d$ of that exact balance, with "
"$0\\<n\\le d$, and rounds the moved amount once."
msgstr ""
"**定義 9.** 会計の振替表は `from .-> to |% share` と書く行の順序付きリストで"
"す. 振替元と振替先には方向を付けない基底を指定します. `Relabel` は一致する振"
"替元ごとに厳密な残高の全額を移します. `Portion n d` は厳密な残高の $n/d$ "
"($0\\<n\\le d$) を移し, 移す額を 1 回丸めます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:209
msgid ""
"A source wildcard matches any stored element. A destination wildcard retains "
"the corresponding source element. The accounting table preserves written row "
"order and permits a destination to match a later source. It rejects "
"overlapping source patterns and destinations that match the source of the "
"same or an earlier row. The algebra layer sorts its rules by source pattern."
msgstr ""
"振替元のワイルドカードは格納された任意の要素に一致します. 振替先のワイルド"
"カードは対応する振替元の要素を保ちます. 会計の振替表は記述した行順を保ち, 振"
"替先が後の行の振替元に一致することを許します. 振替元のパターンが重複する場合"
"や, 振替先が同じ行または前の行の振替元に一致する場合は拒否します. 代数層では"
"規則を振替元のパターン順に並べます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:211
msgid ""
"The `transferEntries` function returns a cancellation term at the source and "
"a term of the same amount at the destination for each amount moved. The "
"destination direction preserves the debit or credit side of the balance "
"being moved. Add these terms to the original ledger to record the transfer "
"and retain the original terms. Apply bar explicitly to cancel opposite "
"amounts at each base."
msgstr ""
"`transferEntries` は, 移す額ごとに, 振替元の取消項と同額の振替先の項を返しま"
"す. 振替先の方向は, 移す残高の貸借の側を保つように決まります. これらの項を元"
"の台帳に足すと, 元の項を保ったまま振替を記録できます. 各基底で逆方向の額を相"
"殺するには, bar を明示的に適用します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:213
msgid ""
"The preprint's transfer operation takes an arbitrary transformation $f:V\\to "
"V$. Version 0.7 removed the 0.6 algebra operations `MulBy` and `DivBy`."
msgstr ""
"プレプリントの振替演算は任意の変換 $f:V\\to V$ を受け取ります. 0.7 で, 0.6 の"
"代数層の演算 `MulBy` と `DivBy` が削除されました."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:215
msgid ""
"**Example 2 (Unit conversion).** Let $x$ and $y$ record the following terms."
msgstr "**例 2 (単位換算).** $x$ と $y$ が次の項を記録するとします."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:217
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} x&=1:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}"
"\\rangle} +1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle,\\\\\\\\ "
"y&=2:\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle "
"+2:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Deposits},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle}. \\"
"\\end{aligned} $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} x&=1:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}"
"\\rangle} +1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle,\\\\\\\\ "
"y&=2:\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle "
"+2:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Deposits},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle}. \\"
"\\end{aligned} $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:226
msgid ""
"Use a single `Relabel` row from $\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}"
"\\rangle$ to $\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle$. Adding the "
"two terms returned by `transferEntries` to $x+y$ gives the transfer result "
"$z$."
msgstr ""
"$\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle$ から $"
"\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle$ への `Relabel` の行を 1 つ"
"使います. `transferEntries` が返す 2 項を $x+y$ に足すと, 振替の結果 $z$ が得"
"られます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:228
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} z={}&1:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}"
"\\rangle} +1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle\\\\\\\\ "
"&+2:\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle "
"+2:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Deposits},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle}\\\\\\\\ "
"&+1:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle} "
"+1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle. \\\\end{aligned} $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} z={}&1:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}"
"\\rangle} +1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle\\\\\\\\ "
"&+2:\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle "
"+2:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Deposits},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle}\\\\\\\\ "
"&+1:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle} "
"+1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle. \\\\end{aligned} $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:239
msgid ""
"Applying bar cancels the two $\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}"
"\\rangle$ terms and leaves a net increase of 1 at $\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},"
"\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle$."
msgstr ""
"bar を適用すると $\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle$ の 2 "
"項が相殺され, $\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle$ には差額として "
"1 の増加が残ります."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:241
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\bar{z}=1:\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle "
"+2:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Deposits},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle} "
"+1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle. $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\bar{z}=1:\\langle\\mathrm{Cash},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle "
"+2:\\widehat{\\langle\\mathrm{Deposits},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle} "
"+1:\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Yen}\\rangle. $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:247
msgid ""
"The preprint's example cancels only the pair at the source base $"
"\\langle\\mathrm{Products},\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle$ and retains the "
"original terms at the other bases."
msgstr ""
"プレプリントの例では, 振替元の基底 $\\langle\\mathrm{Products},"
"\\mathrm{Amount}\\rangle$ の 1 組だけを相殺し, 他の基底の元の項をそのまま残し"
"ています."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:249
msgid "Usage: [Transfers](../exchange/transfer.md)."
msgstr "使い方: [振替](../exchange/transfer.md)."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:251
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "摘要"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:253
msgid ""
"**Definition 10.** A note set $N$ is a totally ordered set with equality and "
"a distinguished empty element $\\mathrm{plank}\\in N$. A note can contain a "
"date, a description, or a transaction identifier."
msgstr ""
"**定義 10.** 摘要 (note) の集合 $N$ は, 等値比較と特別な空要素 $"
"\\mathrm{plank}\\in N$ を備えた全順序集合です. 摘要には日付, 説明, 取引識別子"
"などを含められます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:255
msgid ""
"Usage: [Declare a note type](../journal/journal.md#declare-a-note-type)."
msgstr ""
"使い方: [摘要の型を宣言する](../journal/journal.md#declare-a-note-type)."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:257
msgid "Finite journals"
msgstr "有限台を持つ仕訳帳"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:259
msgid ""
"**Definition 11.** A journal is a finite-support function $J:N\\to E$, where "
"$E$ is the exchange algebra. A note outside the support has value zero. "
"Equivalently, the journal is the finite collection of its nonzero note-"
"algebra pairs $(n,J(n))$. Equal notes identify the same algebra component."
msgstr ""
"**定義 11.** 仕訳帳は有限台を持つ関数 $J:N\\to E$ です. $E$ は交換代数です. "
"台に含まれない摘要では値をゼロとします. 同じ仕訳帳は, ゼロでない摘要と代数の"
"対 $(n,J(n))$ を有限個集めたものとしても表せます. 等しい摘要は同じ代数成分を"
"指します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:261
msgid ""
"Usage: [Attach notes to the month](../journal/journal.md#attach-notes-to-the-"
"month)."
msgstr ""
"使い方: [月の取引に摘要を付ける](../journal/journal.md#attach-notes-to-the-"
"month)."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:263
msgid "Journal operations"
msgstr "仕訳帳の演算"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:265
msgid ""
"**Definition 12.** Hat and scalar multiplication act separately on each "
"note's algebra, preserving its note. Addition combines the algebras at each "
"equal note by redundant addition:"
msgstr ""
"**定義 12.** Hat とスカラー倍は各摘要の代数に個別に作用し, 摘要を保ちます. 加"
"算は, 等しい摘要に対応する代数を冗長加算で合わせます:"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:267
msgid "$$ (J_1+J_2)(n)=J_1(n)+J_2(n). $$"
msgstr "$$ (J_1+J_2)(n)=J_1(n)+J_2(n). $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:271
msgid ""
"Aggregation combines the note components under the empty note. Its algebra "
"is $\\sum\\_{n\\in N}J(n)$; applying bar to that combined algebra gives the "
"journal bar. The norm counts all amounts across notes:"
msgstr ""
"集約では各摘要の成分を空の摘要にまとめます. 対応する代数は $\\sum\\_{n\\in N}"
"J(n)$ です. この代数に bar を適用すると仕訳帳の bar が得られます. norm は摘要"
"をまたいで全ての額を数えます:"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:273
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{norm}(J)=\\operatorname{norm}\\left(\\sum\\_{n\\in N}J(n)"
"\\right). $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{norm}(J)=\\operatorname{norm}\\left(\\sum\\_{n\\in N}J(n)"
"\\right). $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:277
msgid ""
"Journal projections take finite lists of note keys or hat-base patterns. The "
"following signatures omit type parameters on `Journal` and class constraints."
msgstr ""
"仕訳帳の射影は, 摘要のキーや Hat 基底のパターンを有限のリストで受け取ります. "
"次の型シグネチャでは, `Journal` の型引数と型クラス制約を省略しています."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:279
msgid "`projWithNote :: [n] -> Journal -> Journal`"
msgstr "`projWithNote :: [n] -> Journal -> Journal`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:280
msgid "`projWithBase :: [b] -> Journal -> Journal`"
msgstr "`projWithBase :: [b] -> Journal -> Journal`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:281
msgid "`projWithNoteBase :: [n] -> [b] -> Journal -> Journal`"
msgstr "`projWithNoteBase :: [n] -> [b] -> Journal -> Journal`"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:283
msgid ""
"`projWithNote` selects the listed notes by equality, and `plank` in a note "
"list selects every note. `projWithBase` selects terms within each note using "
"the one-way matching of Definition 1, with `HatNot` matching either "
"direction. `projWithNoteBase` applies both restrictions, with an empty note "
"list leaving all notes eligible. A base projection drops notes whose "
"projected algebra is zero."
msgstr ""
"`projWithNote` は列に挙げた摘要を等号で選び, 摘要の列に `plank` があればすべ"
"ての摘要を選びます. `projWithBase` は定義 1 の片方向の照合で各摘要の中の項を"
"選び, `HatNot` はどちらの向きにも一致します. `projWithNoteBase` は両方の制限"
"を課し, 摘要の列が空ならすべての摘要が対象になります. 基底による射影は, 射影"
"した代数がゼロになった摘要を落とします."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:285
msgid ""
"`transferEntriesBy :: (n -> n) -> TransferTable b -> Journal -> Either "
"(TransferJournalError n b) Journal` maps each input note to a target note. "
"For each target, it combines the algebras of the input notes that map there, "
"applies the table to their combined ledger, and returns the additional terms "
"under the target note. Add the returned journal to the original journal to "
"record the transfers."
msgstr ""
"`transferEntriesBy :: (n -> n) -> TransferTable b -> Journal -> Either "
"(TransferJournalError n b) Journal` が各入力摘要を振替先の摘要に対応付けま"
"す. 振替先ごとに, そこへ対応付けられた入力摘要の代数をまとめ, まとめた台帳に"
"振替表を適用し, 追加する項を振替先の摘要の下に返します. 返された仕訳帳を元の"
"仕訳帳に足すと, 振替を記録できます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:287
msgid ""
"The preprint specifies the inputs to these projections as power sets of "
"notes and bases."
msgstr "プレプリントでは, これらの射影の入力に摘要と基底の冪集合を用います."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:289
msgid ""
"Usage: [Select by note, base, and date](../journal/journal.md#select-by-note-"
"base-and-date) and [Total amounts and combine notes](../journal/"
"journal.md#total-amounts-and-combine-notes)."
msgstr ""
"使い方: [摘要, 基底, 日付で選ぶ](../journal/journal.md#select-by-note-base-"
"and-date)と[額を合計して摘要をまとめる](../journal/journal.md#total-amounts-"
"and-combine-notes)."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:291
msgid "Journal notation"
msgstr "仕訳帳の記法"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:293
msgid ""
"**Definition 13.** Write $e\\mid n$ for the journal that attaches note $n$ "
"to the exchange algebra $e$. In Haskell, this is `e .| n` (`infix 5`). The "
"operator binds more tightly than `.+`, so enclose a sum in parentheses to "
"attach one note to the sum."
msgstr ""
"**定義 13.** 交換代数 $e$ に摘要 $n$ を付けた仕訳帳を $e\\mid n$ と書きます. "
"Haskell では `e .| n` (`infix 5`) と書きます. この演算子は `.+` より強く結合"
"するため, 和に 1 つの摘要を付けるときは和を括弧で囲みます."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:295
msgid ""
"Terms with the same note belong to a single component of the journal. For "
"example, $(e_1\\mid n)+(e_2\\mid n)=(e_1+e_2)\\mid n$."
msgstr ""
"摘要が同じ項は, 仕訳帳の 1 つの成分に属します. 例えば, $(e_1\\mid n)+"
"(e_2\\mid n)=(e_1+e_2)\\mid n$ です."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:297
msgid ""
"**Example 3 (Select transactions by date).** Let the notes $n_1$, $n_2$, and "
"$n_3$ be the date strings `2024-01-01`, `2024-01-15`, and `2024-02-01`. A "
"journal $J$ can record two sales and a purchase of products."
msgstr ""
"**例 3 (日付で取引を選ぶ).** 摘要 $n_1$, $n_2$, $n_3$ をそれぞれ日付の文字列 "
"`2024-01-01`, `2024-01-15`, `2024-02-01` とします. 仕訳帳 $J$ に 2 件の売上"
"と 1 件の商品の購入を記録します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:299
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} e_1&=100:\\mathrm{Cash}+100:\\mathrm{Sales},\\\\\\\\ "
"e_2&=50:\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cash}}+50:\\mathrm{Products},\\\\\\\\ "
"e_3&=30:\\mathrm{Cash}+30:\\mathrm{Sales},\\\\\\\\ J&=(e_1\\mid n_1)+"
"(e_2\\mid n_2)+(e_3\\mid n_3). \\\\end{aligned} $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\begin{aligned} e_1&=100:\\mathrm{Cash}+100:\\mathrm{Sales},\\\\\\\\ "
"e_2&=50:\\widehat{\\mathrm{Cash}}+50:\\mathrm{Products},\\\\\\\\ "
"e_3&=30:\\mathrm{Cash}+30:\\mathrm{Sales},\\\\\\\\ J&=(e_1\\mid n_1)+"
"(e_2\\mid n_2)+(e_3\\mid n_3). \\\\end{aligned} $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:308
msgid "Pass the two January notes in the list supplied to `projWithNote`."
msgstr "1 月の 2 つの摘要をリストに列挙し, `projWithNote` に渡します."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:310
msgid ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{projWithNote}(\\[n_1,n_2\\],J)=(e_1\\mid n_1)+(e_2\\mid "
"n_2). $$"
msgstr ""
"$$ \\\\operatorname{projWithNote}(\\[n_1,n_2\\],J)=(e_1\\mid n_1)+(e_2\\mid "
"n_2). $$"

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:314
msgid ""
"The preprint's date example describes the January notes with a predicate, "
"while `projWithNote` takes the list of dates."
msgstr ""
"プレプリントの日付の例は 1 月の摘要を述語で指定しますが, `projWithNote` は日"
"付のリストを受け取ります."

#: src/algebra/definitions.md:316
msgid ""
"Definitions 1–13 draw on Appendix A of [_Accounting State Space as a "
"Foundation for Economic Agent-Based Modeling: An Input–Output Benchmark and "
"Inventory Extension_](https://doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-8485050/v2), with "
"clarifications in Definitions 1, 6, 9, 12, and 13."
msgstr ""
"定義 1–13 は [_Accounting State Space as a Foundation for Economic Agent-"
"Based Modeling: An Input–Output Benchmark and Inventory Extension_](https://"
"doi.org/10.21203/rs.3.rs-8485050/v2) の Appendix A に基づきます. 定義 1, 6, "
"9, 12, 13 に補足を記します."

#: src/usage/installation.md:3
msgid ""
"This manual uses **exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1** from Hackage. The examples "
"assume that you can write Haskell programs and have Stack installed. They "
"use GHC 9.10.3 with the Stackage snapshot `lts-24.65`."
msgstr ""
"このマニュアルでは, Hackage の **exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1** を使います. 例は, "
"Haskell のプログラムを書けることと Stack の導入が済んでいることを前提としま"
"す. GHC 9.10.3 と Stackage snapshot `lts-24.65` を使います."

#: src/usage/installation.md:5
msgid ""
"The Algebra layer provides types for elements, bases, amounts, and finite "
"sequences of terms. Its operations implement the [redundant algebra](../"
"algebra/definitions.md#redundant-algebra-and-linear-combinations). "
"Accounting adds the interpretation of account titles and the debit and "
"credit sides."
msgstr ""
"Algebra 層は, 要素, 基底, 金額, 項 の有限列を表す型を提供します. その演算は"
"[冗長代数](../algebra/definitions.md#redundant-algebra-and-linear-"
"combinations)を実装します. Accounting は, 勘定科目と借方および貸方の解釈を加"
"えます."

#: src/usage/installation.md:7
