msgstr "exchangealgebra == 0.7.0.1"

#: src/usage/installation.md:27
msgid ""
"`extra-deps` selects the package source for Stack; the dependency in "
"`package.yaml` makes the library available to your program. Run `stack "
"build` in the project directory to build the project and its dependencies. "
"For a Cabal project, put `exchangealgebra == 0.7.0.1` in the component's "
"`build-depends` instead."
msgstr ""
"`extra-deps` は Stack が取得するパッケージのソースを選びます. `package.yaml` "
"の依存指定は, プログラムからライブラリを使えるようにします. プロジェクトの"
"ディレクトリで `stack build` を実行し, プロジェクトとその依存をビルドしてくだ"
"さい. Cabal プロジェクトの場合は, 代わりにコンポーネントの `build-depends` "
"に `exchangealgebra == 0.7.0.1` を指定してください."

#: src/usage/installation.md:29
msgid "Choose imports by layer"
msgstr "層ごとに import を選ぶ"

#: src/usage/installation.md:31
msgid ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra` is a convenience module. It re-exports named selections of "
"the Algebra API, account titles and classifications, accounting exchange "
"operations, transfers and closing, trial-balance readouts, statement "
"presentation, CSV and bookkeeping output, and money types. It does not re-"
"export every public module. Import journal functions with `import qualified "
"ExchangeAlgebra.Journal as Journal` and the operator with `import "
"ExchangeAlgebra.Journal ((.|))`. Import `matchesQuery` directly from "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Element`."
msgstr ""
"`ExchangeAlgebra` は利便性のためのモジュールです. Algebra API から選んだ名"
"前, 勘定科目と分類, 会計の交換演算, 振替と決算, 試算表の読み出し, 財務諸表の"
"表示, CSV と帳簿の出力, 金額の型を再エクスポートします. すべての公開モジュー"
"ルを再エクスポートするわけではありません. 仕訳帳の関数には `import qualified "
"ExchangeAlgebra.Journal as Journal` を使い, 演算子には `import "
"ExchangeAlgebra.Journal ((.|))` を使ってください. `matchesQuery` は "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Algebra.Element` から直接 import してください."

