#: src/usage/installation.md:47
msgid ""
"For the [account divisions and side decompositions](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#account-classes-and-sides), "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange` provides `ExBaseClass` with `whatDiv` "
"and `whichSide`, and `Exchange` with `decL`, `decR`, and `balance`. `decL` "
"selects debit terms and `decR` selects credit terms. `balance` compares "
"their exact totals before rounding. The [journal example](../"
"overview.md#recover-the-debit-and-credit-columns) uses these functions "
"through `ExchangeAlgebra`."
msgstr ""
"[勘定の区分と貸借分解](../algebra/definitions.md#account-classes-and-sides)に"
"ついては, `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange` が, `whatDiv` と `whichSide` "
"を持つ `ExBaseClass`, および `decL`, `decR`, `balance` を持つ `Exchange` を提"
"供します. `decL` は借方の項を選び, `decR` は貸方の項を選びます. `balance` は"
"丸める前の厳密な合計を比較します. [仕訳帳の例](../overview.md#recover-the-"
"debit-and-credit-columns)では, `ExchangeAlgebra` を通じてこれらの関数を使いま"
"す."

