msgstr "プロジェクトのディレクトリから次のコマンドを実行してください:"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:61 src/algebra/redundant.md:253
msgid "The program prints:"
msgstr "プログラムは次のように出力します:"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:70
msgid ""
"The following sections explain the program in the order in which its type is "
"built: elements, a base and hat base, a redundant algebra, and an exchange "
"algebra. Each section shows again the part of the program that it explains."
msgstr ""
"以下では, このプログラムの型を組み立てる順に, 要素, 基底と Hat 基底, 冗長代"
"数, 交換代数を説明します. 各節では, 説明する部分のプログラムを再掲します."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:72
msgid "Elements: `AccountTitles` and `Unit`"
msgstr "要素: `AccountTitles` と `Unit`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:74
msgid ""
"An element is one piece of the information that identifies what changes. "
"This entry uses two kinds of elements:"
msgstr ""
"要素は, 何が変化したかを特定する情報の 1 つ 1 つです. この仕訳では 2 種類の要"
"素を使います."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:76
msgid ""
"`AccountTitles` is the built-in type of account titles. `Cash` and "
"`Deposits` are two of its values, and `Deposits` denotes savings deposits."
msgstr ""
"`AccountTitles` は組み込みの勘定科目の型です. `Cash` と `Deposits` はその値"
"で, `Deposits` は普通預金を表します."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:77
msgid ""
"`Unit` is the type that the program declares for units. `Yen` and `Dollar` "
"are units. The value `Unit` is the wildcard: it means \"any unit\" in a "
"query and \"no applicable unit\" in a recorded term."
msgstr ""
"`Unit` はこのプログラムで宣言する単位の型です. `Yen` と `Dollar` が単位を表し"
"ます. 値 `Unit` はワイルドカードで, 問い合わせでは「任意の単位」, 記録した項"
"では「該当する単位がない」ことを表します."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:79
msgid "The program imports the library and declares `Unit`:"
msgstr "プログラムはライブラリを import し, `Unit` を宣言します:"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:92
msgid ""
"The `deriving` clause and the instance `Element Unit` make the new type "
"usable as an element type. The import hides the library's `Yen` and `Dollar` "
"because their names collide with the new values."
msgstr ""
"`deriving` 節と `Element Unit` の instance を書くと, この型を要素の型として使"
"えます. ライブラリの `Yen` と `Dollar` は, 新しく宣言した値と名前が衝突するた"
"め, import で隠します."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:94
msgid ""
"The program does not use the date or the bank as an element, so its balances "
"do not distinguish dates or banks."
msgstr ""
"このプログラムは日付と銀行を要素にしないので, 残高を日付や銀行ごとに区別しま"
"せん."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:96
msgid "Base and hat base: `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)`"
msgstr "基底と Hat 基底: `HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:98
msgid ""
"A base is a tuple of elements. `(Cash, Yen)` is the base for cash in yen, "
"and `(Deposits, Yen)` is the base for savings deposits in yen. A hat base "
"pairs a base with a direction through `:<`. The definition of `withdrawal` "
"contains two hat bases, `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` and `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)`:"
msgstr ""
"基底は要素の組です. `(Cash, Yen)` は円建ての現金, `(Deposits, Yen)` は円建て"
"の普通預金の基底です. 基底に `:<` で方向を付けた組が Hat 基底です. "
"`withdrawal` の定義には, `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` と `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)` の "
"2 つの Hat 基底があります:"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:107
msgid ""
"The direction `Not` represents an increase, and `Hat` represents a decrease. "
"For revenue and expenses, they represent recognition and reversal, "
"respectively. The amount is nonnegative in both directions. The direction "
"and the account's division together determine the debit or credit side, as "
"Table 2 shows."
msgstr ""
"方向 `Not` は増加を, `Hat` は減少を表します. 収益と費用では, それぞれ発生と消"
"滅に当たります. 金額はどちらの方向でも非負です. 借方と貸方は, 表 2 のとおり, "
"方向と勘定科目の区分の組で決まります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:116
msgid ""
"_Table 2. The meaning of `Not` and `Hat` and the resulting side, by account "
"division._"
msgstr "_表 2. 勘定科目の区分ごとに見た `Not` と `Hat` の意味と貸借._"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:118
msgid ""
"Cash and deposits are assets. Thus `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` is an increase in "
"cash on the debit side, and `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)` is a decrease in "
"deposits on the credit side."
msgstr ""
"現金と普通預金は資産です. したがって, `Not :< (Cash, Yen)` は現金の増加で借"
"方, `Hat :< (Deposits, Yen)` は普通預金の減少で貸方になります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:120
msgid ""
"For a contra account, read the direction as a change in that account itself. "
"`Not` on `AccumulatedDepreciation` is an increase in accumulated "
"depreciation and falls on the credit side."
msgstr ""
"評価勘定では, 方向をその科目自身の増減として読みます. "
"`AccumulatedDepreciation` の `Not` は減価償却累計額の増加で, 貸方になります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:122
msgid ""
"**Note:** The side that increases `CashOverShort`, `IncomeSummary`, or "
"`SuspenseAccount` depends on the context. The library gives them the same "
"sides as assets: `Not` is a debit and `Hat` is a credit."
msgstr ""
"**補足:** `CashOverShort`, `IncomeSummary`, `SuspenseAccount` では, 増加が借"
"方と貸方のどちらに当たるかが文脈で決まります. ライブラリはこの 3 科目に資産と"
"同じ貸借を割り当て, `Not` を借方, `Hat` を貸方とします."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:124
msgid "Redundant algebra: `Alg`"
msgstr "冗長代数: `Alg`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:126
msgid ""
"`Alg MoneyDecimal (HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit))` is the type of a "
"redundant algebra. Its first argument is the amount type, and its second is "
"the hat base type. `MoneyDecimal` stores decimal amounts without binary "
"rounding."
msgstr ""
"`Alg MoneyDecimal (HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit))` は冗長代数の型です. 第 1 "
"引数が金額の型, 第 2 引数が Hat 基底の型です. `MoneyDecimal` は金額を 10 進数"
"のまま保持するので, 2 進数への変換による丸め誤差が生じません."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:128
msgid ""
"In the definition of `withdrawal`, `.@` attaches an amount to a hat base to "
"make a term, and `.+` adds the two terms:"
msgstr ""
"`withdrawal` の定義では, `.@` が金額を Hat 基底に付けて項を作り, `.+` が 2 つ"
"の項を加えます:"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:137
msgid ""
"The first line of the output is this sum. Addition keeps every term, even on "
"the same base. To net the terms on each base, apply `bar` explicitly."
msgstr ""
"出力の 1 行目はこの和です. 加えた項は, 基底が同じでもすべて残ります. 基底ごと"
"に相殺して集約するには, `bar` を明示的に適用してください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:139
msgid "Exchange algebra: `ExBaseClass`"
msgstr "交換代数: `ExBaseClass`"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:141
msgid ""
"The instance of `ExBaseClass` defines where the account title is in the "
"base. `getAccountTitle` reads the title, and `setAccountTitle` replaces it "
"while keeping the direction and the unit. `FlexibleInstances` permits this "
"instance declaration."
msgstr ""
"`ExBaseClass` の instance には, 基底のどこに勘定科目があるかを書きます. "
"`getAccountTitle` は勘定科目を読み出し, `setAccountTitle` は方向と単位を保っ"
"たまま勘定科目を置き換えます. この instance の宣言には `FlexibleInstances` が"
"必要です."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:150
msgid ""
"With this instance, the redundant algebra is an exchange algebra, and three "
"more functions are available. `main` prints their results after the sum:"
msgstr ""
"この instance があると冗長代数は交換代数になり, 次の 3 つの関数を使えます. "
"`main` は和に続けてそれらの結果を出力します:"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:162
msgid ""
"`decL` selects the debit (left) terms, which form the second line of the "
"output."
msgstr "`decL` は借方 (左) の項を選びます. 出力の 2 行目に当たります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:163
msgid "`decR` selects the credit (right) terms, which form the third line."
msgstr "`decR` は貸方 (右) の項を選びます. 出力の 3 行目に当たります."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:164
msgid ""
"`balance` compares the debit and credit totals. The last line, `True`, means "
"that they agree."
msgstr ""
"`balance` は借方と貸方の合計を比べます. 最終行の `True` は, 両者の一致を表し"
"ます."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:166
msgid ""
"`balance` compares amounts only. It does not detect a wrong account title or "
"convert between units, so apply it to terms in a single unit."
msgstr ""
"`balance` は金額だけを比べます. 勘定科目の誤りの検出や単位の換算はしないの"
"で, 単位が 1 種類の項に適用してください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:168
msgid "Use the program for your entry"
msgstr "手元の仕訳に使う"

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:170
msgid ""
"To record another entry in yen, change three parts of each term in "
"`withdrawal`:"
msgstr ""
"円建ての別の仕訳を記録するには, `withdrawal` の各項で次の 3 か所を書き換えて"
"ください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:172
msgid ""
"Replace the account title with one from [Built-in account titles](../"
"accounts/builtin.md)."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目を[組み込みの勘定科目](../accounts/builtin.md)から選んだ科目に置き換"
"えてください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:173
msgid "Select `Not` or `Hat` from Table 2."
msgstr "表 2 から `Not` か `Hat` を選んでください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:174
msgid ""
"Replace `3000` with a nonnegative amount. `.@` stops with an error for a "
"negative amount."
msgstr ""
"`3000` を非負の金額に置き換えてください. 負の金額を渡すと, `.@` はエラーで停"
"止します."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:176
msgid ""
"If the entry has more than two terms, join the additional terms with `.+`. "
"Run the program again, and check that the last line is `True`."
msgstr ""
"項が 3 つ以上あるときは, 追加する項を `.+` でつないでください. プログラムを再"
"実行し, 最終行が `True` であることを確かめてください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:178
msgid ""
"If this form is sufficient, continue with [Transfers](../exchange/"
"transfer.md). To customize it, read the chapter for the component that you "
"want to change:"
msgstr ""
"この形で足りる場合は, [振替](../exchange/transfer.md)の章へ進んでください. カ"
"スタマイズする場合は, 変更する構成要素に応じて次の章を読んでください."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:180
msgid "To declare or add an element, read [Elements](../algebra/elements.md)."
msgstr ""
"要素を宣言または追加する場合は, [要素](../algebra/elements.md)の章を読んでく"
"ださい."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:181
msgid ""
"To change the combination of elements, read [Bases](../algebra/bases.md)."
msgstr ""
"要素の組み合わせを変える場合は, [基底](../algebra/bases.md)の章を読んでくださ"
"い."

#: src/usage/withdrawal.md:182
msgid ""
"To change the amount type or use other operations, read [Redundant and "
"exchange algebras](../algebra/redundant.md)."
msgstr ""
"金額の型を変更するか, 別の演算を使うには, [冗長代数と交換代数](../algebra/"
"redundant.md)を読んでください."

