#: src/algebra/bases.md:163
msgid ""
"**Caution:** `Hat` represents a direction on a nonnegative amount. The "
"account and direction together determine the debit or credit side. Use "
"`HatNot` in query patterns. Some direction tests and reversal methods fail "
"on `HatNot`."
msgstr ""
"**注意:** `Hat` は非負の金額に付く向きを表します. 借方か貸方かは勘定科目と向"
"きの組み合わせで決まります. `HatNot` は問い合わせのパターンに使ってください. "
"向きの判定や反転の一部のメソッドは, `HatNot` が渡されると失敗します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:169
msgid "BaseClass"
msgstr "BaseClass"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:171
msgid ""
"`BaseClass a` requires `Element a` and provides `compareBase :: a -> a -> "
"Ordering`, defaulting to `compareElement`. Built-in base types with a single "
"element include `AccountTitles`, `CountUnit`, `Text` (also called `Name`), "
"`Day`, `TimeOfDay`, and `Wild a` when `a` has `Ord`, `Show`, `Hashable`, and "
"`Typeable` instances. Tuples of 2 through 7 element types have `BaseClass` "
"instances even when individual element types have no separate `BaseClass` "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"`BaseClass a` は `Element a` を要求し, `compareBase :: a -> a -> Ordering` を"
"提供します. 既定の実装は `compareElement` です. 要素が 1 つの組み込みの基底型"
"には, `AccountTitles`, `CountUnit`, `Text` (`Name` とも呼びます), `Day`, "
"`TimeOfDay` があります. `a` が `Ord`, `Show`, `Hashable`, `Typeable` の "
"instance を持つ場合は, `Wild a` も単独の基底型として使えます. 2 個から 7 個の"
"要素の型のタプルは, 個々の要素の型が単独では `BaseClass` の instance を持たな"
"くても, `BaseClass` の instance を持ちます."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:173
msgid "HatBaseClass"
msgstr "HatBaseClass"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:175
msgid ""
"`HatBaseClass` requires `BaseClass` for both the whole hat base and its "
"`BasePart`, and `AxisDecompose` for `BasePart`. `AxisDecompose` supplies a "
"key for each element of the base. Its generic and tuple instances cover the "
"bases used in the withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"`HatBaseClass` は Hat 基底全体とその `BasePart` の両方に `BaseClass` を, "
"`BasePart` に `AxisDecompose` を要求します. `AxisDecompose` は要素ごとにキー"
"を提供します. その generic の instance とタプルの instance は, 引き出しで使う"
"基底に対応しています."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:177
msgid "Associated type or method"
msgstr "関連型またはメソッド"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:179
msgid "`BasePart a`"
msgstr "`BasePart a`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:179
msgid ""
"The base type after removing the direction. For `HatBase a`, this is `a`."
msgstr "方向を取り除いた基底の型です. `HatBase a` の場合は `a` です."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:180
msgid "`base`, `hat`"
msgstr "`base`, `hat`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:180
msgid "Extract the underlying base and direction."
msgstr "方向を付ける前の基底と方向を取り出します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:181
msgid "`merge`"
msgstr "`merge`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:181
msgid "Build a hat base from a direction and a base part."
msgstr "方向と基底部分から Hat 基底を構築します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:182
msgid "`toHat`, `toNot`"
msgstr "`toHat`, `toNot`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:182
msgid "Set the direction while retaining the base."
msgstr "基底を保持して方向を設定します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:183
msgid "`revHat`"
msgstr "`revHat`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:183
msgid "Exchange `Hat` and `Not`."
msgstr "`Hat` と `Not` を入れ替えます."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:184
msgid "`isHat`, `isNot`"
msgstr "`isHat`, `isNot`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:184
msgid "Test the direction."
msgstr "方向を判定します."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:185
msgid "`compareHatBase`"
msgstr "`compareHatBase`"

#: src/algebra/bases.md:185
msgid "Compare hat bases; its default is `compareBase`."
msgstr "Hat 基底を比較します. 既定の実装は `compareBase` です."

#: src/algebra/bases.md:187
msgid ""
"A custom representation must implement `BasePart`, `base`, `hat`, `merge`, "
"`toHat`, `toNot`, `revHat`, `isHat`, and `isNot`. Reconstruction must "
"preserve the underlying base and direction. Reversing twice must restore a "
"concrete base. `HatBase a` already implements these operations. The bare "
"`Hat` type has an instance with the single-value `BaseForSingleHat` as its "
"base part."
msgstr ""
"独自の表現では, `BasePart`, `base`, `hat`, `merge`, `toHat`, `toNot`, "
"`revHat`, `isHat`, `isNot` を実装する必要があります. 再構築では方向を付ける前"
"の基底と方向を保持する必要があります. 2 回の反転で具体的な基底が元に戻る必要"
"があります. `HatBase a` はこれらの演算をすでに実装しています. 単独の `Hat` 型"
"には, 単一の値を持つ `BaseForSingleHat` を基底部分とする instance があります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:3
msgid ""
"Compare amount types, work with a month's terms, and read debit and credit "
"differences. The examples use exchangealgebra-0.7.0.0 and keep the account-"
"and-unit base from [Record a withdrawal](../usage/withdrawal.md)."
msgstr ""
"金額の型を比較し, 月内の項を演算して, 借方と貸方の差額を求めます. 例は "
"exchangealgebra-0.7.0.0 を使い, [引き出しを記録する](../usage/withdrawal.md)"
"と同じく基底には勘定科目と単位を使います."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:5 src/algebra/redundant.md:563
msgid "Amount types"
msgstr "金額の型"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:7
msgid "Choose an amount type"
msgstr "金額の型を選ぶ"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:9
msgid ""
"Keep `MoneyDecimal` when you need exact decimal amounts. Its decimal "
"arithmetic represents 3,000 yen and the sum of the term amounts exactly. "
"Axioms 4 and 5 hold exactly when the amounts, intermediate sums, and "
"products are representable. The [numerical conditions on the axioms]"
"(definitions.md#five-axioms) distinguish exact arithmetic from a rounded "
"readout."
msgstr ""
"厳密な十進の金額が必要な場合は, `MoneyDecimal` を使い続けてください. この型の"
"十進演算では, 3,000 円と項の金額の合計を厳密に表せます. 金額, 途中の和, 積が"
"表現可能なとき, 公理 4 と 5 は厳密に成り立ちます. 厳密な演算と丸めを伴う読み"
"出しの違いは, [公理が成り立つ数値上の条件](definitions.md#five-axioms)を参照"
"してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:11
msgid ""
"`MoneyDecimal` has an integer mantissa and a scale of up to 255 decimal "
"places. A product is exact when representable; division can require "
"rounding. `bankersRound` explicitly rounds to a chosen number of decimal "
"places, with ties to even, when a monetary amount must be finalized."
msgstr ""
"`MoneyDecimal` は整数の仮数と最大 255 桁の小数桁数を持ちます. 表現可能な積は"
"正確ですが, 除算には丸めが必要な場合があります. 金額を確定する必要があるとき"
"は, `bankersRound` で指定した小数桁数へ明示的に丸めます. 端数がちょうど中間の"
"場合は偶数丸めになります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:13
msgid ""
"Build the entry with `withdrawalWithAmount`. Both terms use the amount type "
"of its argument."
msgstr ""
"`withdrawalWithAmount` で仕訳を組み立てます. 両方の項に引数の金額型を使いま"
"す."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:16 src/algebra/redundant.md:375
msgid "-- | Build the entry with the chosen nonnegative amount of each term.\n"
msgstr "-- | 指定された非負の金額を各項に使い, 仕訳を組み立てます.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:22
msgid ""
"`MoneyDouble` wraps binary floating-point `Double`. Give the entry the "
"amount type `MoneyDouble` to compare binary and decimal arithmetic on the "
"same terms."
msgstr ""
"`MoneyDouble` は二進浮動小数点型の `Double` を包む型です. 同じ項で二進演算と"
"十進演算を比較するには, 仕訳の金額型に `MoneyDouble` を指定してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:25 src/algebra/redundant.md:384
msgid "-- | The same withdrawal with binary floating-point amounts.\n"
msgstr "-- | 同じ引き出しを二進浮動小数点の金額で表します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:30
msgid "Compare portions of the withdrawal"
msgstr "引き出しの一部を比較する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:32
msgid ""
"Scale the entry by 10% and 20%. The code compares adding the two scaled "
"entries with adding the ratios before scaling."
msgstr ""
"仕訳を 10% と 20% に縮小します. コードでは, 縮小した 2 つの仕訳を足した結果"
"と, 比率を先に足してから縮小した結果を比べます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:35 src/algebra/redundant.md:388
msgid ""
"-- | Compare separate 10% and 20% portions with one combined 30% portion.\n"
msgstr "-- | 個別の 10% と 20% の配分を, 合わせた 30% の配分と比較します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:39 src/algebra/redundant.md:393
msgid ""
"-- | Binary rounding can distinguish the two constructions of the portions.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 二進数の丸めにより, 配分の 2 つの構築方法で違いが生じる場合があります.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:47 src/algebra/redundant.md:479
msgid "-- | Compare decimal and binary results of fractional scaling.\n"
msgstr "-- | 割合を掛けた十進演算と二進演算の結果を比較します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:50 src/algebra/redundant.md:483
msgid "\"Decimal portion totals (separate, combined)\""
msgstr "\"Decimal portion totals (separate, combined)\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:51 src/algebra/redundant.md:484
msgid "\"Binary portion totals (separate, combined)\""
msgstr "\"Binary portion totals (separate, combined)\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:59
msgid ""
"The decimal calculations agree. In binary arithmetic, `0.1 + 0.2` rounds "
"before multiplication. Both totals count the cash and deposit terms, so the "
"30% portion counts 1,800 yen across both terms and 900 yen on the cash term "
"alone. For finite stored amounts, `norm` sums exactly in an accumulator and "
"rounds once. Each stored amount already includes any rounding from its "
"construction or scaling."
msgstr ""
"十進演算の結果は一致します. 二進演算では, 乗算の前に `0.1 + 0.2` が丸められま"
"す. 合計には現金と預金の両方の項が入るため, 30% に当たる金額は両方の項を合計"
"すると 1,800 円, 現金の項だけでは 900 円です. 記録された金額が有限なら, "
"`norm` は累積器で厳密に加算し, 最後に 1 回丸めます. 項を作るときや比率を掛け"
"るときに生じた丸めは, 記録された金額にすでに含まれています."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:61
msgid "Construction and scalar checks"
msgstr "構築時とスカラーの検査"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:63
msgid ""
"The value types, including `MoneyDecimal`, can represent negative numbers. "
"The constructor `.@` rejects negative or non-finite term amounts. It checks "
"the direction first and rejects `HatNot` even for zero; a zero amount with a "
"concrete direction gives `Zero`."
msgstr ""
"`MoneyDecimal` などの値型は負の数も表せます. コンストラクタ `.@` は負または非"
"有限の項の金額を拒否します. 先に向きを調べるため, 金額がゼロでも `HatNot` は"
"拒否されます. 向きが `Hat` または `Not` なら, 金額ゼロに対して `Zero` を返し"
"ます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:65
msgid ""
"For scalar multiplication, any scalar times `Zero` gives `Zero`, and a zero "
"scalar times an algebra gives `Zero`. These shortcuts are processed before "
"scalar validation. A negative or non-finite scalar applied to a nonzero "
"algebra raises `error`. Finite floating-point inputs do not guarantee finite "
"products."
msgstr ""
"スカラー倍では, どのスカラーを `Zero` に掛けても `Zero` になり, ゼロのスカ"
"ラーを代数に掛けても `Zero` になります. これらの簡約はスカラーの検証前に処理"
"されます. ゼロでない代数に負または非有限のスカラーを適用すると, `error` が発"
"生します. 有限の浮動小数点入力でも, 積が有限になる保証はありません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:67
msgid "Run the amount checks"
msgstr "金額の検査を実行する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:69
msgid ""
"Catch the documented construction errors in the example so that the program "
"can report every check:"
msgstr ""
"プログラムがすべての検査を報告できるように, 例の中で文書に記載された構築エ"
"ラーを捕捉してください:"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:76 src/algebra/redundant.md:398
msgid "-- | Report whether construction raises the documented ErrorCall.\n"
msgstr "-- | 構築時に文書に記載された ErrorCall が発生するかを報告します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:87 src/algebra/redundant.md:485
msgid "-- | Check invalid amounts, directions, and scalars.\n"
msgstr "-- | 不正な金額, 向き, スカラーを検査します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:90 src/algebra/redundant.md:489
msgid "\"Negative amount rejected\""
msgstr "\"Negative amount rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:91 src/algebra/redundant.md:490
msgid "\"Infinite amount rejected\""
msgstr "\"Infinite amount rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:92 src/algebra/redundant.md:491
msgid "\"NaN amount rejected\""
msgstr "\"NaN amount rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:93 src/algebra/redundant.md:492
msgid "\"Wildcard side rejected\""
msgstr "\"Wildcard side rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:94 src/algebra/redundant.md:493
msgid "\"Negative scalar rejected\""
msgstr "\"Negative scalar rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:95 src/algebra/redundant.md:494
msgid "\"Infinite scalar rejected\""
msgstr "\"Infinite scalar rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:96 src/algebra/redundant.md:495
msgid "\"NaN scalar rejected\""
msgstr "\"NaN scalar rejected\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:97 src/algebra/redundant.md:496
msgid "\"Negative scalar times Zero\""
msgstr "\"Negative scalar times Zero\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:99 src/algebra/redundant.md:498
msgid "\"Zero scalar times withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Zero scalar times withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:114
msgid ""
"Application code must validate external amounts before constructing terms."
msgstr ""
"アプリケーションコードでは, 項を構築する前に外部からの金額を検証する必要があ"
"ります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:116
msgid "Declare a custom yen amount type"
msgstr "独自の円金額の型を宣言する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:118
msgid ""
"A custom value type requires its own validation and accumulator operations. "
"`YenAmount` represents rational yen amounts, so even a fractional allocation "
"such as one seventh is exact. The accumulator can hold signed differences "
"internally, while negative values remain invalid as terms. The default "
"`postingUpperBound` is appropriate because rational amounts have no "
"magnitude bound and no NaN or infinities."
msgstr ""
"独自の値の型には, その型固有の検証とアキュムレーターの演算が必要です. "
"`YenAmount` は有理数の円金額を表すので, 7 分の 1 のような分数による配分も正確"
"です. アキュムレーターは内部で符号付きの差を保持できますが, 項として負の値は"
"無効のままです. 有理数の金額には大きさの上限がなく, NaN も無限大もないので, "
"既定の `postingUpperBound` が適しています."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:121 src/algebra/redundant.md:407
msgid ""
"-- | Yen amounts with exact rational arithmetic; negative values cannot be "
"posted.\n"
msgstr "-- | 正確な有理数演算による円金額です. 負の値は項にできません.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:128 src/algebra/redundant.md:415
msgid ""
"-- The accumulator may be signed even though terms must be nonnegative.\n"
msgstr "-- 項は非負でなければなりませんが, アキュムレーターは符号を持てます.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:160 src/algebra/redundant.md:499
msgid "-- | Print the entry with rational yen amounts.\n"
msgstr "-- | 円の金額を有理数で表した仕訳を表示します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:163 src/algebra/redundant.md:503
msgid "\"Rational yen withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Rational yen withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:173
msgid ""
"The [operations of Definition 6](definitions.md#operations) apply to each "
"term or full base as specified. For example, `norm withdrawal` counts both "
"terms and gives 6,000 yen. `2 .* withdrawal` doubles each term while keeping "
"its base and direction."
msgstr ""
"[定義 6 の演算](definitions.md#operations)は, 演算に応じて個々の項または基底"
"全体に作用します. 例えば `norm withdrawal` は両方の項を数えるので 6,000 円で"
"す. `2 .* withdrawal` は, 基底と向きを保ったまま各項の金額を 2 倍にします."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:175
msgid "Add the month's transactions"
msgstr "月内の取引を加える"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:177
msgid ""
"Suppose the business withdraws another 2,000 yen on January 15, buys goods "
"for 500 yen in cash on January 20, and exchanges 1,500 yen in cash for 10 "
"dollars on January 25. The exchange has no fee and uses 150 yen per dollar. "
"Record each transaction and add it to the month:"
msgstr ""
"事業者が 1 月 15 日にさらに 2,000 円を引き出し, 1 月 20 日に現金 500 円で商品"
"を購入し, 1 月 25 日に現金 1,500 円を 10 ドルに両替するとします. 両替に手数料"
"はなく, 1 ドルを 150 円とします. 各取引を記録し, 月の記録に加えてください:"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:180 src/algebra/redundant.md:444
#: src/journal/journal.md:107
msgid "-- | January 15: withdraw another 2,000 yen.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 15 日: さらに 2,000 円を引き出します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:184 src/algebra/redundant.md:449
msgid ""
"-- | January 20: buy goods for 500 yen in cash, recorded as Purchases.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 20 日: 現金 500 円で商品を購入し, Purchases に記録します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:189 src/algebra/redundant.md:454
msgid ""
"-- | January 25: exchange 1,500 yen in cash for 10 dollars, with no fee.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 25 日: 手数料なしで現金 1,500 円を 10 ドルに両替します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:194 src/algebra/redundant.md:459
msgid "-- | Changes recorded during the month, with no opening balances.\n"
msgstr "-- | 期首残高を含まない, 月内に記録された変化です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:200
msgid ""
"`month` contains the recorded changes without opening balances. Adding the "
"withdrawals with `.+` retains the cash increases of 3,000 and 2,000 as "
"separate amounts on `(Cash, Yen)`. The cash payment and currency exchange "
"also retain separate decreases on that base. No implicit sum or cancellation "
"occurs at a shared base."
msgstr ""
"`month` は期首残高を含まず, 記録された変化を含みます. `.+` で引き出しを加算す"
"ると, `(Cash, Yen)` 上の現金増加 3,000 と 2,000 は別々の金額として保持されま"
"す. 現金払いと両替による減少も, その基底上で別々に保持されます. 同じ基底上で"
"も, 暗黙の合算や相殺は行われません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:202
msgid ""
"The payment uses `Purchases` for the goods purchased. The exchange reduces "
"yen cash and increases dollar cash; the two currencies remain distinct "
"currency elements."
msgstr ""
"現金で購入した商品は `Purchases` に記録します. 両替で円の現金は減り, ドルの現"
"金は増えます. 2 つの通貨は別々の単位要素として保たれます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:204
msgid "Select an operation"
msgstr "演算を選ぶ"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:206
msgid ""
"**What cash remains in each currency?** Apply `bar` to net the changes "
"within each full base, then `proj` to select Cash without restricting the "
"unit. The yen cash change is 3,000 + 2,000 - 500 - 1,500 = 3,000 yen, and "
"the dollar cash change is 10 dollars. These are balances of the recorded "
"changes; the yen deposit decrease also requires an opening balance to "
"determine the deposit still held."
msgstr ""
"**各通貨の現金はいくら残りますか?** `bar` を適用して完全な基底ごとに変化を相"
"殺し, 次に `proj` で単位を制限せずに Cash を選択してください. 円の現金の変化"
"は 3,000 + 2,000 - 500 - 1,500 = 3,000 円で, ドルの現金の変化は 10 ドルです. "
"これらは記録された変化の残高です. 円の預金の減少についても, 残っている預金を"
"求めるには期首残高が必要です."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:208
msgid ""
"**What is the total of the yen terms?** Select all yen bases with `proj`, "
"then apply `norm`. This measures gross amounts in those terms, counting both "
"directions and both accounts of the withdrawals. It is not a net cash flow. "
"Select a unit before totaling: adding yen and dollar amounts without "
"conversion does not produce a monetary total in either currency."
msgstr ""
"**円の項の合計はいくらですか?** `proj` ですべての円の基底を選択し, 次に "
"`norm` を適用してください. これは記録された金額の総額を測り, 引き出しの両方向"
"と両勘定科目を数えます. 純キャッシュフローではありません. 合計する前に単位を"
"選択してください. 換算せずに円とドルの金額を足しても, どちらの通貨建ての金額"
"の合計としても意味を持ちません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:210
msgid ""
"**Which cash changes were recorded in yen?** Select `(Cash, Yen)` without "
"applying `bar`. The original term amounts remain available in the selected "
"algebra."
msgstr ""
"**円の現金の増減として何が記録されましたか.** `bar` を適用せずに `(Cash, "
"Yen)` を抽出します. 抽出した冗長代数の元には元の各項の金額が残ります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:213 src/algebra/redundant.md:463
msgid ""
"-- | Remaining cash by currency after canceling changes within each full "
"base.\n"
msgstr "-- | 完全な基底ごとに変化を相殺した後の, 通貨別の現金残高です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:216 src/algebra/redundant.md:467
msgid "-- | Original yen terms on every account and in both directions.\n"
msgstr "-- | すべての勘定科目と両方向にわたる, 元の円の項です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:220 src/algebra/redundant.md:471
msgid "-- | Original cash terms in yen, before aggregation.\n"
msgstr "-- | 集約前の, 円建ての現金の項です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:226
msgid ""
"The query `HatNot :< (Cash, (.#))` restricts the account but leaves "
"direction and currency unrestricted. `HatNot :< ((.#), Yen)` restricts the "
"currency but leaves account and direction unrestricted. A query wildcard "
"matches any stored element. A concrete query element matches only an equal "
"stored element, as in [Query bases by their elements](elements.md#query-"
"elements-and-combine-them-into-bases)."
msgstr ""
"問い合わせ `HatNot :< (Cash, (.#))` は勘定科目を制限し, 方向と通貨は制限しま"
"せん. `HatNot :< ((.#), Yen)` は通貨を制限し, 勘定科目と方向は制限しません. "
"問い合わせのワイルドカードは記録されたどの要素にも一致します. 具体的な要素を"
"指定した問い合わせは, 等しい要素が記録されている場合だけ一致します. [要素を指"
"定して基底を問い合わせる](elements.md#query-elements-and-combine-them-into-"
"bases)を参照してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:228
msgid ""
"**What are the cash increases and decreases separately?** `compress "
"yenCashTerms` totals each direction independently. It gives an increase "
"total of 5,000 yen and a decrease total of 2,000 yen. `bar` instead cancels "
"the totals and leaves the increase of 3,000 yen. Both operations explicitly "
"discard individual term detail."
msgstr ""
"**現金の増加と減少はそれぞれいくらですか.** `compress yenCashTerms` は向きご"
"とに集計します. 増加は合計 5,000 円, 減少は合計 2,000 円です. `bar` は 2 つの"
"合計を相殺し, 3,000 円の増加を残します. いずれの演算も個々の項の内訳を明示的"
"に捨てます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:230
msgid ""
"**What reverses the withdrawal?** `(.^) withdrawal` changes the cash "
"increase into a decrease and the deposit decrease into an increase. Every "
"amount remains 3,000. Adding this value to `withdrawal` keeps both sets of "
"terms; applying `bar` to the sum gives zero. Applying hat twice restores the "
"original directions."
msgstr ""
"**引き出しを取り消すにはどうしますか.** `(.^) withdrawal` は現金の増加を減少"
"に, 預金の減少を増加に変えます. どちらの金額も 3,000 円のままです. この冗長代"
"数の元を `withdrawal` に足すと両方の項が残り, その和に `bar` を適用するとゼロ"
"になります. Hat 演算を 2 回適用すると元の向きに戻ります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:232
msgid "Run the queries"
msgstr "問い合わせを実行する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:234
msgid "Print each answer with the question or operation that produced it:"
msgstr "各回答を, その回答を得た問い合わせまたは演算とともに表示してください:"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:237 src/algebra/redundant.md:505
msgid "-- | Print scaling, projection, netting, and reversal results.\n"
msgstr "-- | スカラー倍, 射影, 相殺, 向きの反転の結果を表示します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:240 src/algebra/redundant.md:509
msgid "\"Twice the withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Twice the withdrawal\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:241 src/algebra/redundant.md:510
msgid "\"Withdrawal term total in yen\""
msgstr "\"Withdrawal term total in yen\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:242 src/algebra/redundant.md:511
msgid "\"Yen cash terms before aggregation\""
msgstr "\"Yen cash terms before aggregation\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:243 src/algebra/redundant.md:512
msgid "\"Cash balances by currency\""
msgstr "\"Cash balances by currency\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:244 src/algebra/redundant.md:513
msgid "\"Yen terms without cancellation\""
msgstr "\"Yen terms without cancellation\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:245 src/algebra/redundant.md:514
msgid "\"Yen term total\""
msgstr "\"Yen term total\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:246 src/algebra/redundant.md:515
msgid "\"Yen cash totals by direction\""
msgstr "\"Yen cash totals by direction\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:247 src/algebra/redundant.md:516
msgid "\"Yen cash residual amount\""
msgstr "\"Yen cash residual amount\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:248 src/algebra/redundant.md:517
msgid "\"Reverse the withdrawal directions\""
msgstr "\"Reverse the withdrawal directions\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:249 src/algebra/redundant.md:518
msgid "\"Withdrawal plus its hat, before bar\""
msgstr "\"Withdrawal plus its hat, before bar\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:250 src/algebra/redundant.md:519
msgid "\"Withdrawal plus its hat, after bar\""
msgstr "\"Withdrawal plus its hat, after bar\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:269
msgid ""
"`Yen cash terms before aggregation` retains the separate withdrawal and "
"payment amounts. `Cash balances by currency` contains the net cash changes "
"in yen and dollars, while `Yen term total` counts the gross yen amounts on "
"every account. `Yen cash totals by direction` contains the separate increase "
"and decrease totals. The named withdrawal-plus-hat results distinguish "
"retaining opposing terms from canceling them with bar."
msgstr ""
"`Yen cash terms before aggregation` は, 引き出しと支払いの金額を別々に保持し"
"ています. `Cash balances by currency` は円とドルの現金の純変化を含み, `Yen "
"term total` はすべての勘定科目にわたる円金額の総額を数えます. `Yen cash "
"totals by direction` は増加と減少の合計を別々に含みます. 引き出しとその hat "
"の和の名前付きの結果では, 逆方向の項を保持する場合と, bar で相殺する場合を区"
"別しています."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:271
msgid ""
"The displayed sequence order can differ from the source expression's order. "
"Construction routes can arrange the same terms differently, and structural "
"`Eq` can observe that arrangement. Do not infer chronological order from the "
"printed algebra. When comparing aggregated content, choose an explicit "
"`compress` or `bar` according to whether the opposing directions must remain "
"separate."
msgstr ""
"表示される列の順序は, 元の式の順序と異なる場合があります. 構築経路によって同"
"じ項の並び方が変わり, 構造的な `Eq` はその並び方を区別できます. 表示された代"
"数から時系列の順序を推測しないでください. 集約した内容を比較するときは, 逆方"
"向を別々に保持する必要があるかに応じて, `compress` または `bar` を明示的に選"
"んでください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:273 src/algebra/redundant.md:612
msgid "Exchange algebra"
msgstr "交換代数"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:275
msgid "Read the debit and credit difference"
msgstr "借方と貸方の差額を求める"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:277
msgid ""
"Use `diffRL` to find the larger side and the difference. The function "
"compares exact totals before rounding the difference once. It returns "
"`(Side, 0)` when the totals agree, as they do for the withdrawal."
msgstr ""
"金額の大きい側と差額は `diffRL` で求めます. この関数は厳密な合計を比較し, 差"
"額を 1 回だけ丸めます. 引き出しのように両方の合計が一致すると, `(Side, 0)` を"
"返します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:280 src/algebra/redundant.md:520
msgid "-- | Print each side's yen total and the difference rounded once.\n"
msgstr "-- | 円建ての借方と貸方の合計と, 差額を一度丸めた結果を表示します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:283 src/algebra/redundant.md:524
msgid "\"Debit total in yen\""
msgstr "\"Debit total in yen\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:284 src/algebra/redundant.md:525
msgid "\"Credit total in yen\""
msgstr "\"Credit total in yen\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:285 src/algebra/redundant.md:526
msgid "\"Debit-credit difference\""
msgstr "\"Debit-credit difference\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:294
msgid "Classify an account and check its side"
msgstr "勘定科目を分類し貸借区分を調べる"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:296
msgid ""
"`whatDiv` gives the account division and `whichSide` uses both the account "
"and the direction. `whatPIMO` gives the account's role in an exchange, and "
"`fixedCurrent` classifies the account as current, fixed, or other. The "
"example classifies cash as `PS` (plus stock) and `Current`."
msgstr ""
"`whatDiv` は勘定科目の区分を返し, `whichSide` は勘定科目と向きから借方か貸方"
"かを決めます. `whatPIMO` は交換における勘定科目の役割を返し, `fixedCurrent` "
"は流動, 固定, その他のいずれかに分類します. この例では, 現金は `PS` (プラス・"
"ストック) かつ `Current` です."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:299 src/algebra/redundant.md:527
msgid "-- | Print account classifications and the sides of selected terms.\n"
msgstr "-- | 勘定科目の分類と, 対象の項の貸借区分を表示します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:302 src/algebra/redundant.md:531
msgid "\"Cash division\""
msgstr "\"Cash division\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:303 src/algebra/redundant.md:532
msgid "\"Cash increase side\""
msgstr "\"Cash increase side\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:304 src/algebra/redundant.md:533
msgid "\"Deposit decrease side\""
msgstr "\"Deposit decrease side\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:305 src/algebra/redundant.md:534
msgid "\"Cash PIMO class\""
msgstr "\"Cash PIMO class\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:306 src/algebra/redundant.md:535
msgid "\"Cash maturity class\""
msgstr "\"Cash maturity class\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:317
msgid ""
"See [Account titles and their attributes](../accounts/attributes.md) for the "
"registry fields behind these classifications."
msgstr ""
"これらの分類に使う登録表の欄は[勘定科目と属性](../accounts/attributes.md)を参"
"照してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:319
msgid "Compare amounts in one currency"
msgstr "同じ通貨の金額を比較する"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:321
msgid ""
"Select a single unit before calling `diffRL` or `balance`. For the month's "
"currency exchange, the yen terms have a credit excess of 1,500 yen and the "
"dollar terms have a debit excess of 10 dollars. For a joint comparison, "
"convert the amounts to one unit first."
msgstr ""
"`diffRL` や `balance` を呼ぶ前に, 単位を 1 つに絞ってください. 月内の両替で"
"は, 円の項は貸方が 1,500 円多く, ドルの項は借方が 10 ドル多くなります. 全体を"
"比較するには, 先に金額を同じ単位に換算してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:324 src/algebra/redundant.md:536
msgid "-- | Read each currency's difference on its own.\n"
msgstr "-- | 通貨ごとに借方と貸方の差額を求めます.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:327 src/algebra/redundant.md:540
msgid "\"Exchange difference in yen\""
msgstr "\"Exchange difference in yen\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:329 src/algebra/redundant.md:542
msgid "\"Exchange difference in dollars\""
msgstr "\"Exchange difference in dollars\""

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:359
msgid "-- | Currency elements for the withdrawal.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しの通貨の要素です.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:370 src/exchange/transfer.md:36
#: src/journal/journal.md:52
msgid "-- | Account access for the custom account-and-currency base.\n"
msgstr "-- | 自作の勘定科目と通貨の基底で勘定科目へアクセスします.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:380
msgid "-- | The January 10 withdrawal with decimal amounts.\n"
msgstr "-- | 十進の金額で記録した 1 月 10 日の引き出し.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:544
msgid ""
"-- | Run the amount, operation, and exchange examples in chapter order.\n"
msgstr "-- | 金額, 演算, 交換代数の例を章の順に実行します.\n"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:565
msgid "HatVal methods and laws"
msgstr "HatVal のメソッドと法則"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:567
msgid ""
"`HatVal` requires `Show`, `Ord`, `Eq`, `Nearly`, `Fractional`, and `Num`. "
"Built-in instances include `MoneyDecimal`, `MoneyDouble`, and bare `Double`."
msgstr ""
"`HatVal` は `Show`, `Ord`, `Eq`, `Nearly`, `Fractional`, `Num` を要求します. "
"組み込みの instance には `MoneyDecimal`, `MoneyDouble`, 単独の `Double` があ"
"ります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:569
msgid "Methods"
msgstr "メソッド"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:571
msgid "`zeroValue`, `isZeroValue`"
msgstr "`zeroValue`, `isZeroValue`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:571
msgid "Define zero and test it. `isZeroValue` has an equality-based default."
msgstr ""
"ゼロを定義し, ゼロかどうかを判定します. `isZeroValue` は等値比較に基づく既定"
"の実装を持ちます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:572
msgid "`valueError`"
msgstr "`valueError`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:572
msgid ""
"Return `Nothing` for a finite nonnegative value, `Just NegativeValue` for a "
"negative finite value, or `Just NonFiniteValue` for NaN or either infinity."
msgstr ""
"有限の非負値には `Nothing`, 有限の負値には `Just NegativeValue`, NaN またはい"
"ずれかの無限大には `Just NonFiniteValue` を返します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:573
msgid "`postingUpperBound`"
msgstr "`postingUpperBound`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:573
msgid ""
"An optional bound used by checked term construction. Its default is "
"`Nothing`; the floating-point instances use a bound of 2^900."
msgstr ""
"検査付きで項を構築するときに使う, 任意の上限です. 既定値は `Nothing` です. 浮"
"動小数点の instance は 2^900 を上限に使います."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:574
msgid "`showValue`"
msgstr "`showValue`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:574
msgid ""
"Render an amount inside the algebra's `Show` output. Decimal amounts retain "
"decimal formatting; floating-point amounts use the instance's formatting."
msgstr ""
"代数の `Show` 出力の中で金額を表示します. 十進数の金額は十進数の書式を保持"
"し, 浮動小数点の金額はその instance の書式を使います."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:575
msgid "Associated data family `Accum n`"
msgstr "関連データ族 `Accum n`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:575
msgid ""
"Represent an exact signed sum, including special states if the value type "
"has NaN or infinities."
msgstr ""
"正確な符号付きの和を表します. 値の型が NaN または無限大を持つ場合は, その特殊"
"な状態も含みます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:576
msgid "`emptyAccum`, `addAccum`, `mergeAccum`, `negateAccum`"
msgstr "`emptyAccum`, `addAccum`, `mergeAccum`, `negateAccum`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:576
msgid "Construct and combine exact sums and differences."
msgstr "正確な和と差を構築し, 結合します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:577
msgid "`signAccum`, `roundAccum`, `exactAccum`"
msgstr "`signAccum`, `roundAccum`, `exactAccum`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:577
msgid ""
"Observe the sign, round once to an amount, or read a finite sum as a "
"`Rational`."
msgstr ""
"符号の観測, 金額への 1 回の丸め, または有限の和の `Rational` としての読み出し"
"を行います."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:578
msgid "`splitAccum`"
msgstr "`splitAccum`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:578
msgid ""
"Split a positive exact sum into positive finite amounts with that same exact "
"total. Return `Nothing` for nonpositive or non-finite states, or when the "
"rounded total is infinite."
msgstr ""
"正確な正の和を, 正確な合計が同じになる正の有限な金額に分割します. 正でない状"
"態や非有限の状態, または丸めた合計が無限大になる場合には `Nothing` を返しま"
"す."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:579
msgid "`roundRational`"
msgstr "`roundRational`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:579
msgid ""
"Convert a rational using `Nearest` or `ToMultipleOf unit`, returning "
"`Nothing` when the requested conversion is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"`Nearest` または `ToMultipleOf unit` を使って有理数を変換し, 要求された変換が"
"できない場合は `Nothing` を返します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:581
msgid ""
"`isErrorValue` is derived from `valueError`; it is not a method to implement "
"independently. An exact decimal instance returns `Nothing` for "
"`roundRational Nearest` when the rational has no representable exact decimal "
"value. Floating-point instances round to the nearest representable value and "
"do not support `ToMultipleOf`."
msgstr ""
"`isErrorValue` は `valueError` から導出されるので, 独立して実装するメソッドで"
"はありません. 正確な十進数の instance は, 有理数に対して表現可能な正確な十進"
"値がない場合, `roundRational Nearest` に対して `Nothing` を返します. 浮動小数"
"点の instance は最も近い表現可能な値に丸め, `ToMultipleOf` には対応していませ"
"ん."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:583
msgid ""
"An accumulator must merge associatively and commutatively with zero as its "
"unit, preserve exact finite sums, and support exact subtraction through "
"negation. Accumulating and rounding a single finite value must preserve that "
"value. `splitAccum` must depend on the total, preserve it exactly, and "
"succeed for every positive finite state with a finite rounded result. If the "
"type represents NaN or infinities, accumulation of those values must follow "
"IEEE addition. Value validation and ties-to-even rounding are also part of "
"the instance contract."
msgstr ""
"アキュムレーターは, ゼロを単位元として結合的かつ可換的に結合でき, 正確な有限"
"和を保持し, 符号反転による正確な減算に対応する必要があります. 単一の有限値を"
"累積して丸めても, その値を保持しなければなりません. `splitAccum` は合計だけに"
"依存し, その合計を正確に保持し, 丸めた結果が有限になるすべての正の有限状態で"
"成功する必要があります. 型が NaN または無限大を表す場合, それらの値の累積は "
"IEEE の加算に従う必要があります. 値の検証と偶数丸めも instance の契約の一部で"
"す."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:585
msgid "Construction and operations"
msgstr "構築と演算"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:587
msgid ""
"`Alg` requires a `HatVal` amount type and a `HatBaseClass` base type. Its "
"`Redundant` instance implements the operations; defining a new element type "
"does not require another `Redundant` instance. `Zero` is the empty algebra "
"and the identity for addition. For value and direction checks, see "
"[Construction and scalar checks](#construction-and-scalar-checks)."
msgstr ""
"`Alg` には `HatVal` の金額型と `HatBaseClass` の基底型が必要です. 演算は既存"
"の `Redundant` インスタンスが実装しているので, 要素の型を追加した場合もこのイ"
"ンスタンスを使えます. `Zero` は空の冗長代数の元であり, 加法の単位元です. 金額"
"と向きの検査は[項の構築とスカラーの検査](#construction-and-scalar-checks)を参"
"照してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:589
msgid ""
"Use the public `(:@)` pattern to match a singleton term. Construct terms "
"with `.@`. `toList` returns singleton terms, `vals` returns amounts, and "
"`bases` returns hat bases."
msgstr ""
"単一の項に照合するには, 公開パターン `(:@)` を使ってください. 項は `.@` で"
"作ってください. `toList` は単一の項, `vals` は値, `bases` は Hat 基底を返しま"
"す."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:591 src/algebra/redundant.md:614
#: src/exchange/transfer.md:141 src/journal/journal.md:215
#: src/journal/agents.md:147 src/bookkeeping/admission.md:174
#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:239 src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:249
#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:265 src/bookkeeping/statements.md:293
#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:323 src/io/input.md:148
#: src/io/output.md:370
msgid "Inputs and result"
msgstr "入力と結果"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:593
msgid "`x .+ y`"
msgstr "`x .+ y`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:593
msgid ""
"Retain the terms from both algebras. Equal bases do not cause immediate "
"summation or cancellation. `(<>)` is the same addition."
msgstr ""
"両方の代数の項を保持します. 基底が等しくても, 即座の合算や相殺は行いません. "
"`(<>)` も同じ加算です."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:594
msgid "`scalar .* x`"
msgstr "`scalar .* x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:594
msgid ""
"Multiply every amount by the scalar, preserving the term structure except "
"for zero products. See [Construction and scalar checks](#construction-and-"
"scalar-checks)."
msgstr ""
"各項の金額にスカラーを掛け, 積がゼロになる項を除いて項の構造を保ちます. [項の"
"構築とスカラーの検査](#construction-and-scalar-checks)を参照してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:595
msgid "`norm x`"
msgstr "`norm x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:595
msgid ""
"Total all stored amounts on both directions. Return an amount, losing base "
"and direction information."
msgstr ""
"両方向に記録されたすべての金額を合計します. 金額を返し, 基底と方向の情報は失"
"われます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:596
msgid "`bar x`, also written `(.-) x`"
msgstr "`bar x` または `(.-) x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:596
msgid ""
"Total the opposing directions at each full base and keep only the excess on "
"the winning direction. Remove an exactly canceled base."
msgstr ""
"完全な基底ごとに逆方向の金額を合計し, 大きい方向の超過分だけを残します. 完全"
"に相殺された基底を取り除きます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:597
msgid "`compress x`"
msgstr "`compress x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:597
msgid ""
"Total each direction at each full base separately, without cancellation. "
"This explicitly discards the separate terms within each direction."
msgstr ""
"完全な基底ごとに各方向を別々に合計し, 相殺しません. 各方向の個々の項は明示的"
"に捨てます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:598
msgid "`(.^) x`"
msgstr "`(.^) x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:598
msgid "Swap `Hat` and `Not` for every term, preserving each amount."
msgstr "各金額を保持し, すべての項の `Hat` と `Not` を入れ替えます."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:599
msgid "`proj patterns x`"
msgstr "`proj patterns x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:599
msgid ""
"Select terms whose hat bases match at least one query pattern, without "
"netting or changing amounts."
msgstr ""
"Hat 基底が少なくとも 1 つの問い合わせパターンに一致する項を選択し, 相殺や金額"
"の変更は行いません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:600
msgid "`projNetNorm patterns x`"
msgstr "`projNetNorm patterns x`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:600
msgid ""
"Select bases, net within each full base, total the magnitudes of the "
"residuals, and round once. Return an amount."
msgstr ""
"基底を選択し, 完全な基底ごとに相殺し, 残差の大きさを合計して 1 回だけ丸めま"
"す. 金額を返します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:602
msgid ""
"`.*` is `infixr 7` and binds more tightly than `.+` (`infixr 3`). For "
"example, `2 .* withdrawal .+ cashPayment` means `(2 .* withdrawal) .+ "
"cashPayment`. Use parentheses around a term constructed with `.@`, as in "
"`2 .* (10 .@ Not :< (Cash, Yen))`."
msgstr ""
"`.*` は `infixr 7` で, `.+` (`infixr 3`) より強く結合します. 例えば, `2 .* "
"withdrawal .+ cashPayment` は `(2 .* withdrawal) .+ cashPayment` と解釈されま"
"す. `.@` で作る項は, `2 .* (10 .@ Not :< (Cash, Yen))` のように括弧で囲んでく"
"ださい."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:604
msgid "Projections and rounding"
msgstr "射影と丸め"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:606
msgid ""
"Overlapping or repeated `proj` patterns select each term once. "
"`projByAccountTitle` from `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange`, also re-"
"exported by `ExchangeAlgebra`, selects an account regardless of the other "
"elements of the base."
msgstr ""
"`proj` のパターンが重複していても, 各項は 1 回だけ選択されます. "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Exchange` の `projByAccountTitle` は, "
"`ExchangeAlgebra` からも再エクスポートされており, 基底の他の要素にかかわらず"
"勘定科目を選択します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:608
msgid ""
"`bar` and `projNetNorm` net within each full base; yen and dollar cash "
"cannot cancel each other. For exact decimal amounts, `projNetNorm patterns "
"x` agrees with `norm (bar (proj patterns x))`. Floating-point results can "
"differ because the latter expression rounds each base's residual before "
"summing."
msgstr ""
"`bar` と `projNetNorm` は完全な基底ごとに相殺するので, 円とドルの現金は互いに"
"相殺できません. 正確な十進数の金額では, `projNetNorm patterns x` は `norm "
"(bar (proj patterns x))` と一致します. 浮動小数点の結果は, 後者の式が合計の前"
"に各基底の残差を丸めるため, 異なる場合があります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:610
msgid ""
"**Caution:** `compress` discards separate term amounts, and floating-point "
"rounding of the direction totals can change the result of a later `bar`. "
"Preserve the original algebra when individual terms are needed."
msgstr ""
"**注意:** `compress` は個々の項の金額を捨てます. また, 方向別の合計に対する浮"
"動小数点の丸めにより, その後の `bar` の結果が変わる場合があります. 個々の項が"
"必要な場合は, 元の代数を保持してください."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:614
msgid "Class or operation"
msgstr "クラスまたは演算"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:616
msgid "`ExBaseClass`"
msgstr "`ExBaseClass`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:616
msgid ""
"A `HatBaseClass` base with account access. Implement `getAccountTitle` and "
"`setAccountTitle`; the setter must retain the other elements and direction."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目へのアクセスを備えた `HatBaseClass` の基底です. `getAccountTitle` と "
"`setAccountTitle` を実装してください. setter は基底の他の要素と方向を保持する"
"必要があります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:617
msgid "`whatDiv`, `isContra`, `whatPIMO`, `fixedCurrent`"
msgstr "`whatDiv`, `isContra`, `whatPIMO`, `fixedCurrent`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:617
msgid ""
"Classify an account from its base. The defaults use the account registry."
msgstr ""
"基底から勘定科目を分類します. 既定の実装は勘定科目レジストリを使います."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:618
msgid "`whichSide`"
msgstr "`whichSide`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:618
msgid ""
"Return the debit or credit side from account classification and `Hat` or "
"`Not`. A query direction `HatNot` causes an error."
msgstr ""
"勘定科目の区分と `Hat` または `Not` から項の貸借の側を返します. 問い合わせ用"
"の方向 `HatNot` はエラーになります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:619
msgid "`decL`, `decR`"
msgstr "`decL`, `decR`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:619
msgid ""
"Select debit (left) or credit (right) terms without changing their amounts "
"or aggregating them."
msgstr "借方 (左) または貸方 (右) の項を選びます. 額の変更や集約は行いません."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:620
msgid "`decP`, `decM`"
msgstr "`decP`, `decM`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:620
msgid ""
"`decP` selects `Hat` terms; `decM` selects `Not` terms. These directions are "
"distinct from debit and credit."
msgstr ""
"`decP` は `Hat` の項を選び, `decM` は `Not` の項を選びます. これらの方向は借"
"方と貸方とは異なります."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:621
msgid "`balance`"
msgstr "`balance`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:621
msgid ""
"Compare exact debit and credit sums before rounding, without a tolerance. "
"Return `False` for non-finite terms."
msgstr ""
"許容誤差を使わず, 丸める前の厳密な借方と貸方の合計を比べます. 非有限の項があ"
"れば `False` を返します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:622
msgid "`diffRL`"
msgstr "`diffRL`"

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:622
msgid ""
"Return the side with the greater exact sum and the difference rounded once; "
"return `(Side, 0)` for exact equality."
msgstr ""
"厳密な合計が大きい側と, 1 回だけ丸めた差額を返します. 厳密に一致するときは "
"`(Side, 0)` を返します."

#: src/algebra/redundant.md:624
msgid ""
"`Exchange Alg v b` is provided for a `HatVal` amount type and an "
"`ExBaseClass` base. `Exchange (Journal n) v b` is provided when the note "
"type also satisfies `Note`."
msgstr ""
"`HatVal` の値型と `ExBaseClass` の基底に対して `Exchange Alg v b` が用意され"
"ています. 摘要 (note) の型が `Note` も満たす場合は `Exchange (Journal n) v "
"b` が用意されています."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:3
msgid ""
"A transfer moves an amount from one account to another by adding a journal "
"entry. Keep the January 10 withdrawal and suppose that the business pays "
"1,200 yen in cash on January 30 for January and February rent, 600 yen for "
"each month. If the payment was initially recorded entirely as rent expense, "
"defer February's 600 yen to prepaid expenses at January 31."
msgstr ""
"振替は仕訳を加えることで勘定科目間の額を付け替えます. 1 月 10 日の引き出しを"
"保ち, 1 月 30 日に 1 月分と 2 月分の家賃を各 600 円, 計 1,200 円, 現金で支"
"払ったとします. 当初は全額を支払家賃に計上した場合, 1 月 31 日に 2 月分の "
"600 円を前払費用へ振り替えます."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:5
msgid ""
"Use exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1 in the project prepared in [Add the package to a "
"Stack project](../usage/installation.md#add-the-package-to-a-stack-project). "
"The example extends [Record the withdrawal](../usage/withdrawal.md) with the "
"rent payment and its transfer entry. It uses the accounting transfer API "
"from `ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Transfer`, re-exported by `ExchangeAlgebra`."
msgstr ""
"[Stack プロジェクトにパッケージを追加する](../usage/installation.md#add-the-"
"package-to-a-stack-project)で準備したプロジェクトで, exchangealgebra-0.7.0.0 "
"を使います. [引き出しを記録する](../usage/withdrawal.md)の例に, 家賃の支払い"
"とその振替の仕訳を加えます. 会計用の振替 API は "
"`ExchangeAlgebra.Accounting.Transfer` が提供し, `ExchangeAlgebra` からも利用"
"できます."

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:7
msgid "Record the rent payment"
msgstr "家賃の支払を記録する"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:9
msgid ""
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. Retain the "
"account-and-unit base and its instance:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 勘定科目と単位の基"
"底, および instance を保ってください:"

#: src/exchange/transfer.md:14 src/journal/agents.md:14
