"-- | Metadata for the withdrawal; the blank note is reserved for "
"aggregation.\n"
msgstr "-- | 引き出しのメタデータです. 空の摘要は集約のために予約します.\n"

#: src/journal/journal.md:79 src/journal/journal.md:134
#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:77 src/bookkeeping/admission.md:79
#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:75 src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:77
