msgstr "\"Bar across notes at plank\""

#: src/journal/journal.md:191
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o journal-example`, then run "
"`./journal-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"journal-example` を実行し, 続いて `./journal-example` を実行してください. プ"
"ログラムは次を出力します:"

#: src/journal/journal.md:193
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"February 1 entry before date selection: (400:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen) .+ "
"400:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen)) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,2,1), entryDescription "
"= \"Purchase of goods\"}\n"
"February 1 entry after January selection: 0\n"
"January 10 entry: (3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen)) .| "
"EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from "
"Bank A\"}\n"
"January 10 cash terms: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}\n"
"January yen cash terms: 500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,20), entryDescription = \"Purchase of goods\"} .+ 3000:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = "
"\"Withdrawal from Bank A\"} .+ 2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate "
"= (2026,1,15), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"} .+ 1500:@Hat:"
"<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,25), entryDescription = \"Yen-"
"dollar exchange\"}\n"
"January gross yen cash amount: 7000\n"
"January cash balances by currency: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Dollar)\n"
"Gathered January record: 500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 1500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ "
"2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) .+ "
"2000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:"
"<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"Bar across notes at plank: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) ."
"+ 5000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"February 1 entry before date selection: (400:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen) .+ "
"400:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen)) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,2,1), entryDescription "
"= \"Purchase of goods\"}\n"
"February 1 entry after January selection: 0\n"
"January 10 entry: (3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen)) .| "
"EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from "
"Bank A\"}\n"
"January 10 cash terms: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,10), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"}\n"
"January yen cash terms: 500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = "
"(2026,1,20), entryDescription = \"Purchase of goods\"} .+ 3000:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,10), entryDescription = "
"\"Withdrawal from Bank A\"} .+ 2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate "
"= (2026,1,15), entryDescription = \"Withdrawal from Bank A\"} .+ 1500:@Hat:"
"<(Cash,Yen) .| EntryNote {entryDate = (2026,1,25), entryDescription = \"Yen-"
"dollar exchange\"}\n"
"January gross yen cash amount: 7000\n"
"January cash balances by currency: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:"
"<(Cash,Dollar)\n"
"Gathered January record: 500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 1500:@Hat:<(Cash,Yen) .+ "
"2000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) .+ "
"2000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 3000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:"
"<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"Bar across notes at plank: 3000:@Not:<(Cash,Yen) .+ 10:@Not:<(Cash,Dollar) ."
"+ 5000:@Hat:<(Deposits,Yen) .+ 500:@Not:<(Purchases,Yen)\n"
"```"

#: src/journal/journal.md:205
msgid ""
"`February 1 entry before date selection` contains the 400-yen purchase with "
"its February date. `February 1 entry after January selection` is `0`, so the "
"purchase is absent from the January selection."
msgstr ""
"`February 1 entry before date selection` は, 400 円の仕入を 2 月の日付ととも"
"に含みます. `February 1 entry after January selection` は `0` なので, この仕"
"入は 1 月の選択結果には含まれません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:207
msgid ""
"`January gross yen cash amount` is 7,000 yen: increases of 3,000 and 2,000 "
"plus decreases of 500 and 1,500. `norm` counts all selected amounts in both "
"directions. For `January cash balances by currency`, `toAlg` removes the "
"note keys without netting, and `bar` then cancels within each account-and-"
"currency base. The resulting cash changes are 3,000 yen and 10 dollars."
msgstr ""
"`January gross yen cash amount` は 7,000 円です. 増加 3,000 円と 2,000 円に, "
"減少 500 円と 1,500 円を加えた額です. `norm` は両方向で選ばれた額を全て数えま"
"す. `January cash balances by currency` では, `toAlg` は摘要のキーを除き, 相"
"殺は行いません. 続いて `bar` が勘定科目と通貨の基底ごとに相殺します. 現金の変"
"化は 3,000 円と 10 ドルです."

#: src/journal/journal.md:209
msgid ""
"`Journal.gather Journal.plank january` combines all entries under the empty "
"note without canceling opposing terms. `bar january` combines the notes "
"under `plank` and nets the combined algebra. It loses the original dates and "
"descriptions. A component under `plank` is printed without a note suffix, "
"but the value remains a `Journal`. To net separately within each note, use "
"`Journal.map bar january`; retain `january` itself when the original term "
"detail is required."
msgstr ""
"`Journal.gather Journal.plank january` は逆方向の項を相殺せず, 全ての仕訳を空"
"の摘要にまとめます. `bar january` は摘要を `plank` にまとめてから代数を相殺し"
"ます. 元の日付と説明は失われます. `plank` に対応する成分は摘要の接尾辞なしで"
"表示されますが, 値は `Journal` のままです. 摘要ごとに相殺するには "
"`Journal.map bar january` を使ってください. 元の項の詳細が必要なときは "
"`january` 自体を保持してください."

#: src/journal/journal.md:215 src/bookkeeping/admission.md:174
#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:239 src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:249
#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:265 src/bookkeeping/statements.md:293
#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:323 src/io/input.md:148
#: src/io/output.md:370
msgid "Type or operation"
msgstr "型または演算"

#: src/journal/journal.md:217
msgid "`Note n`"
msgstr "`Note n`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:217
msgid ""
"Requires `Show`, `Eq`, `Ord`, `Hashable`, and `Typeable`. Define `plank`; "
"`isPlank` defaults to equality with `plank`."
msgstr ""
"`Show`, `Eq`, `Ord`, `Hashable`, `Typeable` が必要です. `plank` を定義してく"
"ださい. `isPlank` の既定値は `plank` との等値比較です."

#: src/journal/journal.md:218
msgid "`algebra .\\| note`"
msgstr "`algebra .\\| note`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:218
msgid ""
"Attach one note to all terms of an algebra. A zero algebra produces an empty "
"journal."
msgstr ""
"代数の全ての項に 1 つの摘要を付けます. ゼロの代数からは空の仕訳帳が得られま"
"す."

#: src/journal/journal.md:219
msgid "`Journal.fromList entries`"
msgstr "`Journal.fromList entries`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:219
msgid ""
"Sum a list of journals, combining equal note keys with redundant addition."
msgstr "仕訳帳のリストを合計し, 等しい摘要のキーでは冗長加算で合わせます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:220
msgid "`Journal.sigma items f`"
msgstr "`Journal.sigma items f`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:220
msgid "Sum the journals produced by applying `f` to the items."
msgstr "各要素に `f` を適用して得られる仕訳帳を合計します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:221
msgid "`Journal.projWithNote notes journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.projWithNote notes journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:221
msgid ""
"Select exact note keys. A list containing `plank` selects all notes; an "
"empty list selects none."
msgstr ""
"摘要のキー全体の一致で選びます. `plank` を含むリストは全摘要を選び, 空のリス"
"トは何も選びません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:222
msgid "`Journal.projWithBase bases journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.projWithBase bases journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:222
msgid ""
"Select matching terms at every note. Drop a note whose selected algebra is "
"zero."
msgstr "各摘要から一致する項を選びます. 選んだ代数がゼロになる摘要は除きます."

#: src/journal/journal.md:223
msgid "`Journal.projWithNoteBase notes bases journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.projWithNoteBase notes bases journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:223
msgid ""
"Restrict notes and bases. An empty note list or a list containing `plank` "
"imposes no note restriction. An empty base list selects nothing."
msgstr ""
"摘要と基底を制限します. 摘要のリストが空または `plank` を含む場合は, 摘要を制"
"限しません. 基底のリストが空なら何も選びません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:224
msgid "`Journal.filterWithNote predicate journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.filterWithNote predicate journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:224
msgid "Keep note-algebra pairs satisfying the predicate."
msgstr "述語を満たす摘要と代数の対を保持します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:225
msgid "`Journal.toAlg journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.toAlg journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:225
msgid ""
"Remove note keys and add their algebras, retaining term amounts without "
"netting."
msgstr "摘要のキーを除いて代数を加算し, 相殺せずに項の額を保持します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:226
msgid "`Journal.gather note journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.gather note journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:226
msgid "Put the combined algebra under the specified note, without netting."
msgstr "指定した摘要の下に代数をまとめます. 相殺は行いません."

#: src/journal/journal.md:227
msgid "`bar journal`"
msgstr "`bar journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:227
msgid "Gather under `plank`, then net the combined algebra."
msgstr "`plank` の下にまとめてから代数を相殺します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:228
msgid "`Journal.map f journal`"
msgstr "`Journal.map f journal`"

#: src/journal/journal.md:228
msgid "Apply an algebra transformation separately at each note."
msgstr "摘要ごとに代数の変換を適用します."

#: src/journal/journal.md:230
msgid ""
"Hat and scalar multiplication preserve note keys. `compress` aggregates "
"within each note, while `norm` totals all amounts across notes. An account "
"projection of the raw journal retains opposing amounts in different notes. "
"Combine the notes before reading a balance that must cancel an original "
"entry against an adjustment recorded under a different note."
msgstr ""
"Hat とスカラー倍は摘要のキーを保持します. `compress` は摘要ごとに集約し, "
"`norm` は摘要をまたいで全ての額を合計します. 元の仕訳帳を勘定科目で射影する"
"と, 異なる摘要にある逆方向の額が保持されます. 元の仕訳と別の摘要に記録した調"
"整を相殺して残高を読むときは, 先に摘要をまとめてください."

#: src/journal/agents.md:3
msgid ""
"The January 10 withdrawal appears in two accounting records. The business "
"receives 3,000 yen in cash and reduces its deposit asset. Bank A reduces the "
"deposit liability it owes to the business and pays out 3,000 yen in cash. "
"Add an element that identifies the accounting entity to the base to keep "
"both records in one algebra while retaining whose accounts each term "
"describes."
msgstr ""
"1 月 10 日の引き出しは 2 つの会計記録に現れます. 事業者は現金を 3,000 円受け"
"取り, 預金資産を減らします. A 銀行は事業者に対する預金負債を減らし, 現金を "
"3,000 円払い出します. 基底に会計主体の要素を加え, 各項が誰の勘定を記述するか"
"を保ったまま, 両方の記録を 1 つの代数に並べてください."

#: src/journal/agents.md:5
msgid ""
"Use exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1 in the project prepared in [Add the package to a "
"Stack project](../usage/installation.md#add-the-package-to-a-stack-project). "
"The example extends [Record the withdrawal](../usage/withdrawal.md) from "
"`HatBase (AccountTitles, Unit)` to `HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)`. "
"The same algebra operations apply to bases that also identify the accounting "
"entity."
msgstr ""
"[Stack プロジェクトにパッケージを追加する](../usage/installation.md#add-the-"
"package-to-a-stack-project)で準備したプロジェクトで, exchangealgebra-0.7.0.0 "
"を使います. [引き出しを記録する](../usage/withdrawal.md)の `HatBase "
"(AccountTitles, Unit)` を `HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)` に拡張しま"
"す. 会計主体を識別する基底でも同じ代数演算が使えます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:7
msgid "Add an element type for accounting entities"
msgstr "会計主体の要素の型を加える"

#: src/journal/agents.md:9
msgid ""
"Save the code blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`. Retain the "
"currency declaration:"
msgstr ""
"コードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` として保存してください. 通貨の宣言を保って"
"ください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:40
msgid ""
"Declare the accounting entities and account access for the expanded base:"
msgstr ""
"会計主体と, 拡張した基底で勘定科目へアクセスする方法を宣言してください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:43
msgid "-- | Owners of the two accounting records.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 つの会計記録の会計主体です.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:45
msgid "-- ^ The business withdrawing its own deposit.\n"
msgstr "-- ^ 自分の預金を引き出す事業者です.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:46
msgid "-- ^ The bank paying out the withdrawal.\n"
msgstr "-- ^ 引き出しに応じて現金を払い出す銀行です.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:52
msgid "-- | Account access for bases with an owner and a currency.\n"
msgstr "-- | 会計主体と通貨を持つ基底で勘定科目へアクセスします.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:59
msgid ""
"`Business` and `BankA` identify the accounting entities. `Owner` is the "
"wildcard element, used in queries to select both entities. `getAccountTitle` "
"reads the account element, and `setAccountTitle` changes only that element. "
"This custom base shape needs its own `ExBaseClass` instance; the `Alg` "
"exchange operations are unchanged."
msgstr ""
"`Business` と `BankA` は会計主体を識別します. `Owner` は問い合わせで両会計主"
"体を選ぶワイルドカード要素です. `getAccountTitle` は勘定科目の要素を読み, "
"`setAccountTitle` はその要素だけを変えます. この自作の基底の形には固有の "
"`ExBaseClass` instance が必要ですが, `Alg` の交換代数演算は変わりません."

#: src/journal/agents.md:61
msgid "Record both sides of the withdrawal"
msgstr "引き出しを両会計主体で記録する"

#: src/journal/agents.md:63
msgid "Construct each entity's balanced record, then add the records:"
msgstr "各会計主体の均衡した記録を構築し, 加えてください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:66
msgid "-- | The business receives cash and reduces its deposit asset.\n"
msgstr "-- | 事業者は現金を受け取り, 預金資産を減らします.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:70
msgid "-- | Bank A reduces its deposit liability and pays out cash.\n"
msgstr "-- | A 銀行は預金負債を減らし, 現金を払い出します.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:75
msgid ""
"-- | Retain both owners' records in one algebra without canceling between "
"owners.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 会計主体間で相殺せず, 両会計主体の記録を 1 つの代数に保持します.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:81
msgid ""
"The business debits Cash and credits Deposits. Bank A debits DepositPayable, "
"an ordinary liability account for deposits accepted, and credits Cash. The "
"bank's liability decrease has direction `Hat` but is a debit because an "
"ordinary liability's home side is credit. Both bank terms therefore use "
"`Hat`, yet they fall on opposite debit and credit sides."
msgstr ""
"事業者は借方に Cash, 貸方に Deposits を記録します. A 銀行は借方に通常の負債勘"
"定である受入預金 DepositPayable, 貸方に Cash を記録します. 通常の負債は本来の"
"貸借の側が貸方なので, 銀行の負債の減少は方向が `Hat` でも借方です. したがって"
"銀行の両項は `Hat` を使いますが, 借方と貸方に分かれます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:83
msgid ""
"`DepositPayable` describes a bank deposit liability. `DepositsReceived` "
"describes other deposits held, so the bank record uses `DepositPayable`. "
"Neither entity records revenue or expense for this withdrawal. Every amount "
"remains nonnegative."
msgstr ""
"`DepositPayable` は銀行の預金負債を表します. `DepositsReceived` はそれ以外の"
"預り金を表すので, 銀行の記録には `DepositPayable` を使います. この引き出しで"
"はどちらの会計主体も収益や費用を記録しません. 全ての額は非負のままです."

#: src/journal/agents.md:85
msgid "Select entities and corresponding terms"
msgstr "会計主体と対応する項を選ぶ"

#: src/journal/agents.md:87
msgid ""
"Restrict the accounting entity element to read one entity's record. Select "
"the deposit asset and liability with separate patterns:"
msgstr ""
"会計主体の要素を制限して 1 会計主体の記録を読んでください. 別々のパターンで預"
"金資産と負債を選んでください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:90
msgid "-- | Select one owner's complete accounting record.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 会計主体の会計記録全体を選びます.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:93
msgid ""
"-- | Select the business deposit asset and the bank's corresponding "
"liability.\n"
msgstr "-- | 事業者の預金資産と, それに対応する銀行の負債を選びます.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:100
msgid ""
"`recordOf Business` contains both business terms, and `recordOf BankA` "
"contains both bank terms. The cash increase of the business corresponds to "
"the bank's cash decrease. The business's deposit asset decrease corresponds "
"to the bank's deposit liability decrease. These correspondences concern the "
"same transaction, but the full bases differ in entity or account, so the "
"terms do not cancel automatically."
msgstr ""
"`recordOf Business` は事業者の両項を含み, `recordOf BankA` は銀行の両項を含み"
"ます. 事業者の現金増加は銀行の現金減少に対応します. 事業者が預金資産を減らす"
"と, 銀行も対応する預金負債を減らします. 同じ取引に関する対応ですが, 完全な基"
"底は会計主体または勘定科目が異なるので, 項は自動的には相殺されません."

#: src/journal/agents.md:102
msgid "Check each entity's record"
msgstr "会計主体ごとの記録を確かめる"

#: src/journal/agents.md:104
msgid ""
"Print the entity selections, balance checks, and corresponding movements:"
msgstr "会計主体で選んだ結果, 貸借の検査, 対応する変化を出力してください:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:110
msgid ""
"-- | Inspect each owner and the corresponding cash and deposit movements.\n"
msgstr "-- | 会計主体ごとの記録と, 対応する現金および預金の変化を調べます.\n"

#: src/journal/agents.md:114
msgid "\"Business record\""
msgstr "\"Business record\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:115
msgid "\"Bank A record\""
msgstr "\"Bank A record\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:116
msgid "\"Business record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Business record is balanced\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:117
msgid "\"Bank A record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Bank A record is balanced\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:118
msgid "\"Combined record is balanced\""
msgstr "\"Combined record is balanced\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:119
msgid "\"Bank liability decrease side\""
msgstr "\"Bank liability decrease side\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:120
msgid "\"Corresponding deposit changes\""
msgstr "\"Corresponding deposit changes\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:121
msgid "\"Cash changes with owners retained\""
msgstr "\"Cash changes with owners retained\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:122
msgid "\"Bar retains separate owners\""
msgstr "\"Bar retains separate owners\""

#: src/journal/agents.md:125
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o agents-example`, then run `./"
"agents-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"agents-example` を実行し, 続いて `./agents-example` を実行してください. プロ"
"グラムは次を出力します:"

#: src/journal/agents.md:139
msgid ""
"The business, bank, and combined records are balanced in yen. Check each "
"entity individually: a combined balance alone could conceal an imbalance in "
"one entity offset by another. `Bar retains separate owners` still contains "
"both entities' cash terms because `bar` cancels only within a full base, "
"including the accounting entity element."
msgstr ""
"事業者, 銀行, 両者を合わせた記録は円で貸借が均衡します. 会計主体ごとにも確か"
"めてください. 合わせた記録だけでは, ある会計主体の不均衡が他の会計主体で打ち"
"消される可能性があります. `bar` は会計主体の要素を含む完全な基底ごとに相殺す"
"るので, `Bar retains separate owners` は依然として両会計主体の現金の項を含み"
"ます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:141
msgid ""
"The accounting entity element identifies the entity whose record contains "
"the term. Counterparty identity is separate. With only one business and one "
"bank the correspondence is specified by the example. To identify particular "
"pairs in a larger set of transactions, add the counterparty or a shared "
"transaction identifier to the note type, as described in [Declare a note "
"type](journal.md#declare-a-note-type)."
msgstr ""
"会計主体の要素は, 項がどの会計主体の記録に属するかを識別します. 相手方の識別"
"は別に行います. 事業者と銀行が 1 つずつの例では対応を明示しています. 取引が多"
"い場合に特定の対を識別するには, [摘要の型を宣言する](journal.md#declare-a-"
"note-type)で説明したように, 相手方か共通の取引識別子を摘要の型に加えてくださ"
"い."

#: src/journal/agents.md:147
msgid "Construction or operation"
msgstr "構築または演算"

#: src/journal/agents.md:149
msgid "`HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)`"
msgstr "`HatBase (AccountTitles, Owner, Unit)`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:149
msgid ""
"Identify the account, the accounting entity, and the currency. Direction is "
"separate from the tuple."
msgstr "勘定科目, 会計主体, 通貨を識別します. 方向はタプルの外にあります."

#: src/journal/agents.md:150
msgid "`Element Owner`"
msgstr "`Element Owner`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:150
msgid ""
"Supply a wildcard element and derive consistent equality, ordering, and "
"hashing."
msgstr ""
"ワイルドカード要素を定義し, 整合する等値比較, 順序, ハッシュを導出してくださ"
"い."

#: src/journal/agents.md:151
msgid "`ExBaseClass` instance"
msgstr "`ExBaseClass` instance"

#: src/journal/agents.md:151
msgid ""
"Read and replace the account while preserving entity, currency, and "
"direction."
msgstr "会計主体, 通貨, 方向を保ちながら勘定科目を読み出し, 置き換えます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:152
msgid "`proj [HatNot :< ((.#), owner, (.#))]`"
msgstr "`proj [HatNot :< ((.#), owner, (.#))]`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:152
msgid "Select one entity across accounts, directions, and currencies."
msgstr "勘定科目, 方向, 通貨を制限せずに 1 会計主体を選びます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:153
msgid "`proj [HatNot :< (Cash, (.#), Yen)]`"
msgstr "`proj [HatNot :< (Cash, (.#), Yen)]`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:153
msgid ""
"Select yen cash movements across entities, retaining the accounting entity "
"elements."
msgstr "会計主体の要素を保って, 会計主体をまたいだ円の現金の変化を選びます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:154
msgid "`balance (recordOf owner)`"
msgstr "`balance (recordOf owner)`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:154
msgid ""
"Compare debit and credit sums for the selected entity. The example uses only "
"yen."
msgstr "選択した会計主体の借方と貸方の合計を比べます. 例では円だけを使います."

#: src/journal/agents.md:155
msgid "`bar combined`"
msgstr "`bar combined`"

#: src/journal/agents.md:155
msgid "Net within each full base. Keep different entities separate."
msgstr "完全な基底ごとに相殺します. 異なる会計主体は分けて保ちます."

#: src/journal/agents.md:157
msgid ""
"The accounting entity element set is an ordinary element set for a base "
"under [Definitions 1–3](../algebra/definitions.md#element-structure). The "
"additional element of the base changes neither redundant addition nor the "
"[debit and credit decomposition](../algebra/definitions.md#debit-and-credit-"
"decomposition). It changes which terms share a full base and which entities "
"can be selected in a query."
msgstr ""
"会計主体の要素集合は[定義 1–3](../algebra/definitions.md#element-structure)に"
"従う基底を構成する通常の要素集合です. 基底に要素を加えても冗長加算と[借方と貸"
"方への分解](../algebra/definitions.md#debit-and-credit-decomposition)は変わり"
"ません. 完全な基底を共有する項と, 会計主体ごとに可能な問い合わせが変わります."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:3
msgid ""
"`AccountTitles` is the element type for account titles. Each constructor, "
"such as `Cash`, is an element. The wildcard element `AccountTitle` has no "
"account attributes. Both `accountSpec AccountTitle` and `accountSemantics "
"AccountTitle` return `Nothing`."
msgstr ""
"`AccountTitles` は勘定科目の要素の型です. `Cash` など, 各構成子は要素です. ワ"
"イルドカードの要素 `AccountTitle` は属性を持ちません. `accountSpec "
"AccountTitle` と `accountSemantics AccountTitle` はどちらも `Nothing` を返し"
"ます."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:5
msgid "Account specification"
msgstr "勘定科目の分類と名称"

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:7
msgid ""
"Use `accountSpec` to get the `AccountSpec` record for a concrete account "
"title."
msgstr ""
"具体的な勘定科目の `AccountSpec` レコードは `accountSpec` で取得できます."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:9
msgid ""
"`asDivision` gives the division. The values are `Assets` for assets, "
"`Liability` for liabilities, `Equity` for equity, `Revenue` for revenue, and "
"`Cost` for expenses."
msgstr ""
"`asDivision` は区分を表します. 資産は `Assets`, 負債は `Liability`, 純資産は "
"`Equity`, 収益は `Revenue`, 費用は `Cost` です."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:10
msgid ""
"`asClosing` gives the automatic closing rule. `CloseByDivision` uses the "
"division to determine eligibility and transfer direction. `NoClose` skips "
"automatic closing for the account."
msgstr ""
"`asClosing` は自動で行う決算振替の規則を表します. `CloseByDivision` は区分に"
"基づいて対象科目と振替の向きを決めます. `NoClose` の科目は自動で振り替えませ"
"ん."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:11
msgid ""
"`asIsContra` identifies contra accounts, which offset balances in their "
"division."
msgstr "`asIsContra` は, 同じ区分の残高を相殺する評価勘定かどうかを表します."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:12
msgid ""
"`asFixedCurrent` classifies the account as `Fixed`, `Current`, or `Other`. "
"For example, revenue and expense accounts use `Other`."
msgstr ""
"`asFixedCurrent` は科目を固定の `Fixed`, 流動の `Current`, その他の `Other` "
"に分類します. たとえば, 収益と費用の科目は `Other` です."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:13
msgid ""
"`asNameEn` gives the English name. `asNameJa` gives the Japanese name, which "
"may include notes. `asLabelJa` gives the Japanese display name without notes."
msgstr ""
"`asNameEn` は英語名を表します. `asNameJa` は日本語名で, 注記を含むことがあり"
"ます. `asLabelJa` は注記のない日本語の表示名です."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:14
msgid "`asDescription` gives a description of the account."
msgstr "`asDescription` は勘定科目の説明です."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:15
msgid ""
"`asAliases` lists the aliases in the registry. `accountAliases` combines "
"these with aliases from the Japan Chamber of Commerce and Industry's account "
"names."
msgstr ""
"`asAliases` は登録表の別名の一覧です. `accountAliases` は, この一覧に日本商工"
"会議所の勘定科目名に由来する別名を加えたものです."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:17
msgid "Account semantics"
msgstr "会計処理と表示の属性"

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:19
msgid ""
"Use `accountSemantics` to get the `AccountSemantics` record for bookkeeping "
"and reporting."
msgstr ""
"会計処理と表示に使う `AccountSemantics` レコードは `accountSemantics` で取得"
"できます."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:21
msgid ""
"`asemRoles` lists the roles of the account. An account can have multiple "
"roles. `OrdinaryAccount` marks an ordinary account, `ContraAccount` offsets "
"another balance, and `ReciprocalAccount` matches balances between entities. "
"`SuspenseOrClearingAccount` holds amounts temporarily. `ClosingDevice` "
"supports closing entries. `AttributionAccount` assigns amounts to a group. "
"`PeriodResult` represents a period result and `ReportingSubtotal` represents "
"a subtotal."
msgstr ""
"`asemRoles` は勘定科目の役割の一覧です. 1 つの科目が複数の役割を持つことがあ"
"ります. `OrdinaryAccount` は通常の勘定, `ContraAccount` は残高を相殺する評価"
"勘定, `ReciprocalAccount` は会計主体間で残高を照合する相互勘定を表します. "
"`SuspenseOrClearingAccount` は金額を一時的に記録する仮勘定や整理勘定です. "
"`ClosingDevice` は決算振替に使います. `AttributionAccount` は金額の帰属先を示"
"します. `PeriodResult` は当期損益, `ReportingSubtotal` は財務諸表の小計を表し"
"ます."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:22
msgid ""
"`asemPostingCapability` describes where the account may be used. "
"`OrdinaryPosting` allows ordinary entries. `ClosingOnly`, "
"`ConsolidationOnly`, and `EngineGeneratedOnly` limit use to closing, "
"consolidation, and entries generated by the library, respectively. "
"`NotPostable` marks an account unavailable for recording entries."
msgstr ""
"`asemPostingCapability` は記帳できる場面を表します. `OrdinaryPosting` は通常"
"の記帳に使えます. `ClosingOnly`, `ConsolidationOnly`, `EngineGeneratedOnly` "
"は, それぞれ決算, 連結, ライブラリが生成する仕訳に用途が限られます. "
"`NotPostable` は記帳に使えません."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:23
msgid ""
"`asemDivisionSemantics` explains what the division represents. "
"`StatementDivision` gives a financial statement classification. "
"`BookkeepingControlClass` gives a class used to control a bookkeeping "
"procedure. `DirectionEncoding` uses the division to encode direction. "
"`NoStatementDivision` indicates that no statement division applies."
msgstr ""
"`asemDivisionSemantics` は区分の意味を表します. `StatementDivision` は財務諸"
"表の区分, `BookkeepingControlClass` は記帳手続きの制御に用いる区分です. "
"`DirectionEncoding` は区分を向きの表現に使います. `NoStatementDivision` には"
"財務諸表の区分がありません."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:24
msgid ""
"`asemHomeSideSemantics` describes the home side, the debit or credit side on "
"which you record an increase in the account. `FixedHomeSide` specifies "
"`Debit` or `Credit`. `ContextDependentHomeSide` depends on the context. "
"`NoFixedHomeSide` gives no single home side. `NoPostingSide` means that no "
"posting side applies."
msgstr ""
"`asemHomeSideSemantics` は定位置, つまりその勘定の増加を記録する側 (借方か貸"
"方) を表します. `FixedHomeSide` は `Debit` (借方) または `Credit` (貸方) を指"
"定します. `ContextDependentHomeSide` は状況に応じて決まります. "
"`NoFixedHomeSide` には固定の定位置がなく, `NoPostingSide` には記帳する側があ"
"りません."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:25
msgid ""
"`asemReportingEligibility` describes eligibility for financial statement "
"presentation. `StatementEligible` marks an eligible account. "
"`ContextualPresentation` depends on the reporting context. "
"`DerivedPresentation` represents a derived result or subtotal. "
"`NotPresented` excludes the account from presentation."
msgstr ""
"`asemReportingEligibility` は財務諸表への載せ方を表します. "
"`StatementEligible` は表示の対象となる科目です. `ContextualPresentation` は報"
"告の文脈によって表示が決まります. `DerivedPresentation` は算出した損益や小計"
"を表します. `NotPresented` の科目は表示しません."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:27
msgid "Where the attributes are used"
msgstr "属性を使う手続き"

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:29
msgid ""
"[Closing entries](../bookkeeping/closing.md) use the closing rule and "
"division to select accounts to close. The division and contra status "
"determine the transfer direction."
msgstr ""
"[決算振替](../bookkeeping/closing.md)では, 締めの規則と区分で振替の対象を選び"
"ます. 区分と評価勘定かどうかによって振替の向きが決まります."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:30
msgid ""
"[Financial statements](../bookkeeping/statements.md) use the statement "
"division and the fixed/current classification to group lines. The "
"`ContraAccount` role determines whether a balance is presented as a "
"deduction."
msgstr ""
"[財務諸表](../bookkeeping/statements.md)では, 財務諸表の区分と流動・固定の分"
"類で表示欄を分けます. `ContraAccount` の役割で, 残高を控除として表示するかど"
"うかを判定します."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:31
msgid ""
"[Reading journals from CSV](../io/input.md) uses `accountAliases` to resolve "
"alternate names."
msgstr ""
"[CSV からの仕訳帳の読み込み](../io/input.md)では, `accountAliases` で別名から"
"科目を特定します."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:32
msgid ""
"[Trial balance and checks](../bookkeeping/trial-balance.md) use the home "
"side to flag ordinary accounts with a balance on the opposite side. They use "
"roles to check balances in accounts such as suspense and clearing accounts."
msgstr ""
"[試算表の作成と点検](../bookkeeping/trial-balance.md)では, 定位置の反対側に残"
"高がある通常の勘定を検出します. 仮勘定や整理勘定などの残高の点検には役割を使"
"います."

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:34
msgid "Compare cash and accumulated depreciation"
msgstr "現金と減価償却累計額を比べる"

#: src/accounts/attributes.md:36
msgid ""
"This program prints the classification and semantics for `Cash` and "
