#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:91
msgid ""
"On January 1, the owner contributes 10,000 yen of capital to Bank A’s "
"savings account: debit Deposits and credit CapitalStock. The two withdrawals "
"leave 5,000 yen in Deposits. On January 28, sell goods for 2,000 yen in "
"cash: debit Cash and credit Sales. Under the periodic inventory method, "
"record the cost of the goods sold at the period end."
msgstr ""
"1 月 1 日に, 所有者が資本金 10,000 円を A 銀行の普通預金口座へ払い込みます. "
"借方は Deposits, 貸方は CapitalStock です. 2 件の引き出しの後, Deposits には "
"5,000 円が残ります. 1 月 28 日に商品を現金 2,000 円で売り上げます. 借方は "
"Cash, 貸方は Sales です. 三分法では, 売り上げた商品の原価を期末に計上します."

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:93
msgid ""
"The January 30 rent payment initially records all 1,200 yen as an expense. "
"Keep the 600-yen deferral as a separate January 31 adjusting entry in "
"[Adjusting entries](adjustment.md#defer-rent-and-count-inventory); do not "
"add it twice."
msgstr ""
"1 月 30 日に支払った家賃 1,200 円は, いったん全額を費用として記録します. 600 "
"円の前払分は, [決算整理仕訳](adjustment.md#defer-rent-and-count-inventory)で "
"1 月 31 日の独立した仕訳として加えます. 重ねて加えないでください."

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:95
msgid "Express dollar cash in yen"
msgstr "ドル現金の円換算"

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:97
msgid ""
"At January 31, the 10 dollars are worth 1,500 yen at 150 yen per dollar, the "
"same rate as on January 25. The transfer in the preprint’s [Definition 9](../"
"algebra/definitions.md#transfers) moves a source term to a destination term "
"with a value transformation; the unit conversion in Appendix A, Example 2, "
"also replaces the source term. Here the triple consists of source `(account, "
"Dollar)`, destination `(account, Yen)`, and value function $f(v)=150v$. "
"`Algebra.mapPosting` applies this triple by replacing every matching term, "
"while `Journal.map` applies the conversion separately at each note."
msgstr ""
"1 月 31 日の相場を 1 ドル 150 円とし, 10 ドルを 1,500 円に換算します. 1 月 "
"25 日と同じ相場です. プレプリントの[定義 9](../algebra/"
"definitions.md#transfers)では, 値を変換しながら振替元の項を振替先の項へ移しま"
"す. Appendix A の Example 2 にある単位の換算も, 元の項を置き換えます. この例"
"では, 振替元 `(account, Dollar)`, 振替先 `(account, Yen)`, 値の変換関数 "
"$f(v)=150v$ の三つ組を使います. `Algebra.mapPosting` は, 該当する各項を置き換"
"える形でこの三つ組を適用します. `Journal.map` は摘要ごとに換算を適用します."

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:99
msgid ""
"Use `mkTransferTable` to build the accounting transfer table in [Transfers]"
"(../exchange/transfer.md). On success, `transferEntries` returns only the "
"cancellation and destination terms. Add those terms to the original record "
"with `.+` to retain it. The source and destination amounts are equal. For "
"unit conversions that change the amount, use `mapPosting`. Version 0.7.0.0 "
"removed `MulBy` and `DivBy`."
msgstr ""
"[振替](../exchange/transfer.md)の会計用振替表は `mkTransferTable` で作ってく"
"ださい. 成功時に `transferEntries` が返すのは取消項と振替先の項だけです. 元の"
"記録を残すには, これらの項を `.+` で元の記録に足してください. 振替元と振替先"
"の金額は同じです. 金額が変わる単位換算には `mapPosting` を使ってください. "
"`MulBy` と `DivBy` は 0.7.0.0 で削除されました."

