#: src/io/output.md:108
msgid ""
"-- | Check the converted journal without changing its notes or term "
"sequences.\n"
msgstr "-- | 摘要や項の列を変えずに, 換算した仕訳帳を検査します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:119
msgid ""
"`sourceJournal` retains the original currency records; `yenJournal` is a "
"reporting representation that preserves notes and term detail but replaces "
"the dollar element and amount. This is unit conversion, not an additional "
"debit-credit entry. The check sums numerical amounts without converting "
"currencies, so check the yen representation. With different exchange-date "
"and closing-date rates, record the valuation difference as a foreign "
"exchange gain or loss before closing."
msgstr ""
"`sourceJournal` には元の通貨による記録を残します. `yenJournal` は報告用の表現"
"です. 摘要と項の明細を保ち, ドルの要素と金額を置き換えます. これは単位の換算"
"であり, 貸借の項を追加する仕訳ではありません. 検査では通貨を換算せず数値を合"
"計するため, 円で表した仕訳帳を渡してください. 両替日と決算日の相場が異なる場"
"合は, 評価差額を為替差損益として締めの前に計上します."

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:121
msgid "Check the January journal"
msgstr "1 月の仕訳帳の検査"

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:123
msgid ""
"`Admission.admit` checks positive finite term amounts, concrete Hat/Not "
"sides, accounts that some process may post, and exact equality of debit and "
"credit totals within each note. It returns every detected violation in "
"`Left`, or the unchanged journal wrapped in `Admitted` in `Right`. It does "
"not verify dates, documentary evidence, opening balances, or the correctness "
"of adjusting and closing procedures."
msgstr ""
"`Admission.admit` は, 各項の値が正で有限であること, 側が具体的な Hat/Not であ"
"ること, 何らかの手続きで記帳できる勘定科目であること, 摘要ごとに借方と貸方の"
"合計が厳密に一致することを検査します. 違反があれば検出したすべての入力エラー"
"を `Left` に入れます. 成功すると, 元の仕訳帳を変えずに `Admitted` で包んで "
"`Right` に入れます. 日付, 証憑との一致, 期首残高, 決算整理や締めの手続きの正"
"しさは検査しません."

