"January journal admitted\n"
"Term totals (debit, credit): (20200,20200)\n"
"Balanced: True\n"
"Balance totals (debit, credit): (12000,12000)\n"
"Rejected: Imbalanced (EntryNote (2026,1,28) \"Unbalanced sale\") 2000 "
"1900 :| []\n"
"```"

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:168
msgid ""
"The checked journal has equal debit and credit totals of 20,200 yen. An "
"explicit `bar` of the combined record gives balance totals of 12,000 yen on "
"each side; the checked journal itself retains the original terms. The "
"rejected cash sale debits 2,000 yen but credits only 1,900 yen. `Imbalanced` "
"identifies its note and the two totals. Correct that entry and submit it for "
"checking again. A rejected journal yields no `Admitted` value."
msgstr ""
"検査を通った仕訳帳では, 借方合計と貸方合計がともに 20,200 円です. 摘要を外し"
"て合わせた記録に `bar` を明示的に適用すると, 残高の合計は貸借ともに 12,000 円"
"になります. 検査を通った仕訳帳自体には元の項を残します. 拒否された現金売上は"
"借方が 2,000 円, 貸方が 1,900 円です. `Imbalanced` はその摘要と両側の合計を示"
"します. 仕訳を訂正してもう一度検査に渡してください. 拒否された場合は "
"`Admitted` は返りません."

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:176
msgid "`Admission.admit journal`"
msgstr "`Admission.admit journal`"

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:176
msgid ""
"Check every note; return an input error report or an `Admitted` journal."
msgstr ""
"摘要ごとに検査し, 入力エラーの報告または `Admitted` で包んだ仕訳帳を返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:177
msgid "`Admission.admittedJournal accepted`"
msgstr "`Admission.admittedJournal accepted`"

#: src/bookkeeping/admission.md:177
