msgstr "\"Abnormal balances\""

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:173
msgid ""
"`decL` selects debit terms and `decR` selects credit terms, as in "
"[Definition 8](../algebra/definitions.md#debit-and-credit-decomposition); "
"`norm` totals their non-negative amounts. The side depends on the account "
"class and Hat/Not, as in [Definition 7](../algebra/definitions.md#account-"
"classes-and-sides). For example, both Cash and Sales increase with `Not` in "
"the cash sale, but Cash is debited and Sales is credited."
msgstr ""
"[定義 8](../algebra/definitions.md#debit-and-credit-decomposition)のとおり, "
"`decL` は借方の項を, `decR` は貸方の項を選びます. `norm` は選んだ非負の値を合"
"計します. 貸借の側は, [定義 7](../algebra/definitions.md#account-classes-and-"
"sides)のとおり, 勘定の区分と Hat/Not で決まります. たとえば現金売上では, "
"Cash と Sales がともに `Not` で増加しますが, Cash は借方, Sales は貸方です."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:175
msgid ""
"`accountBalances` sums each account exactly and returns a non-negative "
"magnitude with `DebitBalance`, `CreditBalance`, or `NoBalance`. It computes "
"net balances without calling `bar` or changing the source record. The report "
"sums the debit and credit balance columns separately from gross term totals."
msgstr ""
"`accountBalances` は勘定ごとに厳密に集計し, 非負の金額を `DebitBalance`, "
"`CreditBalance`, `NoBalance` のいずれかで返します. `bar` を呼ばず, 元の記録も"
"変えずに残高を計算します. 報告では, 借方残高と貸方残高の合計を, 借方合計と貸"
"方合計とは別に求めます."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:177
msgid ""
"Check that every term is in yen before removing the currency element. "
"Removing that element produces a trial balance with bases of type `HatBase "
"AccountTitles` for the audits. This projection discards currency "
"information, so keep the account-and-currency journal as the record. Include "
"opening balances before calling `Audit.impossibleBalances` and "
"`Audit.abnormalBalances`. Each audit returns `NoProblem` when it finds no "
"issue."
msgstr ""
"通貨の要素を取り除く前に, すべての項が円建てであることを確認してください. 通"
"貨の要素を取り除くと, 監査に渡す試算表の基底は `HatBase AccountTitles` になり"
"ます. この射影で通貨の情報が失われるため, 科目と通貨を含む仕訳帳を記録として"
"保存してください. `Audit.impossibleBalances` と `Audit.abnormalBalances` を呼"
"ぶ前に, 期首残高を含めてください. 各監査は該当する問題を検出しなければ "
"`NoProblem` を返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:179
msgid "Inspect a balance on the opposite side"
msgstr "通常と反対側にある残高を調べる"

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:188
msgid "\"Additional withdrawal\""
msgstr "\"Additional withdrawal\""

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:191
msgid "\"With an additional withdrawal:\""
msgstr "\"With an additional withdrawal:\""

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:195
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o trial-balance-example`, then "
"run `./trial-balance-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"trial-balance-example` を実行し, 続けて `./trial-balance-example` を実行して"
"ください. プログラムは次の結果を出力します:"

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:231
msgid ""
"With the opening contribution, Deposits has a debit balance of 5,000 yen and "
"the balance columns each total 12,000 yen. Cash has a debit balance of 5,300 "
"yen, including the yen equivalent of the 10 dollars. Its debit total is "
"8,500 yen and its credit total is 3,200 yen."
msgstr ""
"期首の払込を含めると, Deposits は借方残高 5,000 円となり, 残高欄の合計は貸借"
"ともに 12,000 円です. Cash は, 10 ドルを円換算した額を含めて借方残高 5,300 円"
"です. Cash の借方合計と貸方合計は, それぞれ 8,500 円と 3,200 円です."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:233
msgid ""
"The program then adds a third withdrawal of 6,000 yen to the journal, and "
"each transaction still balances. "
"Deposits now has a credit balance of 1,000 yen. `Audit.abnormalBalances` "
"returns a `Warning` for Deposits because its normal balance is a debit. "
"Check the bank records to determine whether the withdrawal was recorded "
"correctly."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは続けて, 3 件目の引き出し (6,000 円) を仕訳帳に加えます. 各取引の"
"貸借は引き続き一致します. 預金は 1,000 "
"円の貸方残高になります. 預金は通常, 借方に残高を持つため, "
"`Audit.abnormalBalances` は預金について `Warning` を返します. 引き出しの記録"
"が正しいか, 銀行の記録と照合してください."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:241
msgid "`TrialBalance.accountBalances ledger`"
msgstr "`TrialBalance.accountBalances ledger`"

