msgstr "勘定の残高を取り出します. 存在しない勘定は `NoBalance` を返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:243
msgid "`TrialBalance.balancePair balance`"
msgstr "`TrialBalance.balancePair balance`"

