msgid ""
"Return `Error` for balances on sides that the built-in chart rules out, such "
"as a credit balance in Cash."
msgstr ""
"現金の貸方残高など, 既定の勘定科目であり得ない側に残高がある場合は `Error` を"
"返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:245
msgid "`Audit.abnormalBalances ledger`"
msgstr "`Audit.abnormalBalances ledger`"

#: src/bookkeeping/trial-balance.md:245
msgid ""
"Return `Warning` when an account classified as `OrdinaryAccount` has a "
"balance on the side opposite its fixed normal balance. Accounts audited by "
"`impossibleBalances` are excluded."
msgstr ""
"`OrdinaryAccount` に分類される科目で, 残高が通常の残高の側と反対にある場合は "
"`Warning` を返します. 通常の残高の側が決まっている科目が対象です. "
"`impossibleBalances` の対象科目は除きます."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:3
msgid ""
"At January 31, part of the rent belongs to February and some purchased goods "
"remain unsold. Start from the checked journal in [Trial balance and checks]"
"(trial-balance.md#recover-the-admitted-records), defer the February rent, "
"and recognize ending inventory before closing January’s revenue and expenses."
msgstr ""
"1 月 31 日時点では, 支払った家賃の一部が 2 月分であり, 仕入れた商品の一部が売"
"れ残っています. [試算表と点検](trial-balance.md#recover-the-admitted-records)"
"で検査を通った仕訳帳から始め, 2 月分の家賃を前払いに振り替え, 期末商品棚卸高"
"を計上してから, 1 月の収益と費用の決算振替を行います."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:7
msgid "Recover January before adjustments"
msgstr "決算整理前の 1 月の記録の取り出し"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:9
msgid ""
"The program begins with the checked records and trial-balance calculations "
"from [Trial balance and checks](trial-balance.md#recover-the-admitted-"
"records) and the chapters before it."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは, [試算表と点検](trial-balance.md#recover-the-admitted-records)と"
"それまでの章で説明した検査を通った記録, および試算表の計算から始まります."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:164
msgid "\"Temporary account balances\""
msgstr "\"Temporary account balances\""

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:169
msgid "Defer rent and count inventory"
msgstr "家賃の前払分の振替と棚卸"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:171
msgid ""
"The [rent transfer](../exchange/transfer.md#add-the-transfer-entry-and-read-"
"the-balances) moves 600 yen from RentExpense to PrepaidExpenses. It is an "
"adjusting entry: debit PrepaidExpenses and credit RentExpense on January 31, "
"leaving 600 yen of rent expense for January. Generate this entry from the "
"unadjusted ledger once."
msgstr ""
"[家賃の振替](../exchange/transfer.md#add-the-transfer-entry-and-read-the-"
"balances)では, RentExpense から PrepaidExpenses へ 600 円を振り替えます. これ"
"は決算整理仕訳です. 1 月 31 日に PrepaidExpenses を借方, RentExpense を貸方に"
"記録し, 1 月分の家賃 600 円を費用に残します. 決算整理前の記録から, この仕訳を"
"一度だけ生成してください."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:173
msgid ""
"The shop has no beginning merchandise inventory, purchases goods for 500 yen "
"during January, and counts ending inventory worth 200 yen at cost. Under the "
"periodic three-account method, cost of goods sold is beginning inventory "
"plus purchases less ending inventory: $0+500-200=300$ yen. Debit "
"MerchandiseInventory and credit Purchases for 200 yen; the Purchases balance "
"then represents cost of goods sold."
msgstr ""
"店の期首商品棚卸高は 0 円です. 1 月中に 500 円の商品を仕入れ, 期末の実地棚卸"
"で原価 200 円の商品が残っています. 三分法では, 売上原価を期首商品棚卸高と当期"
"商品仕入高の合計から期末商品棚卸高を差し引いて求めます. $0+500-200=300$ 円で"
"す. MerchandiseInventory を借方, Purchases を貸方に 200 円記録すると, "
"Purchases の残高が売上原価になります."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:176 src/bookkeeping/closing.md:169
#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:137 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:140
#: src/io/output.md:141
msgid ""
"-- | January 31: defer February's half of the rent, using the rent transfer "
"table.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 1 月 31 日に, 家賃の振替表を使い, 半額に当たる 2 月分を前払いに振り替え"
"ます.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:182 src/bookkeeping/closing.md:175
#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:143 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:146
#: src/io/output.md:147
msgid ""
"-- | Keep the currency element when building the periodic inventory "
"adjustment.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 三分法による商品の決算整理仕訳を構築する際に, 通貨の要素を保ちます.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:186 src/bookkeeping/closing.md:179
#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:147 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:150
#: src/io/output.md:151
msgid ""
"-- | No beginning inventory; the January 31 physical count is worth 200 yen "
"at cost.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 期首商品棚卸高は 0 円です. 1 月 31 日の実地棚卸高は原価で 200 円です.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:190 src/bookkeeping/closing.md:183
#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:151 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:154
#: src/io/output.md:155
msgid ""
"-- | Add adjustments under distinct notes and check the resulting journal "
"again.\n"
msgstr "-- | 異なる摘要で決算整理仕訳を加え, できた仕訳帳を再検査します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:197 src/bookkeeping/closing.md:190
#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:158 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:161
#: src/io/output.md:162
msgid "\"Defer February rent\""
msgstr "\"Defer February rent\""

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:198 src/bookkeeping/closing.md:191
#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:159 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:162
#: src/io/output.md:163
msgid "\"Ending inventory\""
msgstr "\"Ending inventory\""

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:203
msgid ""
"Use `Entries.cogsAdjustmentEntries` with a `MkBase` that fills in `Yen`, "
"because the entry builder accepts the existing account-and-currency base "
"while retaining all its elements. Its arguments are the beginning and ending "
"inventory amounts, not the purchases total. A zero beginning inventory "
"produces no zero-valued terms. The builder returns only additional terms, "
"without implicit `bar` or `compress`; attach a note and add them to the "
"journal with `.+`."
msgstr ""
"`Entries.cogsAdjustmentEntries` に, 単位を `Yen` とする `MkBase` を渡してくだ"
"さい. この関数は, 勘定科目と通貨を持つ既存の基底をそのまま受け取るため, 基底"
"の要素をすべて保って決算整理仕訳を生成できます. 引数は期首商品棚卸高と期末商"
"品棚卸高であり, 仕入高ではありません. 期首商品棚卸高が 0 の場合, 値が 0 の項"
"は生成しません. 関数が返すのは追加する項だけです. 暗黙に `bar` や `compress` "
"は適用しません. 摘要を付け, `.+` で仕訳帳に加えてください."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:205
msgid "Check and inspect the adjusted journal"
msgstr "決算整理後の仕訳帳の検査と点検"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:214
msgid "\"Rent adjustment\""
msgstr "\"Rent adjustment\""

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:215
msgid "\"Inventory adjustment\""
msgstr "\"Inventory adjustment\""

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:220
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o adjustment-example`, then "
"run `./adjustment-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"adjustment-example` を実行し, 続けて `./adjustment-example` を実行してくださ"
"い. プログラムは次の結果を出力します:"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:241
msgid ""
"The rent and inventory adjustments remain separately selectable under their "
"January 31 notes. Checking the journal again checks their debit-credit "
"equality along with the original entries. The adjusted trial balance has "
"PrepaidExpenses of 600 yen, MerchandiseInventory of 200 yen, Purchases of "
"300 yen, and RentExpense of 600 yen. Balance totals remain 12,000 yen on "
"each side; gross term totals increase to 21,000 yen because the added "
"entries remain in the record."
msgstr ""
"家賃と商品の決算整理仕訳は, それぞれの 1 月 31 日の摘要で個別に選べます. 再検"
"査では, 元の仕訳とともに, 追加した仕訳の貸借の一致を検査します. 決算整理後の"
"試算表には, PrepaidExpenses が 600 円, MerchandiseInventory が 200 円, "
"Purchases が 300 円, RentExpense が 600 円残ります. 残高の合計は貸借ともに "
"12,000 円のままです. 追加した仕訳が記録に残るため, 借方合計と貸方合計はそれぞ"
"れ 21,000 円に増えます."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:243
msgid ""
"Pass the adjusted trial balance to `Audit.temporaryAccountBalances`, the "
"audit for suspense accounts. With the built-in chart, it returns `Warning` "
"if suspense payments, suspense receipts, or the suspense account still have "
"a balance after adjustment. The example prints `Temporary account balances: "
"NoProblem`."
msgstr ""
"決算整理後の試算表を, 仮払金などの残高を調べる監査関数 "
"`Audit.temporaryAccountBalances` に渡してください. 既定の勘定科目では, 決算整"
"理後も仮払金, 仮受金, 仮勘定のいずれかに残高があれば `Warning` を返します. こ"
"の例の出力は `Temporary account balances: NoProblem` です."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:251
msgid "`Entries.MkBase b`"
msgstr "`Entries.MkBase b`"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:251
msgid "A function from Hat/Not and account title to the chosen base."
msgstr "Hat/Not と勘定科目を受け取り, 選んだ基底を返す関数です."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:252
msgid "`Entries.cogsAdjustmentEntries mk beginning ending`"
msgstr "`Entries.cogsAdjustmentEntries mk beginning ending`"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:252
msgid ""
"Return the periodic inventory adjustment; supply non-negative finite amounts "
"in the same unit."
msgstr ""
"三分法による商品の決算整理仕訳を返します. 同じ単位で非負かつ有限の金額を渡し"
"てください."

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:253
