msgstr "`transferEntries table ledger`"

#: src/bookkeeping/adjustment.md:253
msgid ""
"Return the additional rent reclassification entry, or a checked transfer "
"error."
msgstr ""
"家賃を振り替える追加の仕訳, または振替の検査で見つかったエラーを返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:3
msgid ""
"Prepare January’s closing entries after the rent and inventory adjustments "
"in [Adjusting entries](adjustment.md#admit-and-inspect-the-adjusted-"
"journal). Sales of 2,000 yen less cost of goods sold of 300 yen and rent "
"expense of 600 yen give a profit of 1,100 yen. Transfer the revenue and "
"expense balances to retained earnings, the equity account that accumulates "
"undistributed profits."
msgstr ""
"[決算整理仕訳](adjustment.md#admit-and-inspect-the-adjusted-journal)で家賃と"
"商品を整理してから, 1 月の決算振替仕訳を作ります. 売上 2,000 円から売上原価 "
"300 円と家賃 600 円を差し引くと, 当期利益は 1,100 円です. 収益と費用の残高"
"を, 未処分の利益を蓄積する純資産の勘定である繰越利益剰余金へ振り替えます."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:7
msgid "Recover the adjusted journal"
msgstr "決算整理後の仕訳帳の取り出し"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:9
msgid ""
"The program begins with the code from [Adjusting entries]"
"(adjustment.md#defer-rent-and-count-inventory) and the chapters before it."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは, [決算整理仕訳](adjustment.md#defer-rent-and-count-inventory)と"
"それまでの章で説明したコードから始まります."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:165
msgid "\"Closing residuals\""
msgstr "\"Closing residuals\""

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:198
msgid "Generate closing entries"
msgstr "決算振替仕訳の生成"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:200
msgid ""
"`Closing.closingEntries` reads the ledger through the closing date and "
"returns only additional entries. For each eligible account-and-currency "
"base, it computes the exact net, reverses that balance, and adds a term with "
"the matching amount to `RetainedEarnings`. Other elements of the base are "
"preserved. It sums source balances internally, without calling `bar`; "
"separate contributions from different expense and revenue accounts remain "
"separate terms."
msgstr ""
"`Closing.closingEntries` は決算振替日までの記録を読み, 追加する仕訳だけを返し"
"ます. 決算振替の対象となる勘定科目と通貨の基底ごとに, 厳密な残高を求め, その"
"残高を取り消す項と, 対応する金額を `RetainedEarnings` に振り替える項を生成し"
"ます. 基底の他の要素は保ちます. 内部で元の残高を集計しますが, `bar` は呼びま"
"せん. 費用と収益の各勘定から生じた振替先の項は, 別々のまま残ります."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:202
msgid ""
"See [Account titles and their attributes](../accounts/attributes.md) for the "
"closing rule and division used to select accounts for transfer to "
"`RetainedEarnings`."
msgstr ""
"`RetainedEarnings` への振替の対象を選ぶ締めの規則と区分は[勘定科目と属性](../"
"accounts/attributes.md)を参照してください."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:205 src/bookkeeping/statements.md:165
#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:168 src/io/output.md:169
msgid ""
"-- | Generate additional closing entries from the adjusted ledger, then "
"check the resulting journal.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 決算整理後の記録から決算振替仕訳を生成し, 追加後の仕訳帳を検査します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:210 src/bookkeeping/statements.md:170
#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:173 src/io/output.md:174
msgid "\"Close January\""
msgstr "\"Close January\""

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:215
msgid ""
"For Sales, debit 2,000 yen by reversing its `Not` balance with `Hat`, and "
"credit RetainedEarnings. For Purchases and RentExpense, credit 300 and 600 "
"yen to cancel their debit balances, and debit RetainedEarnings for the same "
"amounts. RetainedEarnings therefore has credits of 2,000 yen and debits of "
"900 yen, leaving a credit balance of 1,100 yen. With the built-in chart, "
"`closingEntries` transfers those revenue and expense balances directly to "
"`RetainedEarnings`."
msgstr ""
"売上は `Not` の残高を `Hat` で取り消して 2,000 円を借記し, 繰越利益剰余金を貸"
"記します. 仕入と支払家賃は, 借方残高を消すために 300 円と 600 円を貸記し, 同"
"額を繰越利益剰余金に借記します. 繰越利益剰余金は貸方 2,000 円, 借方 900 円と"
"なり, 貸方残高は 1,100 円です. 既定の勘定科目を使うと, `closingEntries` は収"
"益と費用の残高を `RetainedEarnings` へ直接振り替えます."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:217
msgid "Inspect the post-closing trial balance"
msgstr "繰越試算表を点検する"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:230
msgid "\"Closing entries\""
msgstr "\"Closing entries\""

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:233
msgid "\"Closing again\""
msgstr "\"Closing again\""

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:236
msgid ""
"Run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o closing-example`, then run "
"`./closing-example` in your project directory. The program prints:"
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"closing-example` を実行し, 続けて `./closing-example` を実行してください. プ"
"ログラムは次の結果を出力します:"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:257
msgid ""
"Sales, Purchases, and RentExpense each have `NoBalance`; their original and "
"closing terms remain in the columns for debit and credit totals. Cash, "
"Deposits, PrepaidExpenses, and MerchandiseInventory total 11,100 yen on the "
"debit side. CapitalStock of 10,000 yen and RetainedEarnings of 1,100 yen "
"total 11,100 yen on the credit side. Only assets and equity have balances in "
"this example; there are no liabilities."
msgstr ""
"Sales, Purchases, RentExpense はすべて `NoBalance` になります. 元の項と決算振"
"替仕訳の項は借方合計と貸方合計に含まれます. Cash, Deposits, PrepaidExpenses, "
"MerchandiseInventory を合わせた借方残高は 11,100 円です. CapitalStock の "
"10,000 円と RetainedEarnings の 1,100 円を合わせた貸方残高も 11,100 円です. "
"この例では資産と純資産だけに残高があり, 負債はありません."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:259
msgid ""
"Pass the post-closing trial balance to `Audit.closingResiduals`. It reports "
"`Error` if an account that closing must clear still has a balance. The "
"example prints `Closing residuals: NoProblem` and `Closing again: Right 0`. "
"Keep the checked closed journal with all dated entries as the record, since "
"the balance report does not preserve the individual entries."
msgstr ""
"決算振替後の試算表を `Audit.closingResiduals` に渡してください. 決算振替で残"
"高を消すべき科目に残高があれば `Error` を返します. この例の出力は `Closing "
"residuals: NoProblem` と `Closing again: Right 0` です. 残高報告の数値だけで"
"は個々の仕訳をたどれないため, すべての日付付き仕訳を含む検査済みの決算後仕訳"
"帳を記録として保存してください."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:267
msgid "`Closing.closingEntries ledger`"
msgstr "`Closing.closingEntries ledger`"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:267
msgid ""
"Return additional entries to RetainedEarnings, or `Left` for an invalid "
"eligible balance."
msgstr ""
"RetainedEarnings への追加の仕訳を返します. 対象の残高が不正な場合は `Left` を"
"返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:268
msgid "`Audit.closingResiduals ledger`"
msgstr "`Audit.closingResiduals ledger`"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:268
msgid ""
"Audit a post-closing trial balance for balances that closing must clear, "
"including revenue and expense balances."
msgstr ""
"決算振替後の試算表で, 収益や費用など決算振替で消すべき残高を検査します."

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:269
msgid "`additions .\\| note` and `journal .+ closingJournal`"
msgstr "`additions .\\| note` と `journal .+ closingJournal`"

#: src/bookkeeping/closing.md:269
msgid ""
"Attach a closing note to the additions, then add them to the adjusted "
"journal."
msgstr "追加する仕訳に締めの摘要を付け, 決算整理後の仕訳帳に加えます."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:3
msgid ""
"The shop needs an income statement for January and a balance sheet at "
"January 31. The income statement measures the revenue and expenses for the "
"month. The balance sheet shows the assets, liabilities, and equity at the "
"end of the month."
msgstr ""
"店は, 1 月の損益計算書と 1 月 31 日時点の貸借対照表を作ります. 損益計算書は, "
"1 か月の収益と費用を示します. 貸借対照表は, 月末時点の資産, 負債, 純資産を示"
"します."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:5 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:5
#: src/io/input.md:5 src/io/output.md:5
msgid ""
"Use exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1 in the project prepared in [Add the package to a "
"Stack project](../usage/installation.md#add-the-package-to-a-stack-project). "
"Save the Haskell blocks in their displayed order as `Main.hs`."
msgstr ""
"[Stack プロジェクトにパッケージを追加する](../usage/installation.md#add-the-"
"package-to-a-stack-project)で用意したプロジェクトで exchangealgebra-0.7.0.1 "
"を使います. Haskell のコードブロックを表示順に `Main.hs` に保存してください."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:7
msgid "Select the January balances"
msgstr "1 月の残高の選択"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:9
msgid ""
"Start with the records from [Closing entries](closing.md). Prepare the "
"income statement from the balances after the rent and inventory adjustments "
"and before recording closing entries. Keep the journal with the closing "
"entries for the balance sheet. Both reports use `HatBase AccountTitles`. The "
"conversion to that base checks that every term is in yen before removing the "
"currency element."
msgstr ""
"[決算振替](closing.md)の記録を使います. 損益計算書は, 家賃と商品の決算整理"
"後, 決算振替前の残高から作成します. 貸借対照表には, 決算振替仕訳を加えた仕訳"
"帳を使います. どちらの表も基底は `HatBase AccountTitles` です. この基底へ移す"
"前に, すべての項が円建てであることを確認し, 通貨の要素を外します."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:177
msgid "Build the income statement"
msgstr "損益計算書の作成"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:179
msgid ""
"Pass the adjusted ledger to `Statements.present` with `BeforeClosing`. "
"`jcciSecondGradeContext Standalone` starts with the Japanese GAAP "
"presentation context for one entity. Choose `CanonicalEnglish` for English "
"display labels. The presentation classifies the lines into sections such as "
"revenue and expenses."
msgstr ""
"決算整理後の記録を `BeforeClosing` とともに `Statements.present` に渡してくだ"
"さい. `jcciSecondGradeContext Standalone` は, 日本の会計基準で個別財務諸表を"
"表示するための設定を返します. 表示名を英語にするには `CanonicalEnglish` を選"
"びます. 表示では, 明細を収益や費用などの区分に分けます."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:181
msgid ""
"After the periodic inventory adjustment, the 300-yen balance of `Purchases` "
"represents the cost of goods sold. Use `PresentationRelabel` to display that "
"balance under `SalesCost`. The relabeling applies to the statement. The "
"adjusted journal still carries the balance under `Purchases`."
msgstr ""
"三分法で商品を決算整理すると, `Purchases` の残高 300 円は売上原価になります. "
"`PresentationRelabel` でこの残高を `SalesCost` として表示してください. 科目の"
"付け替えは財務諸表の表示に適用されます. 決算整理後の仕訳帳では, 引き続き "
"`Purchases` に残高があります."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:183
msgid ""
"`periodResultOf` computes the difference between revenue and expenses as a "
"reporting projection. `PeriodResult` distinguishes profit, loss, and break-"
"even, with a nonnegative magnitude for profit or loss. `present` also "
"produces a period-result subtotal from the before-closing ledger. Both "
"operations accumulate balances internally and leave the terms intact."
msgstr ""
"`periodResultOf` は, 表示のための射影として収益と費用の差額を計算します. "
"`PeriodResult` は利益, 損失, 損益ゼロを区別し, 利益と損失には非負の金額を持ち"
"ます. `present` も決算振替前の記録から当期損益の小計を作ります. どちらの演算"
"も内部で残高を集計し, 元の項を保ちます."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:186 src/io/output.md:180
msgid "-- | Choose English labels for the shop's standalone statements.\n"
msgstr "-- | 店の個別財務諸表には英語の表示名を使います.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:190 src/io/output.md:184
msgid ""
"-- | Present the adjusted Purchases balance under the cost-of-sales title.\n"
msgstr "-- | 決算整理後の Purchases の残高を売上原価として表示します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:195 src/io/output.md:189
msgid "\"Periodic inventory adjustment\""
msgstr "\"Periodic inventory adjustment\""

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:197
msgid ""
"-- | Use the adjusted ledger to retain January's revenue and expense "
"balances.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 決算整理を終え, 締める前の記録を使います. 1 月の収益と費用に残高がありま"
"す.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:210
msgid "\"Period result\""
msgstr "\"Period result\""

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:213
msgid "Build the balance sheet"
msgstr "貸借対照表の作成"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:215
msgid ""
"Present the closed ledger with `AfterClosing`. The January result is already "
"in `RetainedEarnings`. The balance sheet uses the asset, liability, and "
"equity sections. The totals in the program sum the displayed magnitudes for "
"the shop, whose balances are on their normal sides and have no deduction "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"決算振替後の記録を `AfterClosing` で表示してください. 1 月の当期損益はすでに "
"`RetainedEarnings` に振り替えられています. 貸借対照表には資産, 負債, 純資産の"
"区分を使います. この店では各残高が通常の側にあり, 控除項目がないため, プログ"
"ラムは表示額を足して合計を求めます."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:218 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:179
msgid "-- | Print the balance-sheet lines and totals for this example.\n"
msgstr "-- | 例の貸借対照表の明細と合計を表示します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:234 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:195
msgid "\"Total assets\""
msgstr "\"Total assets\""

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:236 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:197
msgid "\"Total liabilities and equity\""
msgstr "\"Total liabilities and equity\""

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:238 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:199
msgid ""
"-- | Keep the displayed section, account label, side, and magnitude "
"visible.\n"
msgstr "-- | 表示区分, 科目名, 借方と貸方の別, 金額を表示します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:249
msgid "Inspect both statements"
msgstr "損益計算書と貸借対照表の確認"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:267
msgid ""
"In your project directory, run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"statements-example`, then run `./statements-example`."
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"statements-example` を実行し, 続けて `./statements-example` を実行してくださ"
"い."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:269
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Income statement for January (yen)\n"
"RevenueSection \"Sales\" Credit 2000\n"
"ExpenseSection \"Cost of sales\" Debit 300\n"
"ExpenseSection \"Rent\" Debit 600\n"
"Period result: PeriodProfit 1100\n"
"\n"
"Balance sheet at January 31 (yen)\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Cash\" Debit 5300\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Savings deposits\" Debit 5000\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Merchandise inventory\" Debit 200\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Prepaid expenses\" Debit 600\n"
"Total assets: 11100\n"
"EquitySection \"Capital stock\" Credit 10000\n"
"EquitySection \"Retained earnings brought forward\" Credit 1100\n"
"Total liabilities and equity: 11100\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Income statement for January (yen)\n"
"RevenueSection \"Sales\" Credit 2000\n"
"ExpenseSection \"Cost of sales\" Debit 300\n"
"ExpenseSection \"Rent\" Debit 600\n"
"Period result: PeriodProfit 1100\n"
"\n"
"Balance sheet at January 31 (yen)\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Cash\" Debit 5300\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Savings deposits\" Debit 5000\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Merchandise inventory\" Debit 200\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Prepaid expenses\" Debit 600\n"
"Total assets: 11100\n"
"EquitySection \"Capital stock\" Credit 10000\n"
"EquitySection \"Retained earnings brought forward\" Credit 1100\n"
"Total liabilities and equity: 11100\n"
"```"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:287
msgid ""
"Sales of 2,000 yen less cost of goods sold of 300 yen and rent of 600 yen "
"leave net income of 1,100 yen. At January 31, assets total 11,100 yen. "
"Liabilities are zero. Capital stock of 10,000 yen and the 1,100 yen shown as "
"“Retained earnings brought forward” make up the 11,100 yen in equity."
msgstr ""
"売上 2,000 円から売上原価 300 円と支払家賃 600 円を引くと, 当期純利益は "
"1,100 円です. 1 月 31 日の資産合計は 11,100 円です. 負債は 0 円です. 純資産 "
"11,100 円の内訳は, 資本金 10,000 円と「Retained earnings brought forward」と"
"表示される繰越利益剰余金 1,100 円です."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:295
msgid "`present context stage ledger`"
msgstr "`present context stage ledger`"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:295
msgid ""
"Prepare statement lines, subtotals, and presentation events. `BeforeClosing` "
"includes the period result. Run the [trial balance audits](trial-"
"balance.md#reference) separately to detect impossible or abnormal balances."
msgstr ""
"財務諸表の明細, 小計, 表示上の処理の記録を作ります. `BeforeClosing` では当期"
"損益を含めます. あり得ない側や通常と反対側にある残高は, [試算表の監査](trial-"
"balance.md#reference)で別途調べてください."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:296
msgid "`jcciSecondGradeContext scope` and `PresentationProfile`"
msgstr "`jcciSecondGradeContext scope` と `PresentationProfile`"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:296
msgid ""
"Start with the JCCI grade-2 profile. Set `_presentationProfile` to "
"`CanonicalJapanese` or `CanonicalEnglish` to use canonical labels."
msgstr ""
"日商簿記 2 級の表示設定を初期値にします. 標準の科目名で表示するには, "
"`_presentationProfile` に `CanonicalJapanese` または `CanonicalEnglish` を指"
"定します."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:297
msgid "`ReportingContext`"
msgstr "`ReportingContext`"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:297
msgid ""
"Supply reporting instructions such as `PresentationRelabel` or "
"`PresentationAllocation`. An allocation splits an asset or liability balance "
"between current and noncurrent sections and requires evidence."
msgstr ""
"表示指示として `PresentationRelabel` や `PresentationAllocation` などを指定し"
"ます. 資産や負債の残高を流動と固定に分ける配分には, 根拠が必要です."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:298
msgid "`periodResultOf stage ledger`"
msgstr "`periodResultOf stage ledger`"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:298
msgid ""
"Derive `PeriodProfit`, `PeriodLoss`, or `PeriodBreakEven` from a before-"
"closing ledger. `AfterClosing` returns `MetricNotAvailableAtStage`."
msgstr ""
"決算振替前の記録から `PeriodProfit`, `PeriodLoss`, `PeriodBreakEven` のいずれ"
"かを求めます. `AfterClosing` では `MetricNotAvailableAtStage` を返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:299
msgid "`defaultPresentationGrouping` and `presentGroups`"
msgstr "`defaultPresentationGrouping` と `presentGroups`"

#: src/bookkeeping/statements.md:299
msgid ""
"For group-based displays, pass the default groups and gross debit and credit "
"totals by title to `presentGroups`. To change group membership or "
"deductions, supply your own list of `PresentationGroupDef` values. This "
"operation is separate from the sections produced by `present`."
msgstr ""
"表示グループを使うときは, 既定のグループと科目ごとの借方合計と貸方合計を "
"`presentGroups` に渡します. グループに含める科目や控除項目を変えるには, 独自"
"の `PresentationGroupDef` の一覧を渡します. この演算は, `present` が作る表示"
"区分とは別です."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:3
msgid ""
"On February 1, the shop uses 3,000 yen from its bank deposits to form a "
"wholly owned subsidiary. Prepare an opening consolidated balance sheet at "
"that date from the two companies’ trial balances. A consolidation worksheet "
"keeps the two source balances and the group adjustments "
"(`WorksheetAdjustment`) as separate inputs."
msgstr ""
"2 月 1 日に, 店は普通預金から 3,000 円を出資して完全子会社を設立します. 両社"
"の試算表から, 設立時点の連結貸借対照表を作ります. 連結精算表には, 両社の試算"
"表と連結修正仕訳 (`WorksheetAdjustment`) を別々に入力します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:7
msgid "Prepare the two trial balances"
msgstr "親会社と子会社の試算表の準備"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:9
msgid ""
"Carry forward the shop’s January balance-sheet amounts from [Build the "
"balance sheet](statements.md#build-the-balance-sheet). The program checks "
"that the January ledger is in yen before dropping the currency element. Both "
"February entries use the resulting reporting base, `HatBase AccountTitles`, "
"with amounts in yen."
msgstr ""
"[貸借対照表の作成](statements.md#build-the-balance-sheet)で求めた店の 1 月の"
"残高を繰り越します. プログラムは, 1 月の記録が円建てであることを確認してから"
"通貨の要素を外します. 2 月の両社の仕訳は, 通貨の要素を外した `HatBase "
"AccountTitles` を基底に使い, 金額は円で記録します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:212
msgid ""
"In the parent’s books, debit subsidiary shares and credit deposits for 3,000 "
"yen. In the parent’s standalone balance sheet, `SubsidiaryStocks` represents "
"subsidiary shares carried at acquisition cost, with no equity-method "
"adjustment. In the subsidiary’s books, debit cash and credit capital stock "
"for 3,000 yen. Use `bar` to obtain the parent’s February 1 balances, then "
"identify each entity’s balances with a `TrialBalanceSource`."
msgstr ""
"親会社は, 子会社株式を借方に, 普通預金を貸方に 3,000 円ずつ記入します. 親会社"
"の個別貸借対照表では, 子会社株式を `SubsidiaryStocks` に取得原価で計上し, 持"
"分法による調整は行いません. 子会社は, 現金を借方に, 資本金を貸方に 3,000 円ず"
"つ記入します. `bar` で親会社の 2 月 1 日時点の残高を求め, 両社の残高に "
"`TrialBalanceSource` で会社の識別子を付けます."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:215
msgid ""
"-- | Parent and subsidiary trial balances immediately after the February 1 "
"contribution.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 月 1 日の出資直後の親会社と子会社の試算表です.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:219 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:238
msgid "\"shop\""
msgstr "\"shop\""

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:220 src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:238
msgid "\"subsidiary\""
msgstr "\"subsidiary\""

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:229
msgid "Eliminate the investment and subsidiary capital"
msgstr "投資と資本の相殺消去"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:231
msgid ""
"The parent’s subsidiary shares and the subsidiary’s capital stock record the "
"same contribution within the group. Eliminate them with a debit to "
"`CapitalStock` and a credit to `SubsidiaryStocks`, each for 3,000 yen. Both "
"terms decrease a balance, so both use `Hat`. Record the entry as a "
"`WorksheetAdjustment` linked to both companies. The adjustment belongs to "
"the consolidated worksheet."
msgstr ""
"親会社の子会社株式と子会社の資本金は, グループ内の同じ出資を表します. "
"`CapitalStock` を借方に, `SubsidiaryStocks` を貸方に 3,000 円ずつ記入して相殺"
"消去します. どちらの項も残高を減らすため, `Hat` を使います. この仕訳を両社に"
"ひも付けた `WorksheetAdjustment` として連結精算表に記録します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:234
msgid ""
"-- | Debit the subsidiary's capital and credit the parent's investment.\n"
msgstr "-- | 子会社の資本金を借方に, 親会社の子会社株式を貸方に記入します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:237
msgid "\"investment against subsidiary capital\""
msgstr "\"investment against subsidiary capital\""

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:243
msgid "Link the statement columns"
msgstr "財務諸表の欄を結びつける"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:245
msgid ""
"Supply the period result, its attribution, and the equity roll-forwards in a "
"`WorksheetLinkage`. February’s result is zero at incorporation. January’s "
"1,100 yen is February’s opening retained earnings. With zero dividends and a "
"zero February result, the closing figure used in the roll-forward and the "
"balance-sheet figure are also 1,100 yen at the reporting date. The parent "
"owns all the shares, so the noncontrolling-interest fields have zero amounts "
"or `NoBalance`."
msgstr ""
"`WorksheetLinkage` に当期損益, その帰属額, 純資産の期首から報告時点までの増減"
"を指定します. 設立時点の 2 月の当期損益はゼロです. 1 月の 1,100 円は, 2 月の"
"期首繰越利益剰余金になります. 配当も 2 月の当期損益もゼロなので, 増減計算後の"
"残高と貸借対照表の残高はいずれも報告時点で 1,100 円です. 親会社が全株式を保有"
"するため, 非支配株主持分の各欄にはゼロまたは `NoBalance` を指定します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:247
msgid ""
"`validateConsolidationWorksheet` checks the balance of each source and "
"adjustment, the adjustment’s source IDs and permitted accounts, and the "
"equations among the supplied linkage figures. Cross-check those figures "
"against the statement balances separately. The example takes retained "
"earnings from the January ledger and checks the consolidated balances after "
"combining."
msgstr ""
"`validateConsolidationWorksheet` は, 各試算表と各修正仕訳の貸借一致, 修正仕訳"
"が参照する会社の識別子と使用できる科目, 入力した金額どうしの等式を検査しま"
"す. 入力した金額と財務諸表の残高は別途照合してください. 例では 1 月の記録から"
"繰越利益剰余金を取り出し, 合算した後で連結残高を確認します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:250
msgid ""
"-- | Link February's opening and reporting balances at the formation date.\n"
msgstr "-- | 2 月の期首残高と設立時点の報告残高を照合します.\n"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:268
msgid "Inspect the consolidated balance sheet"
msgstr "連結貸借対照表の確認"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:270
msgid ""
"`combinedWorksheet` adds the two trial balances and the elimination with `."
"+`, retaining terms on the same base. Apply `bar` explicitly to inspect the "
"net totals, and present the combined ledger as a `Combined` balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"`combinedWorksheet` は両社の試算表と相殺消去の仕訳を `.+` で加え, 同じ基底の"
"項を並べて保ちます. 正味残高の合計を確かめるときは `bar` を明示して適用し, 合"
"算した記録は `Combined` で連結貸借対照表として表示します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:299
msgid ""
"In your project directory, run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"consolidation-example`, then run `./consolidation-example`."
msgstr ""
"プロジェクトのディレクトリで `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"consolidation-example` を実行し, 続けて `./consolidation-example` を実行して"
"ください."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:301
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"Combined net totals (debit, credit): (11100,11100)\n"
"Investment balance: NoBalance\n"
"Group capital stock: CreditBalance 10000\n"
"\n"
"Opening consolidated balance sheet at February 1 (yen)\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Cash\" Debit 8300\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Savings deposits\" Debit 2000\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Merchandise inventory\" Debit 200\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Prepaid expenses\" Debit 600\n"
"Total assets: 11100\n"
"EquitySection \"Capital stock\" Credit 10000\n"
"EquitySection \"Retained earnings brought forward\" Credit 1100\n"
"Total liabilities and equity: 11100\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```text\n"
"Combined net totals (debit, credit): (11100,11100)\n"
"Investment balance: NoBalance\n"
"Group capital stock: CreditBalance 10000\n"
"\n"
"Opening consolidated balance sheet at February 1 (yen)\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Cash\" Debit 8300\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Savings deposits\" Debit 2000\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Merchandise inventory\" Debit 200\n"
"CurrentAssetsSection \"Prepaid expenses\" Debit 600\n"
"Total assets: 11100\n"
"EquitySection \"Capital stock\" Credit 10000\n"
"EquitySection \"Retained earnings brought forward\" Credit 1100\n"
"Total liabilities and equity: 11100\n"
"```"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:317
msgid ""
"The investment has no remaining balance. Capital stock is 10,000 yen, the "
"parent’s own capital. The group shows cash of 8,300 yen and deposits of "
"2,000 yen. Together with inventory of 200 yen and prepaid expenses of 600 "
"yen, assets total 11,100 yen. Liabilities are zero. The “Retained earnings "
"brought forward” line shows 1,100 yen, bringing total equity to 11,100 yen."
msgstr ""
"投資の残高は 0 円です. 資本金は親会社の資本金 10,000 円です. 連結後の現金は "
"8,300 円, 預金は 2,000 円です. 棚卸資産 200 円と前払費用 600 円を加えると, 資"
"産合計は 11,100 円です. 負債は 0 円です. 「Retained earnings brought "
"forward」と表示される繰越利益剰余金は 1,100 円で, 純資産合計は 11,100 円です."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:325
msgid "`TrialBalanceSource`"
msgstr "`TrialBalanceSource`"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:325
msgid ""
"Identify one entity and supply its balanced trial balance over `HatBase "
"AccountTitles`."
msgstr ""
"会社を識別し, `HatBase AccountTitles` を基底とする貸借の一致した試算表を渡し"
"ます."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:326
msgid "`WorksheetAdjustment`"
msgstr "`WorksheetAdjustment`"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:326
msgid ""
"Supply an independently balanced adjustment with its own ID and the nonempty "
"list of source IDs it affects."
msgstr ""
"調整の識別子, 貸借の一致した修正仕訳, 影響を受ける会社の識別子を 1 件以上渡し"
"ます."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:327
msgid "`WorksheetLinkage`"
msgstr "`WorksheetLinkage`"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:327
msgid ""
"Supply the period result and its attribution, and reconcile opening "
"balances, period movements, dividends, and closing balances for retained "
"earnings and noncontrolling interests."
msgstr ""
"当期損益とその帰属額を渡します. 繰越利益剰余金と非支配株主持分について, 期首"
"残高, 当期の増減, 配当, 期末残高を照合します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:328
msgid "`validateConsolidationWorksheet input`"
msgstr "`validateConsolidationWorksheet input`"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:328
msgid ""
"Validate the worksheet or return a nonempty list of `WorksheetError` values "
"identifying the rejected inputs."
msgstr ""
"連結精算表を検査します. 検査に通らなければ, 該当する入力を示す "
"`WorksheetError` を 1 件以上返します."

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:329
msgid "`combinedWorksheet`, `validatedSources`, and `validatedAdjustments`"
msgstr "`combinedWorksheet`, `validatedSources`, `validatedAdjustments`"

#: src/bookkeeping/consolidation.md:329
msgid ""
"Project the combined ledger, or retrieve the original source and adjustment "
"columns to trace each contribution."
msgstr ""
"合算した記録を射影します. 各項がどの会社や調整に由来するかをたどるときは, 元"
"の試算表と修正仕訳の列を取り出します."

#: src/io/input.md:3
msgid ""
"Import the shop’s January 28 cash sale and January 30 rent payment from CSV. "
"Both transactions are in yen, so the input uses `HatBase AccountTitles` with "
"the currency fixed for the file. The accepted journal retains a separate "
"note for each transaction."
msgstr ""
"店の 1 月 28 日の現金売上と 1 月 30 日の家賃支払いを CSV から読み込みます. ど"
"ちらの取引も円建てです. ファイル全体の通貨を円とし, 基底には `HatBase "
"AccountTitles` を使います. 検査を通った仕訳帳では, 取引ごとに摘要を保ちます."

#: src/io/input.md:7
msgid "Write one CSV row per term"
msgstr "項ごとの CSV 行の記入"

#: src/io/input.md:9
msgid ""
"Save the CSV as `january-import.csv` in the same directory as `Main.hs`. The "
"header gives the journal side, account title, amount, and optional note. Use "
"`debit` or `credit` for the side and an unsigned decimal amount without "
"thousands separators. Use the same nonempty note for every term in one "
"transaction and a distinct note for each other transaction. The parser trims "
"spaces around fields and skips blank lines and comment lines starting with "
"`#` after whitespace. Commas always separate fields, so keep commas out of "
"the notes."
msgstr ""
"CSV を `Main.hs` と同じディレクトリに `january-import.csv` として保存してくだ"
"さい. 見出しには, 借方と貸方の別, 勘定科目, 金額, 任意の摘要をこの順に書きま"
"す. 側には `debit` または `credit` を書き, 金額は桁区切りと符号を付けずに十進"
"数で書きます. 1 件の取引に属する項には同じ空でない摘要を書き, 別の取引には別"
"の摘要を付けます. 読み込み時には各欄の前後の空白を取り除き, 空行や先頭の空白"
"を除くと `#` で始まるコメント行を読み飛ばします. コンマは常に欄の区切りになる"
"ため, 摘要には含めないでください."

#: src/io/input.md:19
msgid ""
"For each line, the CSV parser resolves the account with `parseAccountTitle`. "
"It accepts canonical English names and registered aliases. `normalizeTitle` "
"lowercases the text, removes punctuation, and collapses whitespace before "
"lookup. For example, `A/R` normalizes to `ar` and resolves to "
"`AccountsReceivable`."
msgstr ""
"CSV を読むときは, 各行の勘定科目を `parseAccountTitle` で特定します. 標準の英"
"語名と登録済みの別名を使えます. 検索の前に `normalizeTitle` で文字を小文字に"
"し, 記号を取り除き, 空白を整理します. たとえば `A/R` は `ar` になり, "
"`AccountsReceivable` として読み込まれます."

#: src/io/input.md:21
msgid ""
"See [Account titles and their attributes](../accounts/attributes.md) for the "
"sources of the registered aliases."
msgstr ""
"登録された別名の出典は[勘定科目と属性](../accounts/attributes.md)を参照してく"
"ださい."

#: src/io/input.md:52
msgid "Check the imported journal"
msgstr "取り込んだ仕訳帳の検査"

#: src/io/input.md:54
msgid ""
"`parseJournalCsv` returns one algebra value with all the parsed terms. Its "
"debit and credit totals describe the file as a whole. To check transactions "
"individually, use `parseNotedJournalCsv` to retain the note column. Group "
"the rows by note and pass one group per transaction to `checkedJournal`. It "
"checks each group’s accounts, term amounts, and debit and credit totals "
"before constructing the journal."
msgstr ""
"`parseJournalCsv` は, 読み込んだ項を 1 つの代数の値として返します. 借方合計と"
"貸方合計はファイル全体の金額です. 取引ごとに検査するには, "
"`parseNotedJournalCsv` で摘要を残します. 行を摘要ごとにまとめ, 取引 1 件につ"
"き 1 組を `checkedJournal` に渡してください. 各組の勘定科目, 項の金額, 借方合"
"計と貸方合計を検査してから仕訳帳を作ります."

#: src/io/input.md:57
msgid ""
"-- | Group the parsed terms by transaction key, keeping the order within "
"each entry.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 読み込んだ項を取引の摘要でまとめ, 各仕訳の中で項の順序を保ちます.\n"

#: src/io/input.md:69
msgid ""
"-- | Require a transaction key on every CSV term before grouping by note.\n"
msgstr ""
"-- | 摘要でまとめる前に, CSV のすべての項に取引の摘要があることを確認しま"
"す.\n"

#: src/io/input.md:74
msgid "\"Missing transaction key in note\""
msgstr "\"Missing transaction key in note\""

#: src/io/input.md:78
msgid ""
"Compare the checked journal with the amounts from the sale and rent records "
"using `reconcileSources`. It reports absent or unexpected transaction keys "
"and compares the expected amount for each key with its debit total. Pass the "
"journal to `admit` to obtain the `Admitted` value described in [Checking a "
"journal](../bookkeeping/admission.md)."
msgstr ""
"売上と家賃の記録にある金額を, `reconcileSources` で検査後の仕訳帳と照合してく"
"ださい. 取引を識別する摘要について不足や余分なものを報告し, 摘要ごとに照合に"
"使う金額と借方合計を比べます. 仕訳帳を `admit` に渡すと, [仕訳帳の検査](../"
"bookkeeping/admission.md)で説明した`Admitted` の値が得られます."

#: src/io/input.md:105
msgid "Diagnose an unknown title and an unbalanced entry"
msgstr "未知の勘定科目と貸借不一致の診断"

#: src/io/input.md:107
msgid ""
"If the sale credit is spelled `Saels`, the CSV parser returns "
"`UnknownAccount`. For sources already represented as text triples, "
"`certifyJournalText` can report a balanced transaction with an unresolved "
"name as `BalancedUnresolved`. Correct the name before submitting the journal "
"for checking. If the sale credit is 1,900 yen against a 2,000-yen debit, "
"`checkedJournal` reports `Imbalanced` under the sale’s transaction key."
msgstr ""
"売上の貸方科目に `Saels` と書くと, CSV の読み込みは `UnknownAccount` を返しま"
"す. 入力が側と科目名の文字列および金額の組でそろっている場合, 貸借は一致して"
"いても科目を特定できないと, `certifyJournalText` は `BalancedUnresolved` を返"
"します. 仕訳帳を検査に渡す前に科目名を直してください. 売上の借方が 2,000 円で"
"貸方が 1,900 円なら, `checkedJournal` は売上の摘要に対して `Imbalanced` を返"
"します."

#: src/io/input.md:110
msgid ""
"-- | Show the results of a misspelled title and a separate amount error.\n"
msgstr "-- | 科目名の誤記と金額の誤りを別の例で示します.\n"

#: src/io/input.md:113
msgid "\"Normalized title: \""
msgstr "\"Normalized title: \""

#: src/io/input.md:113 src/io/input.md:114
