#: src/io/input.md:142
msgid ""
"The checked journal’s debit and credit totals are both 3,200 yen, and the "
"source comparison returns an empty list. The name and amount errors come "
"from the separate diagnostic examples."
msgstr ""
"検査を通った仕訳帳では, 借方合計と貸方合計はどちらも 3,200 円です. 証憑と照合"
"した結果は空の一覧です. 科目名と金額のエラーは, 診断用に別に用意した例から得"
"られます."

#: src/io/input.md:150
msgid "`parseJournalCsv` and `parseNotedJournalCsv`"
msgstr "`parseJournalCsv` と `parseNotedJournalCsv`"

#: src/io/input.md:150
msgid ""
"Parse fixed-schema CSV. The former returns one algebra value. The latter "
"takes an amount parser such as `scientificAmount` and returns individual "
"rows with notes."
msgstr ""
"固定の列構成を持つ CSV を読み込みます. 前者は 1 つの代数の値を返します. 後者"
"は `scientificAmount` などの金額を読む関数を受け取り, 摘要付きの行を返します."

#: src/io/input.md:151
msgid "`normalizeTitle` and `parseAccountTitle`"
msgstr "`normalizeTitle` と `parseAccountTitle`"

#: src/io/input.md:151
msgid ""
"Normalize names for lookup and resolve them to account titles. A name with "
"several matches returns `AmbiguousAccount` and its candidates."
msgstr ""
"検索用に科目名を整え, 対応する勘定科目を特定します. 複数の科目に一致すると, "
"`AmbiguousAccount` と候補を返します."

#: src/io/input.md:152
msgid "`checkedJournal`"
msgstr "`checkedJournal`"

#: src/io/input.md:152
msgid ""
"Build an ordinary journal from keyed entries with resolved titles. Duplicate "
"keys and invalid entries produce journal errors."
msgstr ""
"科目が確定した摘要付きの仕訳から通常の仕訳帳を作ります. 摘要が重複する場合や"
"無効な仕訳がある場合は, 仕訳帳のエラーを返します."

#: src/io/input.md:153
msgid "`certifyJournalText`"
msgstr "`certifyJournalText`"

#: src/io/input.md:153
msgid ""
"Certify entries supplied as side text, account text, and amount. The result "
"is `FullyResolved`, `BalancedUnresolved`, or `Rejected`."
msgstr ""
"側と科目名を文字列で受け取り, 金額と合わせて仕訳を検証します. 結果は "
"`FullyResolved`, `BalancedUnresolved`, `Rejected` のいずれかです."

#: src/io/input.md:154
msgid "`reconcileSources`"
msgstr "`reconcileSources`"

#: src/io/input.md:154
msgid ""
"Compare the transaction identifiers and amounts supplied by the "
"reconciliation source with the journal."
msgstr "照合元から渡された取引識別子と金額を仕訳帳と照合します."

#: src/io/input.md:155
msgid "`admit`"
msgstr "`admit`"

#: src/io/input.md:155
msgid ""
"Check the journal at the note level and return an `Admitted` value on "
"success."
msgstr "仕訳帳を摘要ごとに検査し, 検査を通ると `Admitted` の値を返します."

#: src/io/output.md:3
msgid ""
"The shop’s checked January journal contains the terms for its books. Its pre-"
"adjustment, adjusted, and closed versions supply the figures for the trial "
"balances, the worksheet, and the financial statements. Use the row builders "
"in `ExchangeAlgebra.IO.Output.Statements` to obtain text cells for each "
"report."
msgstr ""
"店が検査を通った 1 月の仕訳帳には, 帳簿に記載する項が入っています. 決算整理"
"前, 決算整理後, 決算振替後の記録から, 試算表, 精算表, 財務諸表に載せる金額を"
"求めます. `ExchangeAlgebra.IO.Output.Statements` の行を作る関数で, 各表を文字"
"列の欄に展開します."

#: src/io/output.md:7
msgid "Lay out the journal and general ledger by date"
msgstr "仕訳帳と総勘定元帳の日付順の表示"

#: src/io/output.md:9
msgid ""
"Reuse the yen conversion, journal checking, adjustments, closing entries, "
"and reporting context from [Financial statements](../bookkeeping/"
"statements.md). For the dated reports, select the original January entries "
"by the date in their notes. Check the amounts are in yen before replacing "
"the currency element with the date."
msgstr ""
"[財務諸表](../bookkeeping/statements.md)で使った円への換算, 仕訳帳の検査, 決"
"算整理, 決算振替, 表示設定を使います. 日付付きの表を作るには, 元の 1 月の仕訳"
"を摘要の日付で選びます. 円建てであることを確認してから, 通貨の要素を日付に置"
"き換えてください."

#: src/io/output.md:195
msgid ""
"Store each date as `Exactly day` in a `Wild Day` element. Pass the dated "
"terms and a function that extracts the concrete date to `journalRows` and "
"`accountLedgerRows`. Within each date and side, `journalRows` sorts terms by "
"account title and then by hat base. The general ledger groups terms by "
"account and orders each side by date. Request `Cash` to inspect the cash "
"account. Both reports retain the individual terms."
msgstr ""
"日付は `Wild Day` の要素 `Exactly day` として記録してください. 日付付きの項と"
"具体的な日付を取り出す関数を `journalRows` と `accountLedgerRows` に渡してく"
"ださい. `journalRows` は日付ごとに, 借方と貸方それぞれの項を勘定科目順, 次い"
"で Hat 基底順に並べます. 総勘定元帳は項を科目別に分け, 借方と貸方それぞれを日"
"付順に並べます. 現金勘定を確認するには `Cash` を指定してください. どちらの帳"
"簿にも個々の項が残ります."

#: src/io/output.md:198
msgid ""
"-- | Select one date while retaining the terms from every matching note.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 日を選び, その日に該当する摘要のすべての項を保ちます.\n"

#: src/io/output.md:203
msgid ""
"-- | Put the note's date on each term in the day selected for the dated "
"reports.\n"
msgstr "-- | 日付付きの表に使う項に, 摘要から選んだ日付を付けます.\n"

#: src/io/output.md:210
msgid "\"Expected a concrete date\""
msgstr "\"Expected a concrete date\""

#: src/io/output.md:211
msgid "\"Journal by day\""
msgstr "\"Journal by day\""

#: src/io/output.md:213
msgid "\"\\nGeneral ledger (Cash)\""
msgstr "\"\\nGeneral ledger (Cash)\""

#: src/io/output.md:217
msgid "\"2026-01-%02d\""
msgstr "\"2026-01-%02d\""

#: src/io/output.md:218
msgid "\"Invalid date \""
msgstr "\"Invalid date \""

#: src/io/output.md:225
msgid "Lay out the trial balances and worksheet"
msgstr "試算表と精算表の表示"

#: src/io/output.md:227
msgid ""
"Give `compoundTrialBalanceRows` the pre-adjustment ledger to display a trial "
"balance with debit and credit totals and net balances by account. Give "
"`worksheetRows` the same ledger and the separate rent and inventory "
"adjustments dated January 31. The eight-column worksheet shows debit and "
"credit pairs for the pre-adjustment trial balance (balances only), "
"adjustments, profit and loss, and balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"`compoundTrialBalanceRows` に決算整理前の記録を渡すと, 科目ごとの借方合計・貸"
"方合計と残高を併記する合計残高試算表が得られます. `worksheetRows` には, 同じ"
"記録と 1 月 31 日付の家賃と商品の決算整理仕訳を別々に渡します. 8 桁精算表は, "
"決算整理前の残高試算表, 整理記入, 損益計算書, 貸借対照表のそれぞれに借方と貸"
"方の列を設けます."

#: src/io/output.md:229
msgid ""
"Pass the ledger with closing entries to `postClosingTrialBalanceRows` to "
"display the post-closing trial balance. This report selects the asset, "
"liability, and equity accounts. The trial balance and worksheet row builders "
"compute their totals and net balances internally as reporting projections."
msgstr ""
"繰越試算表を表示するには, 決算振替後の記録を `postClosingTrialBalanceRows` に"
"渡してください. この表には資産, 負債, 純資産の科目を載せます. 試算表と精算表"
"の行を作る関数は, 表示のための射影として合計と正味残高を内部で計算します."

#: src/io/output.md:232
msgid ""
"-- | Use the January 31 adjusting entries separately from the pre-adjustment "
"ledger.\n"
msgstr "-- | 1 月 31 日の決算整理仕訳を, 決算整理前の記録と別に使います.\n"

#: src/io/output.md:238
msgid "\"\\nPre-adjustment compound trial balance\""
msgstr "\"\\nPre-adjustment compound trial balance\""

#: src/io/output.md:240
msgid "\"\\nEight-column worksheet\""
msgstr "\"\\nEight-column worksheet\""

#: src/io/output.md:242
msgid "\"\\nPost-closing trial balance\""
msgstr "\"\\nPost-closing trial balance\""

#: src/io/output.md:246
msgid "Select financial statement rows"
msgstr "財務諸表に載せる行の選択"

#: src/io/output.md:248
msgid ""
"Present balances after adjustments and before closing entries for the income "
"statement. Use the ledger with closing entries for the balance sheet. Pass "
"the revenue and expense sections to `financialStatementRows` for the income "
"statement, and the asset, liability, and equity sections for the balance "
"sheet. The `row` column distinguishes `line` from `subtotal`. Sum account "
"lines and use the subtotals as separate results to avoid counting the same "
"amounts twice."
msgstr ""
"損益計算書の表示には決算整理後かつ決算振替前の残高を使います. 貸借対照表には"
"決算振替後の記録を使います. `financialStatementRows` に, 損益計算書なら収益と"
"費用の区分を, 貸借対照表なら資産, 負債, 純資産の区分を渡してください. `row` "
"列は明細の `line` と小計の `subtotal` を区別します. 二重計上を避けるには科目"
"の明細を合計し, 小計は別個の結果として扱います."

#: src/io/output.md:251
msgid ""
"-- | Select the financial statement sections appropriate to each stage.\n"
msgstr "-- | 締め前と締め後のそれぞれに対応する財務諸表の区分を選びます.\n"

#: src/io/output.md:267
msgid "\"\\nIncome statement for January\""
msgstr "\"\\nIncome statement for January\""

#: src/io/output.md:269
msgid "\"\\nBalance sheet at January 31\""
msgstr "\"\\nBalance sheet at January 31\""

#: src/io/output.md:273
msgid "Inspect the text rows"
msgstr "文字列の行の確認"

#: src/io/output.md:275
msgid ""
"The program prints each report as lists of text cells on standard output. "
"The file writers in [Reference](#reference) serialize rows as CSV."
msgstr ""
"プログラムは, 各表を文字列の一覧にした行として標準出力に表示します. [リファレ"
"ンス](#reference)にある書き出し関数は, 行を CSV に変換して保存します."

#: src/io/output.md:290
msgid ""
"In your project directory, run `stack exec -- ghc -Wall -Werror Main.hs -o "
"output-example`, then run `./output-example`."
msgstr ""
