#: src/io/output.md:364
msgid ""
"The cash ledger shows the 2,000-yen sale as a debit on January 28. The "
"worksheet shows net income of 1,100 yen, which appears as a subtotal in the "
"income statement. In the post-closing trial balance, the carried balances "
"total 11,100 yen on each side."
msgstr ""
"現金勘定では, 1 月 28 日の売上 2,000 円が借方に載ります. 精算表で確認できる当"
"期純利益 1,100 円は, 損益計算書にも小計として出ます. 繰越試算表では, 繰り越す"
"残高の合計が借方と貸方ともに 11,100 円です."

